\nFallen off of Jollibee for some time due to their dry and small chicken across various Tarlac, Pampanga and Manila locations. But, this branch had juicy and large chicken pieces, accommodating staff, good atmosphere since it\'s located in a rural area, and clean seats.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-07-14T20:20:05.413912793Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Cesar Cambay\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLMMIddqbbEWVPAb28zenA2dXiEu4WWvHuQASeod-HQjdoUbw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:94:\"Fast service even during a crowded hours.\nToilets are clean and service crews are very polite.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-06-25T06:44:54.334046148Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Jagaimo -kun\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUJSUxB-15ZBt9zxZnckQISeNnwhFw8QrLky9hiepVy_nowlFcOmg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:182:\"Conveniently placed in the town\'s center.\nAlso has atm machines for more convenience.\nFood quality\'s the usual Jollibee fast food.\nLackluster but does the job. Core childhood memory.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-04-26T13:24:33.420700115Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:11:\"Marc Padlan\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUmyYMWrytpXRfYXa4vjGSr-VN0Cj7xG0B3XmcZpN7a1A28oomm=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:98:\"Overall experience was great. Mabait ang mga crew, guard and manager. Will come back anytime soon.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-07-09T07:20:46.286898747Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:22:\"Kisha Angeli Camannong\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:118:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX0iZmQTCoT7LRy6i8mJBU6ZL1O9BGsnyZc7Ro-ehXaC2QCHWo=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:200:\"The service crews and guards are very accommodating, the foods are goooood as a laking jabe kid, I am so happy when I am able to see the Jabe mascot. Overall, babalik-balikan talaga. Credits sa photos\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-07-22T13:07:18.496991379Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";s:96:\"Popular Philippines-based chain globally known for its famed fried chicken, spaghetti & burgers.\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:2;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJvaVkomBTkTMRZ48ivJ6E1MU\";s:4:\"name\";s:30:\"Jollibee Mangatarem Pangasinan\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.790291100000001;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.2937688;s:7:\"address\";s:65:\"Romulo Hwy, corner Burgos St, Mangatarem, Pangasinan, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:10:\"restaurant\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.1;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:349;s:7:\"reviews\";i:349;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:478:\"places/ChIJvaVkomBTkTMRZ48ivJ6E1MU/photos/AVoNoXTH4rC8brwmQYPSWQ_bqhZxFX8xuDoi0BHFquETArtogJQgTAl44L1ZEjnai_LDjf6m8Zq5ilRqkoc3jGjuVGaxXVewjpDC8YsKcDhIE1zgCl5LC4hxe9Q78n7k61IIeXPFtGrmb6HBSKv1htrI92egekb5tQO3kE1a7pfSpCzWl-KWmTZ2aRT-vjwylJoPoO_Chm2G2DGDiyxFg1mrHVGA1ebEwMxfAPb04ekKWqzTJ8MiKhjuLl6gLsTwMwqjTuopgIjBGh7fxSyc1RBOBgHfZIdZvKjPa5FjHgjif7UArYztbwXM2BFKK9D_POx0RCvVWegpp317eKRV_Yt0iYW6FeBIDHt7ljtVUDAcs5-qtQ2KVhKZF1aAITbSZK4LVmacn6KbFFWQpsSfjwQAKQEhtAHrRvR3tpgOyEcli9drEt7H\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:6:{i:0;s:478:\"places/ChIJvaVkomBTkTMRZ48ivJ6E1MU/photos/AVoNoXTH4rC8brwmQYPSWQ_bqhZxFX8xuDoi0BHFquETArtogJQgTAl44L1ZEjnai_LDjf6m8Zq5ilRqkoc3jGjuVGaxXVewjpDC8YsKcDhIE1zgCl5LC4hxe9Q78n7k61IIeXPFtGrmb6HBSKv1htrI92egekb5tQO3kE1a7pfSpCzWl-KWmTZ2aRT-vjwylJoPoO_Chm2G2DGDiyxFg1mrHVGA1ebEwMxfAPb04ekKWqzTJ8MiKhjuLl6gLsTwMwqjTuopgIjBGh7fxSyc1RBOBgHfZIdZvKjPa5FjHgjif7UArYztbwXM2BFKK9D_POx0RCvVWegpp317eKRV_Yt0iYW6FeBIDHt7ljtVUDAcs5-qtQ2KVhKZF1aAITbSZK4LVmacn6KbFFWQpsSfjwQAKQEhtAHrRvR3tpgOyEcli9drEt7H\";i:1;s:476:\"places/ChIJvaVkomBTkTMRZ48ivJ6E1MU/photos/AVoNoXSn0daqWv5ycMhjckp98jGHxPjqI8F1ih5HS6I_zjWKyPCqD4KmblmuUGZ5kqCvok4RojYLkzAukmVEE