4FvEdvDrFgZb3VamjrAIWEDoNYwM934_AZ_hgA_Y8FXte2t0OsbJSTOPKw4Y4v4zuIILJZgTxYDnq5sDEoas9xVAMfkaUAOzJTIqLy9fe6lYb9sqclQN2I3jpxg15amDTLnF4cpla3r4IAF8QpFWgAnxvRXw35qGChrMUMfVIwPGJ4dt5qJsETU3cHGKX0iGZA8xXEj5R9xhnMPiDMATIZsFqF_B5EDrhqf6pWD9kak7OCHlnAEII88XUdzOHhCZRddK3zUBtl8BIIQGMQsuQ3P53J5Ag5a6vaR1BwMMDoT-PDvEEXVO2gLzoOddWMnslnFVGHBw1q5zw\";}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:5:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:16:\"Hannah Benavidez\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUXE0NicM2a5Wt4J3wOyKytXAQOVyV1jCXINniSBX6wsVIPROHS=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:663:\"We loved Jollibee Mangatarem but now I am disappointed due to the crew\'s very unprofessional behavior by harassing us on the day of my father\'s interment. I was told by the branch manager that our order, which was placed 2 days in advance was due for a price increase on the day of the delivery. They kept on calling us during a very sensitive time despite them knowing that the order was for a funeral service. We\'re supposed to settle the bill after the service but they still kept on harassing me by calling me repeatedly during the interment. Your crew especially your managers are disappointing. They need more training on proper communication and etiquette.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-04-24T01:15:02.906485671Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"manolito niño\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUb2PApbfh3x6D9r4L-g0Z_4og8nENYA8xFzSaXTugNSbysTFmj=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:333:\"Good day\n\nIt\'s disappointing, not that I\'m criticizing Jollibee, I hope you fix the way the order is delivered, complete and complete, so that your customers won\'t be bothered and will come back to get the missing order, I hope your staff will fix it and take care of this complaint. Thank you so much for understanding my complaint.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-03-29T05:15:02.789615270Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:10:\"Jean Tames\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXtVZbuuCZiRTfn7c_P55tIsJuFyYxFU3RbmZayRTtF9TqwMvQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:97:\"Terrible customer service and food. The fries tasted like the oil was re-used countless times?\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-12-29T04:22:34.806322299Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:18:\"Brendan Reddington\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVKP-BfNCk6KnrpgqOY9_DG1LlDg1op0cJUjpHB3nnty65xkuz4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:464:\"Went in to order and then pay. Come to find out that they are put of stock of fries, coffee, and coke. I asked for them to change my order to replace my cokes with ice tea and my fries to rice. They just removed the items and didn\'t tell me. When I go to get my order I find out that they had just removed the items and the wait was too long for me to re order and the staff made no effort to fix things.\nI have been to other Jollibee and this was by far the worst\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-12-30T02:15:52.799970764Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Rodel Bontes\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjULZVdJwrKGZbpZjXav5j_CbNbYWssFUQ2GEMXbS8r1GKFSRygS=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:108:\"Visit here yesterday, love the Hot Choco as always. Good service and place, And more parking available here.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2019-05-12T06:42:26.882766Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";s:96:\"Popular Philippines-based chain globally known for its famed fried chicken, spaghetti & burgers.\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:3;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJfdYirqRJkTMRlUEGJgdExxA\";s:4:\"name\";s:29:\"Jollibee Royal Mall Bayambang\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.809705999999998;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.4572180