i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:230:\"I had an absolutely wonderful experience at Jollibee Royal Mall Bayan! The food was incredibly delicious, and the service was truly exceptional. The atmosphere was so welcoming and enjoyable. Can\'t wait to visit again! ??✨\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-02-08T05:23:18.501541071Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"James Hathaway\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:116:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKRZWPQ0x2wL0qWGO0oZGXK1aA9DtASD9EacjQ-buUBKPth2A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:224:\"This location needs help. Slow service, lack of organization, products always out of stock, broken faucet in the hand washing area. We only go here because the kids like it, but 50% of the time minimum it\'s a bad experience.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-03-08T04:57:05.524741986Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Kristan Ramos\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:116:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKeHipoYsgZSpMICjNyNYaUy4jPTHp0YDnnIE5lZVzz-duwHg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:41:\"patience staff clean utensils better food\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-10-14T01:31:58.454949353Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:11:\"Cynz Abueva\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWXRgoc0ch12zTptJlI8r1A7awfTvxBucJgmIans1HHh35r6GrL=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:78:\"I ate alone but I\'m happy coz it\'s my first time to eat Ultimate Burger Steak.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2022-06-11T06:00:19.174379Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:20:\"Xymounn Prince Rubio\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:116:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKdOp0NjgipSnqTxq7CFXfw8iw53gGYQ3-HoJC9JdqHTCUhhQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:160:\"Slow service and the chicken is raw,so many broken things,the juice has too much ice,the water tastes\nlike the ice is melted.one of the roller shades is broken.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2025-04-03T04:40:40.345306Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";s:96:\"Popular Philippines-based chain globally known for its famed fried chicken, spaghetti & burgers.\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:4;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJOfqpEqg1kTMRdHcZWPmUBlY\";s:4:\"name\";s:16:\"Jollibee Moncada\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.7378484;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.57446519999999;s:7:\"address\";s:43:\"MacArthur Hwy, Moncada, Tarlac, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:10:\"restaurant\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:257;s:7:\"reviews\";i:257;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:478:\"places/ChIJOfqpEqg1kTMRdHcZWPmUBlY/photos/AVoNoXTLOVkVXAoNTSPrKiJr1pVGJcRcTLg577qAlMml-3lcr6Yv8KU9C80axwzzw26ScNk3aT2Ol3LbK-D9-vnesUfyqxwNK6MA06QsMSFXB9iGnz425Tsq_kAxkih62UwLzOYA_5Y_ZJYTyRV-kc72_jBxkoRl0L4rBGELmFRPwP6p6nOygju4fxMDT4MsTElPCMEqJeN4HuJl1q9rQTWk0uZ4RQ-nOfR3H6VAAcebMdpgnZFURp-krebaAeKfbjuMyKBxBT2SohqyGWuX_ss6sVv648pG3bO7kx-RmmtGI4i2Opx40SJzDtSlzizc08sVOLjV4VLHYv9rTWbNbOeBselMYjI6jVlWebZS8QJcbOgy1R7-LD9SltvZvjweltaNVWrHX4UawK5HVU_p92mcdcin_e_s3p-5TF7Asr7OiLMyzm62\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:6:{i:0;s:478:\"places/ChIJOfqpEqg1kTMRdHcZWPmUBlY/photos/AVoNoXTLOVkVXAoNTSPrKiJr1pVGJcRcTLg577qAlMml-3lcr6Yv8KU9C80axwzzw26ScNk3aT2Ol3LbK-D9-vnesUfyqxwNK6MA06QsMSFXB9iGnz425Tsq_kAxkih62UwLzOYA_5Y_ZJYTyRV-kc72_jBxkoRl0L4rBGELmFRPwP6p6nOygju4fxMDT4MsTElPCMEqJeN4HuJl1q9rQTWk0uZ4RQ-nOfR3H6VAAcebMdpgnZFURp-krebaAeKfbjuMyKBxBT2SohqyGWuX_ss6sVv648pG3bO7kx-RmmtGI4i2Opx40SJzDtSlzizc08sVOLjV4VLHYv9rTWbNbOeBselMYjI6jVlWebZS8QJcbOgy1R7-LD9SltvZvjweltaNVWrHX4UawK5HVU_p92mcdcin_e_s3p-5TF7Asr7OiLMyzm62\";i:1;s:494:\"places/ChIJOfqpEqg1kTMRdHcZWPmUBlY/photos/AVoNoXTCMsrzv9ODb1QFtPUBE1hb83LZeZFKqNJH4HFhKZuJXbprnCBQ8HwymQQo9XIW03ylqeYo_fjkXFI2rQG7IS1HnnwdgGNyzWhH1Rvll5NZU0-d9CWqXwPtZ2ItJkrFnxgDWJK3yYvnFLp9p3S_oI5Jfsoe2vWE2eg1ptFE0BEkgMHDUVIas6mFrtZjXILK8_AwahIf0cKvNzdFnMBssrkGOtD0rVZIwEaJR4ARdaMz