KSUn2Im7BszZ85RoWRLdE2NorFh8ac8gXos4doP48buOycyfum5T1wsJxfZZGUYH05xAZ9iYJZygyODTDBEh36GdO6bvA88P7w1AwX5r0UPo1k1yns-epCm8Mgyl8G8zzfFaT7n8hoJkdNg-NJ8ivGPYXL4YYW_uP7066fJCktKHhGGzMlxddVvfUSozgMJzXbuyi6rrAn_YZSp-2HsIZ-GNHkoIqTA2hUb-Cw\";}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:5:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Andrew Lo Chong\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVgQ9Oc8p3w2T4tzlgezImmkPbFoarXKUB_J-LSQjDhPpeRVsE=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:353:\"I ordered a crunchy chicken sandwich with fries and Coke, plus a solo spaghetti.\n\nThe serving time took quite a while for such a basic order, and there weren’t many customers in the establishment at the time (as seen in the photos). I hope yun serving time nyo can be improved for a better dining experience.\n\nand parang trainee majority ng staff nyo.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-08-15T03:06:20.615812245Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:21:\"Prof. Sergio Marquina\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX229O3cZEUb0aNAsVVeb7x64PHW3Uk4K54AKwtqSVuktRu7qo=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:156:\"The service is slow. You always have to check your order to make sure it is correct and complete. The crew will not provide tissues unless you ask for them.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-01-20T06:10:44.066912298Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:18:\"Ryan Jay De Guzman\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUcnp2mdChsIVzS1LzY3KrFbL2SCxJeZUy7ImYF5tkhfrAyNIko=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:122:\"This jollibee can accomodate more customers than the one in Paniqui. It has spacious parking lot. No hustle finding space.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2025-04-16T03:55:40.688679Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:11:\"Carissa MAE\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXCvb-_qtyg7RfhCIdhXQb0hqX40bvgGKRv9HmSt7gdVpqfdRVI=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:416:\"Friendly staff and a clean place! They always smile and greet you warmly. The parking is spacious, and it’s close to our house. We love Jollibee, especially because they always serve freshly cooked, tasty meals with consistent quality.\n\nThere was one time, though, when a coke was missing from our order, but we didn’t notice until we got home, so we just let it go. Overall, my experience has been great so far!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2025-05-28T04:39:06.409307Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:10:\"Chantal Go\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjULUf2gKmV8MdjZRMfLpq6FAIizlYzwx5ONqbE4j8ozmpinvZth=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:361:\"The new store is very spacious for travelers going to North and vise versa to have a stop over or have a drive tru order.\nI may not be able to take photos inside but I will take more photos soon.\nThis store also represents the town of Moncada wherein the symbol of Belenismo as the icon of this town was known to have the best Belenismo in Tarlac.☺️??\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2018-12-07T08:39:04.150874872Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";s:96:\"Popular Philippines-based chain globally known for its famed fried chicken, spaghetti & burgers.\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:5;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJLWPheADPljMR7gUR8RH_48o\";s:4:\"name\";s:25:\"Jollibee TPLEX Southbound\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.5690625;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.63217189999999;s:7:\"address\";s:39:\"HJ9J+JVF, Victoria, Tarlac, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:10:\"restaurant\";s:6:\"rating\";d:3.6;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:368;s:7:\"reviews\";i:368;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:494:\"places/ChIJLWPheADPljMR7gUR8RH_48o/photos/AVoNoXRACLAXbS8rNBfPivIRPS7hM1S76KegoYok8NH0PJnBtc9sab-S9Er7To8IgcXJ7Fi4hCIrNrr_5xB