ou!! ?\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-05-15T08:18:37.394204138Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Flaire Palangya\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUeFFWMxAR7n6WEQKWO1xf3VTTUkHl8xwUByUuRj20nazOIV8bc=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:415:\"Very disappointing experience. We waited more than 30 minutes for our order, which is far too long. The dining area was also very dirty, with tables left uncleared and no staff visibly cleaning them. If staffing is an issue, perhaps customers could be encouraged to clean up after themselves or return their trays to help keep the area tidy. Overall, the cleanliness and long wait time made for an unpleasant visit.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-05-30T18:57:13.658090200Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"Jericho Saddul\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUQVzP6T7yaHTyo5GCIJBrEGWgoU2iYI0hq95hduXjkJFdSw7E0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:345:\"Jollibee TPLEX branches are strategic, convenient stops for motorists traveling along the Tarlac-Pangasinan-La Union Expressway (TPLEX). These outlets are designed for fast service, offering classic favorites like Chickenjoy, Jolly Spaghetti, and Yumburgers to travelers needing a quick meal or break during their northbound or southbound trips.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-03-15T03:52:07.602119479Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:4:\"Rome\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXRHGtD2OeMQltERpz2tQrqfkifBVb3a4HxP9yIUqvBuDIDfMJx=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:261:\"You can never go wrong with Jollibee! The Chickenjoy is always perfectly crispy on the outside and juicy on the inside. The gravy is iconic. The Jolly Spaghetti is the perfect sweet and savory comfort food. Fast service and always clean. My forever happy place!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-08-23T09:27:25.701200875Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:11:\"Yajitra Rik\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVgcclZ4442fZqbpPkWv-g6owthF8ybuCgwaXWl8Eh4_5_g6rY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba7\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:105:\"As what\'s expected with Jollibee. Can never be wrong to eat here especially if with kids. Can be crowded.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-02-17T04:41:06.484024958Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:6;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJI1k4bdI0kTMR6kjorj39sF0\";s:4:\"name\";s:24:\"Jollibee Paniqui Highway\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.668861599999998;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.5861219;s:7:\"address\";s:67:\"MHCM+JXG, M.H. Del Pilar St, Estacion, Paniqui, Tarlac, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:10:\"restaurant\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:503;s:7:\"reviews\";i:503;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:478:\"places/ChIJI1k4bdI0kTMR6kjorj39sF0/photos/AVoNoXQ6qfJ5oOFRTzJoU3NoiNOd4XdR6X765WfPgH1xFV3yn9yUwDVELTdyx6TIgUoj6qSwhpDB0BnFGgmLN9N6VN8qn9E6cCpgFhANbZT5FrB-zXO96Tu-y-hNApdnU7MO_Suk-hwgczxtYG1T2uFyvygPPh2_skZA9HQuObWps8aYlpKxuP9TF_hwvfeTLPRAHV56VljbPbbh5FoQOYFpKwDXOIgr6NuC6GkpoNieiRYXQUzy4BH9pBE5CKrO92RHAcuAiBXG4FbvyoXbnm50jXwV61eTDXdUNBB7JHxWHH92UZcmdpZTWA3P3PJs5Kg0-SfRFMbhJ0d6R9-3AKdK6ctyWf0c8aZbRs_Ofx2aJqJuHuiQGar2ArB4f0zgOywU9fFK6t2TQzxVz7lK7M2S148UVz74x2CmJjhTU3gkrrbfwjXG\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:6:{i:0;s:478:\"places/ChIJI1k4bdI0kTMR6kjorj39sF0/photos/AVoNoXQ6qfJ5oOFRTzJoU3NoiNOd4XdR6X765WfPgH1xFV3yn9yUwDVELTdyx6TIgUoj6qSwhpDB0BnFGgmLN9N6VN8qn9E6cCpgFhANbZT5FrB-zXO96Tu-y-hNApdnU7MO_Suk-hwgczxtYG1T2uFyvygPPh2_skZA9HQuObWps8aYlpKxuP9TF_hwvfeTLPRAHV56VljbPbbh5FoQOYFpKwDXOIgr6NuC6GkpoNieiRYXQUzy4BH9pBE5CKrO92RHAcuAiBXG4FbvyoXbnm50jXwV61eTDXdUNBB7JHxWHH92UZcmdpZTWA3P3PJs5Kg0-SfRFMbhJ0d6R9-3AKdK6ctyWf0c8aZbRs_Ofx2aJqJuHuiQGar2ArB4f0zgOywU9fFK6t2TQzxVz7lK7M2S1