t_aOxm_KmkGjh4JB9Bl0jW65cg\";i:5;s:478:\"places/ChIJI1k4bdI0kTMR6kjorj39sF0/photos/AVoNoXSgXCn1bZ03XwsllhNmU0Geo2046OESuGyDqg_mj0Zfx1jomLkqlZsN-e5W9ZZIqeH7HQxQAcaPJYR4oWvfM7_2iGgCOXgqgcwciOlElQHi8Rvzcxikf8fhL9mjYK9v2apTEnuNMQSwLio4ab2JlP-3FUYjCMrWRi65Z9cI_vPN9K_V_WRCGLMslPiWIre-9PluIkeo79ifbYr8aFviJiHghbnrGvPhzH-GCSMC9xVuB6xZ1fKl8MsLUbW1KIDGvT074OiTUwDKFrlEa3VRAIbG44xQEkwuIMIKGbW30-7UqVFF9GhfOJphoVCTUBk-lOVMvyp1Gc1d2ZLvvOT20YsAaLE8aQPaOJG7jIE7OCsnMm_W3J6ozkS4HQEOFw9dCTQdVylz9qxE--W_k7m1EEAsEVm1TjmtvZ0vKewVUK_UN7_R\";}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:5:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:21:\"Julius Ian Tabifranca\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:121:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWlhTKTMWH1vPYHtLgqfI6RSvBqSgum711NySKGzaFLOkEN9wvb4Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:3;s:4:\"text\";s:419:\"I usually enjoy visiting this Jollibee branch, but during my recent drive-thru experience, there was a strong unpleasant odor around the drive-thru area. It made the experience less enjoyable. I hope management can check and address the source of the smell, as maintaining a clean and fresh environment is important for customers. The staff were still polite and accommodating, and I hope this issue gets resolved soon.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-07-20T10:48:21.301796634Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Rebecca Mahor\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:116:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIy7l-SyXEF29Uw8ZamJ0mDWZuxCnll-wNdUw1xsJEvZvjHfw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:3;s:4:\"text\";s:443:\"It was confusing at first because there were two-way arrows at the drive-thru entrance. We found the order stand eventually after driving around. We were informed that one of our orders will need 10 minutes to prepare so they let us park on the designated parking for those who are waiting for pending orders. The server delivered the wrong order at first but we got our correct order shortly after. Service was relatively quick, staff polite.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-03-09T12:17:58.361653986Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:6:\"Lumine\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:118:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU_9bwEekQCk7_pp_29PrQWvTiw9ty7xuUz0R1dRSTAfGxndJk=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:2;s:4:\"text\";s:395:\"I’ve been here countless times and not even once was the drive thru open. What’s the point of having a drive thru then?? The service is also so slow, but you’d see them packed behind the counter. It took them almost 40 minutes to finish our order. I wouldn’t say the place is always crowded with customers but because of their slow service it tends to look like it. I hope this improves.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-01-09T17:40:18.306600247Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:21:\"Prof. Sergio Marquina\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX229O3cZEUb0aNAsVVeb7x64PHW3Uk4K54AKwtqSVuktRu7qo=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:349:\"We waited over 15 minutes in the drive-thru only to receive cold fries, which was really disappointing. The chicken portions were also noticeably small compared to what we expected, making the overall value feel lacking. However, I do want to commend the cashier at the drive-thru, who was polite, patient, and very accommodating despite the issues.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-01-20T21:09:26.422102771Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:18:\"Christan Jay Minor\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU7_q9KRF-5zWP4Q9xHPl3egqr0COBThAxLIsa-RHS36rWl2_K1=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:329:\"I have to wait almost 1 hour just to get my food. Eto branch na to ang fastfood na not fast at all. Our order is very basic yet they took almost an hour to prepare the food. Mind you, this is not the first time it happen. While eating, we have to go back to the counter to get straw for coke float and gravy for chicken. Worst!!!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-02-17T18:49:10.259173996Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";s:96:\"Popular Philippines-based chain globally known for its famed fried chicken, spaghetti & burgers.\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:7;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJc6f8ZADHljMRCTTujha29c8\";s:4:\"name\";s:27:\"Jollibee San Nicolas Tarlac\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.4980249;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.5964152;s:7:\"address\";s:77:\"Block No. 3, Ninoy Aquino Blvd, San Nicolas, Tarlac City, Tarlac, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:10:\"restaurant\";s:6:\"rating\";d:3.2;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:53;s:7:\"reviews\";i:53;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:492:\"places/ChIJc6f8ZADHljMRCTTujha29c8/photos/AVoNoXR8eaUMxgLDAEzdsMNPFT4asIQlp1cycO3PtSJnWKI6C0i0BEq92bQNOXm72Kz0_1gIv6s5AIBBVJG938yyZS-u5qwMmOdEgXtLvYEJmq746g6l7S-J6LpjE46QuNsoIdZP4RNX1zmOaz5bFQXFFzj2LzJWBeqDaIc-uTeBCVSZEv7wtjCRwnrplsYnfmXWhtaUQLp2VBN-cBuf8d8j9FoEWAGwrarFw2ICpLpb53xwBxJYPQNZ8dojxlIAPwmde7rOdqGGpyntIhE25lr3gcOR6XL_kUYeyDUX9-2vfkgxjmEWmXh1wU2yjJk9b7gYQupjk--ydXr6lDN3udC35XY5UqT9zHAOFelc08cdhFjT3HoQ2uZ-T3LOBt1LuLeUT2bc6u3kQhh1nsMZUGN-cLrfAEYTN7KJMfXFgUyMSLiKQ5HDj0PlQETklKGrEA\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:6:{i:0;s:492:\"places/ChIJc6f8ZADHljMRCTTujha29c8/photos/AVoNoXR8eaUMxgLDAEzdsMNPFT4asIQlp1cycO3PtSJnWKI6C0i0BEq92bQNOXm72Kz0_1gIv6s5AIBBVJG938yyZS-u5qwMmOdEgXtLvYEJmq746g6l7S-J6LpjE46QuNsoIdZP4RNX1zmOaz5bFQXFFzj2LzJWBeqDaIc-uTeBCVSZEv7wtjCRwnrplsYnfmXWhtaUQLp2VBN-cBuf8d8j9FoEWAGwrarFw2ICpLpb53xwBxJYPQNZ8dojxlIAPwmde7rOdqGGpyntIhE25lr3gcOR6XL_kUYeyDUX9-2vfkgxjmEWmXh1wU2yjJk9b7gYQupjk--ydXr6lDN3udC35XY5UqT9zHAOFelc08cdhFjT3HoQ2uZ-T3LOBt1LuLeUT2bc6u3kQhh1nsMZUGN-cLrfAEYTN7KJMfXFgUyMSLiKQ5HDj0PlQETklKGrEA\";i:1;s:494:\"places/ChIJc6f8ZADHljMRCTTujha29c8/photos/AVoNoXS7xZDMIXzLC0FlDsK3iLHvU2AKcbCbDvtMC7dYMSU59mcICIzAFTgpbqcwzJnZLinRyWzxTOaqCjG-w3dW2cHuJCK4Vg7P-p0L6RoFbmb6uso0HDy5WBhDTt4WZOu7JC9cRBIwShrv9O4OvlWBO3bNS7KXpz2OujH37LFTpZtm_JKQzq89bTaZPS1Qe4x