GaCB8lgQQnn8rIG5wMorEzKvpqfwM2N-wywvcnp1eJIhJbN-ETGmQ0b_tqxmQ5G2FfmAiLFyI6SK9jjM7cSgEE-T8G0F4KGA2N1idzU5JuPt6vk2BY2fQ0vQB_j-1IN5Ynw9VyrSvXpSxJUM0bwheBCES-x0w3fjy7eIgKY_7MNOs7craP2sLO9DIMX-eAyk9YSg_FhzPdVmEery2-ofaIp0bXGKWT9jwhyXC85LS3kj-ruZYI2k7xSAN7CemLrsTBDsu6Z13EABHX1K4U_igGoM9jBQccS08xI\";}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:5:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:19:\"Karla Mae Dela Cruz\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWBvVk86MTWYoI1cmi3oXkGM9SbIp929r2_rynj0mMY68Lx6b3U=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:626:\"I ordered early because I was hungry, and I even added a delay fee since there were no available riders who accepted cashless payments. I had to cash in just to place the order. The time stated for delivery was between 7:30–7:40 PM, and it arrived on time. However, the rider mentioned that their manager picked a fight with them just for following up on my order. When I received the food, it was a mess—the drinks were spilled, and everything looked rushed.\n\nIf you have issues with your riders, that’s not my concern as a customer. I paid for my food and expect proper service. Please fix this kind of system failure.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2025-04-06T11:45:02.378950Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:17:\"Joana Denise Basa\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:118:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWysuemy21_cqigG576k-NPV_dJ84TT_X0A-yatTMqhQwtkft4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:1153:\"AVOID THIS BRANCH AT ALL COST! Our first and last try on this ChickenJoy, but rather ChickenSadness chain with my family.\n\nThe staff lacks transparency if they can or cannot fulfill your order and simply compromise in a very disappointing way.\n\nWe drove 15 kilometers to this newly opened branch as it was the nearest among others and ordered the usual 8pcs. Bucket for my family.\n\nI kindly asked for a bigger portion if available and they acknowledged my request, which in turn, they said to wait atleast 15 minutes for the order which is understandable.\n\nHowever, when they finally gave the order to my wife, which she eagerly opened and started looking at the contents that made her face instantly turn from joy into disappointment.\n\nBinigyan kami ng 8 pcs small Wings of Sadness na ikinagalit ni esmi dahil akala nya bumili kami sa kanto fried chicken!\n\nThis isn’t a business of giving “Joy” and Fulfillment but rather a poorly trained staff/manager whose supposed to Control Quality Standards, not only on the equipment but on the customers too!\n\nYou’ve just lost another family of believer of your “Joy”. We’ll stick to our Mclovin:)\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-10-13T15:43:24.987227Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:17:\"Korsita Korchenko\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXJNSQ3KcN6dWVSFvB8l3zYZi6VINbbX_IcirOWORKyWuVGtvSH=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:116:\"Ordered beef tapa in the drive thru found out later we had  longanisa. The orange juice tastes like very sweet tang.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-06-15T23:43:39.239376379Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"rene descrates\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL160jYNsz9IzgAK0Dp9e58WKwLjIXMTCNhtO61e_dAkqZ8Tg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:120:\"Very clean from the hall to restrooms and parking.  There is charging station in some tables and staff are all friendly.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-07-27T01:40:15.584098740Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:18:\"Jan Benedick Pauco\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXiOB0_h8Dd-TmurQ_1EexHZC3FfOaRXAwZaYBgQJehRJ8jIexn=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:3;s:4:\"text\";s:144:\"Ordered via drive thru. Server can\'t hear us even we\'re talking loudly.\n\nOrdered their pies however it was not a