FLHZWfoELd1QMHPu4bmGEY6ZVF5IdefnNrKROq0A_TPSSMGPXDTxjSXNflnYbBTOjAoYvAZ_r-JUwn99u7J1GaS5W5igjcFdmOgvEshHBuFykAtxHgNgg8oitGJXKjiiFwYZqv0xMU1ijuYkw-SvkNDk8XP7bfWVAZLW8g5QnN_p1bgRJuieQdxHPYGaRn0dJy7QW1E-Yd_O8rhL-cU1p_1Lw5G7OxJX6MFuQQR-LDsFnFtY1OeBlqn0BO-WwYclWn05Za7rQZa1OGrZPBt2uWOrY0CptyNzW3DdK2ZOI-3Mo1xGBOYLJ7GYubauitX56D-SkLtz6imYxsWphSLABcrg9Vw8xyjh9GjYMfPkFDxQyB1MDk4ISCyl8s29cYCWVKMOpNC0glLbMTSlv8K\";}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:5:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Cey Anything\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV3_AKYQoUD_jBzRhzVFNiehKmcWQzbtbjjmT50JHOTVMQAH4lq=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:155:\"You don’t even deserve my 1 ⭐️…\nJollibee is not a fast food place anymore!!\n^^^^ the service is so bad and very slow ^^^\nMy order is taking forever\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-04-14T13:03:45.351099221Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:9:\"Awen Cruz\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWbdRKnpG64pSgU9rcYJIMb0xsCSHTodRRqt6vasIOE67mJ_PKD=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:158:\"Had our breakfast take-out orders. Food is properly assembled. Our orders were quickly served and management is strict in implementation of social distancing.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2022-02-13T10:04:46.171849Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"Shameia Aguino\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU94zQrajzRkA1MFeZhTOD8fQwsjpAjcUoJ3r-5dY77oTiCUuEd=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:287:\"The cashier left us while we’re on the line just to assemble orders when there’s a lot of assembler already on floor and there’s 4 person also behind me.\nWaited for 30 minutes just to have our meal. They served us cold fries, and the pending order was served for almost 15 minutes.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-09-05T09:51:24.407162790Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"Joshua Dupitas\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX4bBmcFtrmIDBRwfHWrFfvnIo8VzsxNeYKeWvYca22n4zIb6wG=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:973:\"I am giving only 1 star because staffs aren\'t that well trained. We had our breakfast last Friday with my cousin and her friends. First, I ordered bottled water, and they didnt tell me that bottled water wasn\'t available. Second, we were told to wait for lastest 20 min for our orders. And told also that it is the maximum time to wait. They served first our first 2 orders. And when we asked the lady on the counter about the remaining orders, she told us they will come out next. Unfortunately, we had to wait again for another 5 to 10 mins for the remaining orders. If we were told that our orders will take forever, we could have ordered another from their menu. This is not my first bad experience here. The first one was when I ordered spag with chicken for takeaway and the staff didn\'t put takeaway cutleries. I hope that the next time I\'m going to visit Jollibee Gerona, I will have a different experience. Forgot to take pictures, because we were so disappointed.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2022-06-04T07:22:18.823440Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:16:\"Mikaela Urmeneta\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWjHGgOiKfq4X-Vb6PMeknfOHmOjcVA8obSr0kqM-6T9bciKMcX=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:3;s:4:\"text\";s:339:\"Jollibee has been my childhood food \'till now. I\'m rating this 3 star due to slow service I even have to follow up for our order which is just 1 value meal and a sundae and it took almost 30 minutes. Good thing we\'re not that hungry. But most of the time, it should only take less than 15 minutes specially this is a \"fastfood\" restaurant.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2021-04-01T21:24:27.947234Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";s