4jjB5JwVCq17MQEHIz0iH7yeB-2oXOi8c3Mr2Q80Ee3O\";}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:5:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:10:\"Slarky Boi\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW7NUstJPX-B59490VBvOcSxiXVPY6t96W4er4EowSFVrSGkWW1=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:2;s:4:\"text\";s:447:\"Jollibee branches usually are two things, good or bad. This is more on the bad side, food quality specifically the chicken is not consistent wherein sometimes the chicken is not fresh and juicy, sometimes good, sometimes the amount of meat on your chicken is way less like the one I had today where it was only 2 bites and it\'s already bones already. Only eat here for convenience, otherwise don\'t expect this branch to have consistent tasty food.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-05-30T07:29:56.263418525Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:8:\"Xian Tei\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:118:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUchSHcBlzUMASGYIJrVfnWScBtg6QYVYFLmUbUiaa-SuDBBPI=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:2;s:4:\"text\";s:526:\"Food is nice but they usually forget to add sauce and some other food when take out. Come to think of it most of the time they dont even add ketchup at all i had to eat it tasting bland and soft. I appreciate the service but i think they don\'t add ketchup and my ice cream on purpose cuz its always missing. Im so sick of me going home and just realizing something was missing even after confirming with the employee that everything is already at the bag but its actually not pls fix this thing cuz its getting pretty annoying\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-05-12T10:13:02.658044703Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"April Amador\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:121:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXVT3J8UWv7LcNRoAp1pEM4XSKNXlnSD-vJ0GsEcFTiR61gYRWTJg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:742:\"We ordered Super Meal B, Palabok, Spaghetti with Burger, and Chicken sandwich and unfortunately the Palabok was not in the box. The server is not even looking at us or our order, did not even check our receipt, did not inform us about any order that may take a while and is not focused on her job and I truly understand that sometimes it can be overstimulating because I work at customer service but we need someone to take responsibility and do something about this. I reached out to the Jollibee facebook page and Magic Star Mall Tarlac page because that is the only page that I can find but I received no reply from them. My mother is looking forward to the food that we will give her but came home without her food. Just very unsatisfied.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2025-02-23T10:34:03.537701Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:11:\"Gail Galvez\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWM0_D5fuX9fNSLbS93Cp2kv5mmtzlbj-uOSMAaSa2Zr7oNAQE=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:343:\"Asking my boyfriend to try this newly open branch. We had our lunch here & ordered our all time favorite 2pcs chicken for him then 1pc for me with burgersteak. The place was crowded with people since it\'s weekdays when we visited & it\'s just near the campus that\'s why most of the customers are college students. Has a wide parking space also.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-10-28T01:12:24.016214924Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:9:\"John Cruz\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVHOXj1JRzPUuQ1dhGh4klIcHu2WKJyHkXAWf2KDGDNkpITcL9s=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:380:\"I ordered a bulk order para sa Birthday ng Nephew ko sa School. The food was great and thank you Jollibee Magic Star for taking the extra Mile to make my Nephew’s birthday Memorable and made his birthday memorable.\n\nAnd also to Ms Alicia May from Jollibee Camiling . Thank you very much for helping us organize this and making it happen.\n\nKudos to all of you! See you next year!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-05-02T06:36:03.949349Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";s:96:\"Popular Philippines-based chain globally known for its famed fried chicken, spaghetti & burgers.\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:11;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJwdeySUHHljMRnoD8cT6x7ZE\";s:4:\"name\";s:23:\"Jollibee Tarlac Highway\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.480812799999997;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.59490749999998;s:7:\"address\";s:77:\"Victory Liner Compound, MacArthur Hwy, Brgy, Tarlac City, Tarlac, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:10:\"restaurant\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.2;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:565;s:7:\"reviews\";i:565;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:473:\"places/ChIJwdeySUHHljMRnoD8cT6x7ZE/photos/AVoNoXRO9tL3jkTEckN5VZsSVXIu4KWKNmfqOKLxeR6nYHN_rxjaV6bOz3YyIiD4NUi0k7-uJGjvsXeoTuHgyTOTLIzuo8vsRSMKs98YrPxzYVj9kwpbpp9DOnWtQkTWWyhLXdAS_ag0ywcj6UO-4lwZSyHlCjYucSI-73K3f5JaHcrB4fTs4jx4OwiGcGZECmTxiNgVu8BajZ3gdfR7XDg5yOMZ3B83JtkJqiaDr5c13TDChil1aQFd3z1plrkG2UYF5F8fH98dN9ZZc0eN81MiDKlmIca-6c6_xKRABtrojyrOU2SJJTSS0kLd5qeSAeGh-b6WqObcd36aTOwATz5TJ5WeW_x7PNdcYRh1-hKRyCvC1_tnISikHmeodPB7Kj0nrL7LjYejDsBX15g-l_rzpDi0liZDz6_-YDS58aaXe7Y\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:6:{i:0;s:473:\"places/ChIJwdeySUHHljMRnoD8cT6x7ZE/photos/AVoNoXRO9tL3jkTEckN5VZsSVXIu4KWKNmfqOKLxeR6nYHN_rxjaV6bOz3YyIiD4NUi0k7-uJGjvsXeoTuHgyTOTLIzuo8vsRSMKs98YrPxzYVj9kwpbpp9DOnWtQkTWWyhLXdAS_ag0ywcj6UO-4lwZSyHlCjYucSI-73K3f5JaHcrB4fTs4jx4OwiGcGZECmTxiNgVu8BajZ3gdfR7XDg5yOMZ3B83JtkJqiaDr5c13TDChil1aQFd3z1plrkG2UYF5F8fH98dN9ZZc0eN81MiDKlmIca-6c6_xKRABtrojyrOU2SJJTSS0kLd5qeSAeGh-b6WqObcd36aTOwATz5TJ5WeW_x7PNdcYRh1-hKRyCvC1_tnISikHmeodPB7Kj0nrL7LjYejDsBX15g-l_rzpDi0liZDz6_-YDS58aaXe7Y\";i:1;s:476:\"places/ChIJwdeySUHHljMRnoD8cT6x7ZE/photos/AVoNoXStEK8JS-n1jlIRX3Xd_jN5DyRebzrbQ8dGh99-RLv7qGjn1lQpya3NAP43S1Fe_Q_mtkN7FLhMEIwLkWAh6Bay8WHfXtG0vI5UvHNqIKEGnoTR1GO96fXTlYHMt2KzTjsNVYQXMeQWUPQIUcZhc1W8CA_vV-bWHfn7p_F02YvrO8qeE64TkO8JUGXAOEjlrz8azKdki_3o