bxXQh4nGCN2SPGD73g1aAL8I6jfl9F-3lL1tIEjOb1au_kebZG-3V3ueC3LP3b6GQPVgi3xy0yRtJtj_hN1UG7kVVmuuqna9CX49oROBI9Gt_9riAp5z3NQJNIGOMnu9PephpNFQOL5dZo_UHkcDJcEWMKFUpqWmofRuWht9-tYV0XNmu3Q8RQTD_0FRp_XwHxyVSpnSTXWpAmQ\";}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:5:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:11:\"Gail Galvez\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWM0_D5fuX9fNSLbS93Cp2kv5mmtzlbj-uOSMAaSa2Zr7oNAQE=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:304:\"Easily located, just near Siesta bus terminal.  The food was always freshly cook and has big servings. Staffs are accomodating & friendly. Has a huge parking lot and events place. My nephews celebrated their birthday here too. My boyfriend & I enjoy eating here so much. Be coming back for more for sure.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-02-09T18:10:53.598003192Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:28:\"Francis Jesus John de Guzman\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXe86mviU3RLLwhm5_czMe1xz9ZkbSNA8HCyU_e-nUr0aqtd0Y=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:679:\"Food was as always hot and freshly cooked and my request for a chicken part was happily accommodated.\nWhat made my dining experience worth it was the smile and greeting of the manager, whose name I wasn’t able to recall, but when I entered and he saw I was a PWD, he immediately took my order and just asked me to sit and would just inform me of my total bill when he brings my order to my table. What a gesture!\nI insisted to pay at the counter then to my surprise he already had my order in a tray with the utensils and walked me to my seat.\nAlways smiling and helping out! That’s what I call great customer service!\nWill go back again and update this review with his name.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2026-03-28T00:04:27.207443Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:8:\"Mae Anne\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:116:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLBpIcCup9aXE57ZIQk2l4Qk6-ZSDpw9NJEwXppEOAt5UZuBg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:503:\"Hands-down my favorite stop in Tarlac City! The place is spacious with plenty of seats, service is super fast even during lunch rush, and every meal comes out piping hot and freshly cooked. The Chickenjoy is crispy and juicy, Jolly Spaghetti hits that sweet Pinoy spot, and servings are generous for the price. Staff are genuinely accommodating and keep the vibe bida ang saya, plus the huge parking area makes it so convenient. Clean, consistent, and always satisfying — this branch deserves 5 stars!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-04-18T04:24:16.812371894Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"Charles Rollan\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXKQ03RRiJKGzmpYpHgyxCuxnELayJGBmmAzmrO9n86ddT8GC-h=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:323:\"I love Jollibee, and my girlfriend and I always eat there. Unfortunately, last Sunday, I almost finished my food when I suddenly noticed a hair on my plate. I spoke to a crew member and mentioned that I wasn’t going to complain about the hair in my food, but I asked them to ensure the food is prepared cleanly next time.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-09-23T13:41:49.642118Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:17:\"Andrew déChavéz\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXT7GmMr9rB1h86tG7iqRgSvWfaSUk-j4rPVAYJ-jBiQB6KHqSUcw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:100:\"not too crowded knowing that its almost lunch time, a lot of seat available. the service was fast...\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-12-01T03:33:50.514498Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";s:96:\"Popular Philippines-based chain globally known for its famed fried chicken, spaghetti & burgers.\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:12;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJC8L_RXzPljMRwTK29w03Psw\"