m, energetic, and incredibly attentive, making sure everything ran smoothly and that both the kids and adults were having a great time. Their enthusiasm was infectious, and they helped create an atmosphere filled with laughter and joy.\n\nWhat stood out most was the genuine care they showed throughout the event. It never felt like they were simply doing their jobs—they truly seemed invested in making the day special for our family and guests.\n\nAt the end of the party, we gave the team a tip as a small token of our appreciation, and seeing how grateful and touched they were made the moment even more meaningful. It reminded us how much hard work goes into creating these celebrations behind the scenes.\n\nA heartfelt thank you to the entire team for helping us create such happy memories. It was a day we\'ll always look back on fondly, and we couldn\'t have asked for a better group of people to celebrate with.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-07-16T12:36:31.442339621Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:18:\"CABRIEDA, JANNA C.\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXoKBkKGvMwlCB_3I8yrH3eREEjW4NXQM7OOBXgp9Eh0hZLwO7F=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:308:\"your stuff are rude, unprofessional, and has an unpleasant approach to their customer. we asked how long will we wait and her answer was “‘di po mabilisan dito”. we were just asking an estimated time so then we’ll know how long we’ll wait.\n\ndo better, train your stuff to treat your customer nicer.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-07-11T13:20:28.163971022Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:6:\"Melody\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVgigRZXsUq8BvoPl8tLvPm7Ps-Ue-KyDPKVxjmuPOklDcYmwLj=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:107:\"not 24hrs as shows here in google ? we drove for an hour and 30mins tapos ending, hindi pala sila 24hrs.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-05-19T21:23:03.054490469Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:23:\"Jessica Abegonia (Jezz)\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUPb7FyBZ30b9X2tEha7ls5u9I-5ORPpibNB55y79M2LgW2gtk0xQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:460:\"It was surprisingly crowded during night. The queue was like 30 minutes plus another 15 minutes or so waiting food. But in all jollibee\'s I\'ve been with, this place offers high quality chicken, fresh, big enough, crispy and taste really good than others same with spaghetti its plenty. The rest room was clean too in the 2nd level. Cool aircon, working well. Just a normal busy fastfood chain. I\'ll recommend this place than staying in a busy crowd of SM Mall.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:24:\"2018-04-15T23:08:54.303Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:4:\"Jeff\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU2pkje4RZBSm2Pg6rQo6y3SBlCmNV8YQUPKCSBCvvq-V0bA4Kjew=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba8\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:74:\"Fast service kahit take out or Drive thru. may enough space for big groups\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-12-27T06:13:08.656341Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";s:96:\"Popular Philippines-based chain globally known for its famed fried chicken, spaghetti & burgers.\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:14;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJFXk5eT3GljMR-tqJShvUA8s\";s:4:\"name\";s:8:\"Jollibee\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.487512400000002;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.59659459999999;s:7:\"address\";s:90:\"G/F Metrotown Mall, McArthur Hway, cor Juan Luna St, Tarlac City, 2300 Tarlac, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:10:\"restaurant\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.1;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:146;s:7:\"reviews\";i:146;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:457:\"places/ChIJFXk5eT3GljMR-tqJShvUA8s/photos/AVoNoXR7MiA3ihEuUYKwnKRcUvOiKMIzY5riGvnA0JguIJ8eBNjv0lRyTyO8zAFRP52-XLItTyf1WlOXtB-jMsGm4ff