ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:165:\"It so hard and difficult finding the way of living the new generation of life.. But God hold me tight til i reach the unbeatable stars⭐? God bless us always?\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-12-14T12:33:30.691332042Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:11:\"Mae Lumanog\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:116:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLykFdXJIpmaekPYQhHQTbISPnR54-B2OKDZ69I9N7EOKQC0w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:57:\"The food is very delicious, and the service is incredible\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-03-01T09:19:44.988558647Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:10:\"Jaspher T.\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX0RITUcyqfkk-b9XeiE53choJPufTfGaDzHN-aPIW-gwcHIwly=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:958:\"[0Star - it should be rated as black hole]\nI was on the que for a considerable amount of time, patiently waiting as I am the last customer on the said que.\n\nWhen my turn at the till finally arrives, the crew told me to use the order kiosk instead as she will not take any order without the kiosk ticket. However, the person in front of me was able to order directly to the staff without kiosk ticket.\n\nAlso, the que for the kiosk started to build-up (the one and only order kiosk, also not visible enough interms of ergonomic and foot traffic flow)  -and they want me to waste another considerable amount of time just to get an order ticket.\n\nTaking/Giving order should be streamlined and the staffs should be able to adjust according to the situation. I hope they should be considerate enough.\n\nWe ended up going to the adjacent McDonald instead - with multiple [4] and well lighted order kiosk, ample space, multiple staffs at the till, and faster service.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2025-06-07T03:10:12.183700Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:31:\"Stephanie Ann Savellano-Cadawas\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUPQqJGvCdT6Ng-pOiVv7XrUKUrPjvdEl6Xds_HTEYxQHwh_11fjw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\";s:6:\"rating\";i:3;s:4:\"text\";s:330:\"They need to expand or transfer to a bigger location with drive thru.\n\nTheir comfort rooms have improved a lot. During my last visit, the female CR was clean. Water closets have flushes. Sink has enough and reasonable flow of water. Hand soap, hand sanitizer and hand dryer / blower are all available and are working respectively.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-03-05T08:10:09.939475448Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:16:\"Norlando De Leon\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:121:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIlxkmkOfnsPoWuZzr2DzZVM9vy6G2fYU1lW80gV1Z9W7MOWpY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:275:\"Convenience for customers is really bad. They don\'t have the option to order over the counter. They will ask you to go to the kiosk even if you are already in line. Very long waiting time to serve orders compared to other stores. Are they in slomo compared with other stores?\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-01-01T02:47:27.471134Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";s:96:\"Popular Philippines-based chain globally known for its famed fried chicken, spaghetti & burgers.\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:18;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJR8J4aQBDkTMREn3yD6PFzGs\";s:4:\"name\";s:26:\"Jollibee Calasiao Bayan DT\";s:3:\"lat\";d:16.0102237;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.358229;s:7:\"address\";s:56:\"Magic, Victoria Place, Calasiao, Pangasinan, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:10:\"restaurant\";s:6:\"rating\";d:3.6;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:37;s:7:\"reviews\";i:37;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:476:\"places/ChIJR8J4aQBDkTMREn3yD6PFzGs/photos/AVoNoXSOPM6ExnJYA9NLRbcxcKO-TQ-8knma058Jemc1Zbr09-vGYUwwQ7g6N_I4CdhPwf5WrL1H_le0DCLdhUmNqHHQV-olEZxUXMyUXJXUA1m--lzpHmbDvuHoC6jCV3RcX2bj