last Wednesday, almost every order was not available. We wanted a proper meal and ended up with 2 burgers and a palabok. And staff said it’s their last, I can only order one palabok. It’s just 7:30pm and it seems they already ran out of food. We were there last Sunday too. Breakfast after church with my family. SAME THING. We needed to follow-up 3 times before the food came out in installment. It is the closest “supposed fastfood” on our way home that’s why it is convenient, but you just keep getting better and better at disappointing us. Probably don’t call it fastfood, be open for 24 hrs, and have a drive-thru if it’s half-baked and your service is like this. Never had problems with other branches. This is so frustrating\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-08-16T12:08:14.232074007Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:4:\"Mate\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:117:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIGGuDIcRKgHmxFjkVdgh9Ouzg_xDa9GMcYrC3-qJIKo7AMnAw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:183:\"Worst Jollibee experience! First time getting a missing order and wrong items. The crews are in bad condition for the job. I recommend that you look for another branch instead of this\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-01-29T08:45:02.066028476Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Joshua Intal\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJC37uinibb7VlqhjjVmaBPgRzx00vONij9yff6OA0flHdEnKb-=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:196:\"Looking forward to trying their Chickenjoy and Jolly Spaghetti once the doors open. This spot is going to be a go-to for quick bites and late-night cravings. Welcome to the neighborhood, Jollibee!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-08-08T15:10:49.639993734Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"Cherry Behagan\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:118:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVw0RrwAtolJh7FK9WrvTTL97llSz-CFzU5wWUU0URyECFoyjA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:791:\"Very Disappointed with My Order and Service\n\nI recently ordered the Family Super Meal from Jollibee through Foodpanda, which was supposed to include 6 pieces of chicken, 3 rice, 3 sides, and 3 drinks. However, my order was incomplete — I only received the chicken and rice, but no sides and only one drink.\n\nWhat made it worse was that the receipt they sent me was incorrect, and when I tried to reach out, they didn’t seem to care or take responsibility for the mistake. I was very frustrated and disappointed because I expected better service from a well-known brand like Jollibee.\n\nThis experience really ruined my meal and my trust in their delivery service. I hope Jollibee and Foodpanda can improve their order accuracy and customer support, because what happened was unacceptable.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-11-11T07:30:27.771956003Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:21:\"Angel Ann Roy Cunanan\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVbLFLOy-Hb6RbAaeoZuF5cSXHQPlORLbMdogrjfrfiWMVwGOw-=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:29:\"good service and fast service\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-08-27T02:01:31.857789996Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";s:96:\"Popular Philippines-based chain globally known for its famed fried chicken, spaghetti & burgers.\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}}',1789459900),('laravel-cache-rapidapi_search_04f0873bbcab9fab623c2f91a2154500_15.686_120.419','a:1:{i:0;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJmW_ZzcSzljMRPnikul-7WQk\";s:4:\"name\";s:38:\"Lucky Chan Chinese Filipino Restaurant\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.686228100000001;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.418632;s:7:\"address\";s:39:\"MCP9+FFR, Camiling, Tarlac, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:10:\"restaurant\";s:6:\"rating\";d:3.8;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:27;s:7:\"reviews\";i:27;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s