. Our requested in-house tea was not served that we need to follow it up. Obviously, the server is not attentive. We dine in one of their private rooms and it has a lot of flies. Overall, it\'s not a good experience. This is not an authentic chinese restaurant.❌️\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-04-08T23:26:38.125805Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:17:\"Beautiful Memoirs\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKHar2DIOYD-SbRcvKjigGupXyZ2ogQZDJG4EPLJBEyrDQByQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\";s:6:\"rating\";i:3;s:4:\"text\";s:165:\"Food is alright. There were not a lot of selection for buffet. The only thing I liked was the beef and the rest not so much. The staff are very friendly and helpful.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2025-02-14T22:26:53.129840Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Danece Penicate\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWJc-5e_0qWXo-I3q6JvBWkwvh3M_kGflgBm5N9ogvov40K370O=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:224:\"For food its unsanitized. Yang chow fried rice with houseflies and rat droppings toppings.\nAtmosphere, with houseflies flying around the table while we eat.\nService, we experience some unaccommodating staffs.\nNot recommended\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-04-29T05:07:13.536419Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:17:\"Grace Diane Melad\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKov1Ua921xkh5Q1qrXORL_JgeDKjyJ2xNSqzSuvFE_QnnB_daj=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:192:\"Service was really good. Very attentive staff. The food we ordered came out really quick. We had the Combo good for 5-6 people. The serving was a lot!! Good quantity and quality for the price.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2022-12-11T10:12:21.595258Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Albert Abidin\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:116:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIr1x741WO59AByzlZfCAPJHLhkTFLGdMwKCqpO6ZjmgNyQ7Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:2;s:4:\"text\";s:180:\"Clean place, food didn\'t take long. Lots of seafood choices.\n\nI don\'t recommend the steamed rice. The first batch had lots of ants in it. So they brought more but it had ants also.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2019-12-16T03:40:16.248750Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}}',1789630701),('laravel-cache-rapidapi_search_1422a238f0537e63cca8deca1d4b009c_15.712_120.368','a:2:{i:0;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJVSABPwKkkTMRyyCzUZaCQPE\";s:4:\"name\";s:27:\"Mines View Observation Deck\";s:3:\"lat\";d:16.4195651;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.62785879999998;s:7:\"address\";s:40:\"Mines View, Baguio, Benguet, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:8:\"landmark\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.3;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:14085;s:7:\"reviews\";i:14085;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:478:\"places/ChIJVSABPwKkkTMRyyCzUZaCQPE/photos/AVoNoXR9f1zTa-nDVgxxoSqXrft3av08ISKnoz-4p2EI3_8mtrlW_HYsC8a1RcWyEQmj6KGcXibQBammccdF-L-BjnwsdBeLtDrPAlkv-7OFG5rtZNT8iEYZJ3TKLC0rmV080wtP6Vc9d7P74-r8wO4fQROU0DDLOnveHrTUknfFe13So4flPq5OcTvzS9P0IOHP8JOVNyaC1DUtcQxtbtSKzNxTsZ29czwYOC7VKii4PN9E5yH0aAgKqEyj4QrpHuMAiQF8vs8bOjx0LoBfXRC4NIOzcVP7Tgj6-BzKMMqiHARZpxKSoDxpCgav6DK5ZLp7XRc5k4BF6IaWKLs62h8hEl5jI0c1T-FgvaAowVHt2fjWzSbtegXisCUNYsrCwLoV3ywDCiTDy3Q6jvdZn-UYtydBNAaetlzZsJMJixyatM0i-miz\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:6:{i:0;s:478:\"places/ChIJVSABPwKkkTMRyyCzUZaCQPE/photos/AVoNoXR9f1zTa-nDVgxxoSqXrft3av08ISKnoz-4p2EI3_8mtrlW_HYsC8a1RcWyEQmj6KGcXibQBammccdF-L-BjnwsdBeLtDrPAlkv-7OFG5rtZNT8iEYZJ3TKLC0rmV080wtP6Vc9d7P74-r8wO4fQROU0DDLOnveHrTUknfFe13So4flPq5OcTvzS9P0IOHP8JOVNyaC1DUtcQxtbtSKzNxTsZ29czwYOC7VKii4PN9E5yH0aAgKqEyj4QrpHuMAiQF8vs8bOjx0LoBfXRC4NIOzcVP7Tgj6-BzKMMqiHARZpxKSoDxpCgav6DK5ZLp7XRc5k4BF6IaWKLs62h8hEl5jI0c1T-FgvaAowVHt2fjWzSbtegXisCUNYsrCwLoV3ywDCiTDy3Q6jvdZn-UYtydBNAaetlzZsJMJixyatM0i-miz\";i: