SIAG0cjJDBhxWZl68LDR78VdfMqmSG3416bj6S67TU8wJtWNnvCKFfpu_\";i:4;s:492:\"places/ChIJs0hWPgKkkTMRoGuurDgtCrs/photos/AVoNoXSjuK4QtT-28fGGcafNClqcBi8T7pFkbd-zR41X6CPEGjs0Jye-NIJA2Q5XCqSaoG_RMqrZBu6q5fxuo0N-RoFsDVHVAHCLTQqug62r7ynvcemkRJn24W3y91zb3Ez2jH-mNhfgRJFSnYqQeBw6IVOpyh_ymSibRE459r71AntdEbf2AFu7xHL1LwO8DAatmJThjCg9kNy3wCnuE8l9_-jIBJZJqT69pxAwSKL-43IF4qUXGxT7Xxqiw7g-6E6mr7PvCoJ57f_C2peEHDsOek8XwEWqz2-rHuCgkS4wLO3QHkCNwQkQ6QevOy4Dm4KIJKzeXI_dhhARc-u6b0k9RV7Ve0brIKmyIGgpgoAOXGrEyUVC2yJ96kG32gVFPd5nw567dWM6gMR6rbuCg7KBMdDcxZ5xEieigFOrkWw0NG_1VD0V0letPG6csCOSaA\";i:5;s:494:\"places/ChIJs0hWPgKkkTMRoGuurDgtCrs/photos/AVoNoXTQjaZSfykD7y2yOnoqXiod4_pNztq_Z-TMopbRVrvWEae25na3eISJhAWapHPEhYb2NnbqYPyvVr67CCL69ghN3T5ujrEyyu555vIPfnh8lwJnVbqBJE6DhGfO2KOvcO5kO54OXz8zdwpYWlSw6zrApHokohupB1LYhq9WP1Z0viaeQ1VJkavS4TUK4dR-w0UD5_ReW-EZ6Zjue9gBBl56E-NQZMi_0280MGpY7Za8FLMK0NiodP5byTCAMKKgpSxz4wb1GdJJWx_NbOJ4aw3xs7ELeJLb2hcmBxdM1VL9Uv457HqdkA0sMVLbAWBMgscdcJZzyV3uP-DCCaH_uVFdr6yfERhLhFpmpEekm8G5rkjn0RbkhnJnjFwPvS89xjpYZlkl4zzwI9axtMA47K4216_2GFTOwkdUAMjtBRyvy4yTQAQvAfAiZNtd0Lpk\";}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:5:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:18:\"The Waray Wanderer\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWOYFoGpYephguUfZe6MtUF6X6g9sqzyN6s__6AfSeR4rPFuYE=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:405:\"You can enjoy the beautiful mountain landscapes during sunrise and experience the perfect spot to wear traditional Cordilleran attire. Pasalubong and souvenirs are also available at affordable prices. Food stalls and restaurants are available, offering scenic mountain views. There are also photo opportunities with tourist horses and St. Bernard dog in the area, which children will really enjoy so much.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-05-07T03:04:03.787106287Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:4:\"Sean\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX6Zlg48MfCCrwo_pnlQOSFd_ajcGgkpiifODJV1osL3sSd9UH9=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:262:\"The view is spectacular. While it does get a bit crowded, there is plenty of space to move around comfortably. A variety of activities are available, including binocular viewing, cultural outfits, horseback riding, food vendors, plant shops, and strawberry taho.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-01-24T23:19:58.873504222Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:19:\"Richard A Francisco\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVKB3RUhFLtt7ImosmwoSu6nunMGPyPyAxwHXozmwk8SfivDzjhcQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba8\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:364:\"Mines View Park is one of the famous parks in Baguio. This used to be a park where the can see the silver mines hence the name. But as the mines closed down, only the observation deck remained. The area for renovated bit by bit until it became more like a market than a park. You\'ll need to pay at the entrance to get in. You\'ll also have to pay to use the toilet.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-03-22T14:15:15.230241587Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:4:\"Kith\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUxE9qC033O3bYgcvPU--Cj1Def-MveRXyjMe1GftBiaaBQBmCc=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:310:\"Beyond enjoying the view, you can also ride a horse (for photos), take pics with a Saint Bernard, and even rent a traditional costume here (please note that these are not free). If you’re looking to buy plants, you should definitely visit this place! Plus, a great spot to find cheaper prices for pasalubong.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-07-25T10:25:48.167264236Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:9:\"Stephen V\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:121:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIFiX2rvxohdw-9M3dTOi4ndD-SKmMnfsuDIRG1Dqgq7rCdy90=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:332:\"It’s would be nice if there are multiple viewing spots around here, especially ones that require a quiet place to sit.\n\nWe were caught in the rain, but everyone unanimously agreed it was time to sit still and listen.\n\nSitting down here, the rain conquering all other sounds, makes the endless mountains covered by fog more scenic.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-06-24T15:23:53.591870497Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}}',1789631020),('laravel-cache-rapidapi_search_292e7731c46812ec5c468fee26076400_15.663_120.55','a:1:{i:0;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJq9tELgCzljMRJvBxC0EOd_4\";s:4:\"name\";s:32:\"PS 3 Tuec-Romulo Pumping Station\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.6645669;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.4124292;s:7:\"address\";s:44:\"25 Romulo Hwy, Camiling, Tarlac, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:3:\"poi\";s:6:\"rating\";N;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:0;s:7:\"reviews\";i:0;s:15:\"photo_reference\";N;s:16:\"photo_references\";a:0:{}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:0:{}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}}',1789628073),('laravel-cache-rapidapi_search_292e7731c46812ec5c468fee26076400_15.689_120.612','a:1:{i:0;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJq9tELgCzljMRJvBxC0EOd_4\";s:4:\"name\";s:32:\"PS 3 Tuec-Romulo Pumping Station\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.6645669;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.4124292;s:7:\"address\";s:44:\"25 Romulo Hwy, Camiling, Tarlac, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:3:\"poi\";s:6:\"rating\";N;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:0;s:7:\"reviews\";i:0;s:15:\"photo_reference\";N;s:16:\"photo_references\";a:0:{}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:0:{}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}}',1789631047),('laravel-cache-rapidapi_search_292e7731c46812ec5c468fee26076400_15.694_120.612','a:1:{i:0;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJq9tELgCzljMRJvBxC0EOd_4\";s:4:\"name\";s:32:\"PS 3 Tuec-Romulo Pumping Station\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.6645669;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.4124292;s:7:\"address\";s:44:\"25 Romulo Hwy, 