t time...10 dry /old pieces +4 rice...2nd time....10 pieces + 4 rice. ...crust slightly burnt / old ...never again.\n\nWill go to the Narcisco Street location in person where the Chicken Star is yummy !!!!.....never again at Balibago MacArthur Hwy.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2025-03-17T13:38:42.895617Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:5:\"Mikey\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUIIP3YGH6GWVfYnUoL5WizuvGU1QgMtPVOaW3432biYelpjiQMgA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:208:\"Food and the service is Awesome!\nWe keep going back back and back for MORE.\nThe restaurant is little old so it can use little bit of TLC.\n(We always take out so doesn\'t bother us much)\nThank you Chicken Star!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-01-19T23:30:37.421705Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:16:\"Pascal Petitjean\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXRQntbbGio3afttVF-xTi0AxiQm7bWEP5vmMDaRiOqZwL96lH-=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:48:\"Super friendly, welcoming staff.  really perfect\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-06-16T23:58:05.467612Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:9:\"keizer kz\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJl9OHjCgpKL3H115VB4pIxhPVuoFMNIjQ5PnOSl6PIYUZ3Zw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\";s:6:\"rating\";i:3;s:4:\"text\";s:222:\"I usually give Chicken Star 5 stars, but at this branch in Balibago, their gravy is always thin and fatty. I\'ve bought here 4 to 5 times and it\'s always really thin. I\'ll only change it to 5 stars when their gravy is good.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-02-21T16:18:23.627285Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Rowel Pamintuan\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:118:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWO9x3CH-j_qIUL-C6CALzrRKj8NGfmL8qZJnwSLZb2su3dZNA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:144:\"I ordered it yesterday for my Grandma\'s bday? it\'s so worth the 235, it\'s so delicious! It\'s perfect, perfect!?? I\'ll make it again?\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2021-10-11T22:31:07.160005Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:8;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJi3FYc5zzljMR360tbn9KUDE\";s:4:\"name\";s:12:\"Chicken Star\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.165768;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.58326369999999;s:7:\"address\";s:51:\"950 Fields Ave, Angeles, 2009 Pampanga, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:10:\"restaurant\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:1;s:7:\"reviews\";i:1;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:476:\"places/ChIJi3FYc5zzljMR360tbn9KUDE/photos/AVoNoXStA66vO2yC2YgtGIwmtrpaUsb4Jq0y3fU_sc9TPw8BbNV5EEAWf0VTtQA-UdixqNrI1n1z-qq1AWnFceAkkrEawxVKX3BnXbrD1YOClSzCFxGgFQmTSF4iYOocaHBgmMrZRd8t-dJ_7Mr645lxyqiONT7MKoo3fF-8o98MDKBPLUW9ZozWOJyAeT-i5UZDWuPmKQJaAZemgoO4eeU3rkf_3_Cj-6z__PG4RlB4cQsM4eQBFnphMmCISuwE0Mc_OZLkq6IZHldX9kB_8rOaACeKMfGrN_Vcmia-oBRCyUqkwEwy0oUphroGEtkfH_VhbsTxvX4nRl68DK2HFUYxR9L-jCjlpsGy1NMcxRpf1JVt5QN6Dg6r_RZKksMkozACU4P1my2iAO1dPqMD-HTZZnBMQoCqbchdJrO_HUlpP9eATQ\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:3:{i:0;s:476:\"places/ChIJi3FYc5zzljMR360tbn9KUDE/photos/AVoNoXStA66vO2yC2YgtGIwmtrpaUsb4Jq0y3fU_sc9TPw8BbNV5EEAWf0VTtQA-UdixqNrI1n1z-qq1AWnFceAkkrEawxVKX3BnXbrD1YOClSzCFxGgFQmTSF4iYOocaHBgmMrZRd8t-dJ_7Mr645lxyqiONT7MKoo3fF-8o98MDKBPLUW9ZozWOJyAeT-i5UZDWuPmKQJaAZemgoO4eeU3rkf_3_Cj-6z__PG4RlB4cQsM4eQBFnphMmCISuwE0Mc_OZLkq6IZHldX9kB_8rOaACeKMfGrN_Vcmia-oBRCyUqkwEwy0oUphroGEtkfH_VhbsTxvX4nRl68DK2HFUYxR9L-jCjlpsGy1NMcxRpf1JVt5QN6Dg6r_RZKksMkozACU4P1my2iAO1dPqMD-HTZZnBMQoCqbchdJrO_HUlpP9eATQ\";i:1;s:478:\"places/ChIJi3FYc5zzljMR360tbn9KUDE/photos/AVoNoXT2Ga7cbJupriLTHjFsrK9NSXtdt9RLf0gEuSIpF6Ptri5HJvmUZO7vGLn4_hKhZdG-WMrgbqsy9tlSHhzK-eGL7qawTUiYx5K2TBeDYZHannoDpo8RZA-6FFqTh6OYSBKgJR15VorjXhPTb5yiEcDtA9VXb5U4utphuTFlA4YjDHhNytIj_IBScJpR_bMwSD7X7Sn-Nzwgdk4Pd-otx3IElNksG519iEnC8hihs