 the place has a small signage so during the day it can be difficult to spot. We visited lated in the evening around 10pm, the place was not busy actually we were the only customer there. We bout rice with chicken and chicken wrap. Both tased good and fresh, staff was helpful and prepared the order in front of quickly. Since this 24hours open, a good option to have a quick bite. They have sufficient sitting capacity for around 18-20 persons at time, though we take out our food. Would recommend anyone like the kind of food they serve. The menu image I added with review is taken on March 11, 2025, price may get change over time by Turks.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2025-03-11T15:54:17.236673Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:16:\"Justine Dongayao\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUHM2XHadG-Tk1mHBUtjBQORBW69B28yoQHv4Eh0Obw2z67Y076hg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:518:\"Quick Review: Place is not that easily spotted, small entrance but has a plenty of dining space. Not a lot of customers when we took our orders and waiting time may take 10-15 minutes. Food is cooked fresh and served warm, we ordered the chicken steak and tastes superb, unfortunately, serving size (especially rice) was too small (portion) for its price. Has only street parking and limited (you may park at Porta and take a few steps to reach this resto). Overall, it was a nice meal and might be coming back (3.6/5)\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2025-02-23T05:32:43.107523Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:1:\"J\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVW6j76p55Cl8PEM_5RN1eJ4-aweYXPPrBtZo4-CYo3O4TqYdY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:537:\"My dining experience at this restaurant was fantastic. The interior was neat and well-maintained, making for a comfortable and pleasant atmosphere. Though the pita bread was slightly chewy, it was nonetheless delicious and complemented the dish well. The fact that the restaurant is open 24/7 adds to its convenience, making it a great option for any time of day. Additionally, the staff provided exceptional service, ensuring that we had an enjoyable visit. Overall, I highly recommend this restaurant and would love to come back again.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-04-22T15:53:03.478845Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Nico Remiendo\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:118:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUtadta2C_T4Br6sFgnVLX09AoD34818slTJxZtWxb85598zrM=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:405:\"Tried Turks at Session Road and honestly, it was disappointing. The servers weren’t approachable, which already set a negative tone. The serving size was also very small for what you pay. What bothered me most was the staff preparing the food—didn’t seem welcoming at all, and there was no effort to confirm my order before serving it. Definitely not the experience I expected.\n\nKainis talaga si ate\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-04-07T11:20:24.353410901Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:11:\"Ashley Fern\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVOCrwDS_M_eBAvxxPaS6ns-psHsv1iVOQlqAi4QysjOy5na23s=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:570:\"A DISAPPOINTING EXPERIENCE! The crew member who handled our order showed an unapproachable and unfriendly attitude, which really affected our visit. Customer service is a big part of the dining experience, and unfortunately, this interaction fell short.\n\nI hope management can address this and provide better customer service training. If a staff member is not comfortable dealing with customers, it might be better to assign them to a role that doesn’t involve direct interaction. I’m sharing this feedback in the hope that service can improve for future customers.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-04-07T11:21:43.739060124Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:5;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJEXrD-LvzljMRNmFMOwI21dI\";s:4:\"name\";s:5:\"Turks\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.146406500000001;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.59490179999997;s:7:\"address\";s:40:\"196, R-9, Angeles, Pampanga, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:10:\"restaurant\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.5;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:2;s:7:\"reviews\";i:2;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:477:\"places/ChIJEXrD-LvzljMRNmFMOwI21dI/photos/AVoNoXQ7rXY4MjUfqtRwpmlJ5GhoBAH3ilSNVptYaXmvozrOi84rSw28ukVC1w_cy9K0ahwUG2LshbExurhkV8BaZMxkx5WXp7CmBsQ1p3xb8xWXaArINvr8rkXgjcQ3B2_jiRTBzoJJlJyUuFub5qN328wPq18AO76aFZ4-aJ1qAWU74-tCCkYPgVaWcsX11HUz57DUWumRORUKsj9jtPCc6ac44sYj8LISJ-ckc5EYe1Ko8EtUFaZhtOVlCXALMFzNDsrmy2bYssU5tUaqKv2CpnxTCv0V7wEkbmr_WD_pPXhFsAmsCg5eNFMiXzsJNR0Gttzf-SyYZ74z7wm_X3Uimq_YFKjq4OYyOcc2Jo35Pw9HuczLc_12ZOp11IrAoqhCCwyzdj0cbeSf6pG1f-wCuunnXkYK0SpdBTKQHuEw6Zrar2w\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:6:{i:0;s:477:\"places/ChIJEXrD-LvzljMRNmFMOwI21dI/photos/AVoNoXQ7rXY4MjUfqtRwpmlJ5GhoBAH3ilSNVptYaXmvozrOi84rSw28ukVC1w_cy9K0ahwUG2LshbExurhkV8BaZMxkx5WXp7CmBsQ1p3xb8xWXaArINvr8rkXgjcQ3B2_jiRTBzoJJlJyUuFub5qN328wPq18AO76aFZ4-aJ1qAWU74-tCCkYPgVaWcsX11HUz57DUWumRORUKsj9jtPCc6ac44sYj8LISJ-ckc5EYe1Ko8EtUFaZhtOVlCXALMFzNDsrmy2bYssU5tUaqKv2CpnxTCv0V7wEkbmr_WD_pPXhFsAmsCg5eNFMiXzsJNR0Gttzf-SyYZ74z7wm_X3Uimq_YFKjq4OYyOcc2Jo35Pw9HuczLc_12ZOp11IrAoqhCCwyzdj0cbeSf6pG1f-wCuunnXkYK0SpdBTKQHuEw6Zrar2w\";i:1;s:478:\"places/ChIJEXrD-LvzljMRNmFMOwI21dI/photos/AVoNoXTkpnkWHMXLfplBpKTClC6LjvwUKJdudXgXNXNnmF_niaBJ2llKrw7cs8QifZFfEFekGKFh-S10ojTYP1IXx_Fi2xgXvIq_DTdElEUIx7M-s2Q2Z7tuvM3OJ8tlc1WgG_25369qBb4OitHdqkJHEzuQAzp70F1Nt5IU2G-h90LNa_Y4laS1EKN_ebuAuXSkl_uZMX6AH6bGF85gTtrFLRUFoLYizMHiyN3aajqkmr5Yyi-PUiiOovrCsSQkkeR1dbH_1VyRGbGPr9hiNG6dCdjmyudGIh77gpX4rvPnfUE3p4CPIwMwC_48SNCBRYXuB-jhZjhs3FU1Mt8YyMlSTS8An09mbX8jduLpQL2SSL3ge23DKr7503kfM6E1ikKQsTyfF4uvKYof0GF_La_IIWmVN5S0tGoddXPA_4eWkVGO-1xd\";i:2;s: