stamp\";s:27:\"2025-06-10T07:16:21.832668Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:10:\"BJ Rabacca\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:116:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLmIss_clBNKeQS4Kr_EfGVNlgwagMkUT4hZrJHN-82W7z_rQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:128:\"Turks SM City Pampanga! Dec 05,2025 (PM) . May attitude ung male cashier on duty .  Looks like same guy on the recent review?\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-12-05T14:18:34.369330174Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:7:\"Jen Rox\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:116:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKR5-hWhTmJOFGj8qvw6QJODzHSy9BAX5gS5oCT8h9nUa4epQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:3;s:4:\"text\";s:393:\"The service pace was below expectations, especially considering there were four staff members present. One staff member appeared disengaged (playing around), which may have contributed to the delay. Additionally, another staff member was speaking while preparing food without wearing a mask. While not wearing a mask may be acceptable, speaking during food preparation raises hygiene concerns.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-08-12T13:07:23.134229780Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"carlo gaglione\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK78SlZGOCLEiGwMd5nw1dMDqURtfqM2FY46jNHU0X63e3o-w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:3;s:4:\"text\";s:371:\"Not turkish at all, ordered a chicken kebab wrap, chilli and salad. It came two little strips of chicken with sort of gravy over it, cucumber, salad and two small wrap tasted like pancakes. Lot of liquid inside which tasted awful and had no chilli at all. Although very cheap but it didn’t compensate the looks and taste of a bebab. Not nice experience to say the least\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-01-12T05:44:21.879325Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Crystal Force\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://lh3.