ahUI-zydlEroXfr31WiBjlPXHHeNJ02NqAeRYmBdIXUmLgesPfXxgoUmpULhWBVODMCEYxOsxWNKB0nO7gB5TCubfwm3AZLvd-WdYss4JHdlKi9yApzAeWX9uR1G6pXpSCgwda\";i:5;s:494:\"places/ChIJ59VntZI_kTMR8reSrZ8_5-k/photos/AVoNoXQGLPpyU4SeYTzS4Snd1PoPAmT-95xx12fciABqtHNz1s9AWjmjLD_1NIP-O9cwUuxM_IRpI7aoZtpbJ_P6dRmY_1aZUQmE2ehn8XCqxd6TLEjXOGStxIm0qwD1XaTwQUjVLwBO94xV9oZqijUhYPQxj8Hq1_M1yIJT55Kx-Ee4uPQxf-1Hp4HEwR9xLdTH9AYqCm20ixkRG9aNqAEPHv_wpihC66SZo4SqpZa3bm6Xu2sbCCCIZwZwGeGiO0mQvud_hq3sUiYpvPQUW96fPBM9dSypipiBETBcyPbFNoCYxPNaGA9vSfVt9ZLWPoNJkLA5PLpnMRCZDeLg9TyOT-1LmflXZIcOEg9wMlSNQ_Ux2H1h3R4uUsjBTZ4pl1Q0YZcW8okyfcsi8_xu9qheMfOHzZm5IR38sPP96boaHu4mee1TIMJdQxsp9kaj4JKe\";}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:3:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"Vergel Sevilla\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWvz-fdKl5xG6ZHxoAK94Rj8BMCvS1lvbnBytDkHmRCNxx_MhiY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba7\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:792:\"September 29, 2025 around 3:25 pm\nThey ask \"Dine in or take out?\" That\'s the best humor I heard today. I almost laughed when they asked this question.\n\nIt\'s always take out or to go.\n\nThey don\'t have tables or benches where you can dine. I sat down on Mang Inasal\'s chair, as it\'s always been or bring the food to Jollibee where my wife and I can sit. I still give the Atmosphere 5 because the stall is very accessible to customers and is not hard to find.\n\nThe service is good because they\'re quick to give the change, and they communicate well with customers.\n\nThe food is phenomenal. I love the taste of their pita bread. I always get the spicy beef ala carte at Php85. I believe it was less then, but it\'s still worth it. I believe that the serving is more in Turks Magic Mall than in SM.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-09-30T00:32:45.001990172Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"Giovanni Noble\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:116:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKmUh5CicgjjCZWdSDB6D7UmwTPX5CYjQ63joMDRjjUWCExhA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo