q1FnDCULCOQWQMgg0w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:385:\"The new main office of Turks Shawarma. Formerly located in commonwealth. It serves as a pick up point of stocks of the branches located in Metro Manila and the north branches outside the NCR. This main office doesn\'t cater or don\'t have a physical store inside. This building also serves as \"sambahan\" for the kapatid in Iglesia ni Cristo Owner is one of the member of the said church.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2021-08-31T13:13:24.985768Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Mayflor Reyes\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWcu7rcoF5kYIJ_RZFlCWXNVst5xVu-Xqifo3hRfb5hiffxQB11=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:322:\"i visited this place very often, because worship service of the members of Iglesia Ni Cristo was done at 3rd floor, a place where we can call and praise our Almighty God, a solemn place and we call this as House of Our Almighty God, when we are down, we get there to pray and to seek his mercy and forgiveness to our sins.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2019-08-16T12:57:26.919223Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:8:\"Meg Luna\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUSRFrsMkmmtU2OoWzlBS6SL1El4sASzuA7irXKVvEpWuHduJFJ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:67:\"This is the only shawarma I ate since 14 yrs old. Now, I\'m 22. ?\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2018-12-23T01:16:00.184371596Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:19:\"Kristiansen Ortanez\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUSIX0QeUOKqJD9oKb_tdsmWv9o8iVVENPp9oLS1MXERS2KidME=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:79:\"This is the Corporate Office of Turks. There is no shawarma and other products.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2019-07-17T07:55:39.852451Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\