\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Alberto Nicolis\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXlDiPnicLta0jaGnooOTUUWd5RmTMjMdCQFylUtr9y_pbL8ufu2g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba7\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:337:\"In the small food court—small because it only has five active stalls—I found Turks.\nI\'ve become a fan of the BEEF DONER ON RICE—with Java rice (cooked with turmeric, which gives it its yellow color) and a glass of Coke.\nStandard Manila menu, same price, same packaging, same appreciation (maybe just a little less beef than usual).\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2021-12-22T05:01:17.337251Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"Dreamy Mabalot\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:116:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIHPjwRtuICUKFjq6J8hXbLdce1SC-6QuqhvnwzPbbN2XdhTw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:360:\"Bad service, 1st time ever nmin \'Sana\' itry ung rice meal nila. Pero ung mga ngwoworkers dun imbes n help ka nla. How to order, rude p cla sa costumer. End hnd n lng kmi ng order.bad costumer service!!! Especially the man there, my age n nga hnd ata alam pinasung niang trbhu. Costumer service is very important. I hope sa management turaan cla ng good service\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2025-04-25T21:19:08.967155Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:13;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJvQM4qRfBljMRW1r2j1IYDVA\";s:4:\"name\";s:5:\"Turks\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.339953599999998;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.59364180000001;s:7:\"address\";s:38:\"Waltermart, Capas, Tarlac, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:10:\"restaurant\";s:6:\"rating\";N;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:0;s:7:\"reviews\";i:0;s:15:\"photo_reference\";N;s:16:\"photo_references\";a:0:{}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:0:{}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:14;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJA4KFfvhnkTMRGbf4BTl_aVs\";s:4:\"name\";s:24:\"Turks Me