 have an exact payment or 100 peso bill.\n\nAlways has no change for tender bill. Clearly against the Republic Act 10909.\n\nThey don’t have Gcash or any QR. just pure cash.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-01-26T08:39:32.555388270Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Miecah Patino\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXnJvg7YEda5m9XjKp3tEhGmaGBUNrcnIr1cDj3XglaBzFCQWgJ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:120:\"very rude server didnt even look at me when i asked if they accept QR payment needed to order pa sa grab so i can buy???\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-06-19T05:48:24.053825473Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Brandon Cohen\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWb0sMZi611ljJsIMbn6X_wISN01nMZod0cI88I2rV1FuwIpzUs=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:88:\"The food gave my whole family food poisoning. Never will be back. They are not sanitary.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-05-25T00:42:29.250280266Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:16;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJdUG9z20JlDMRtmHYzgnZ75c\";s:4:\"name\";s:5:\"Turks\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.7603793;s:3:\"lng\";d:119.91171030000001;s:7:\"address\";s:43:\"QW66+5M4, Santa Cruz, Zambales, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:10:\"restaurant\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:1;s:7:\"reviews\";i:1;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:476:\"places/ChIJdUG9z20JlDMRtmHYzgnZ75c/photos/AVoNoXQ05rBwvhRoJXwL29PNU0Zf74qaeyf-wvmuvONIH8Di3B65zP_XORwgJVF1nt1ERJ8R1KhAdVurH6r1Ykkp8r2LDOL-K-zLWO4jR6gKMGOXU9dx9M1VboBEDhlf-mve4v4OODXMdHvdnh8RNj7KflpgWET5YARZhYuEWrI0SlpoZd-Pyji67HIHLx7Ht9P3JEfiNfL_sjZ5TbUkOxhm0jONe0JhYN-jq9WzNeRRDq4ZtIRzr-DkIaAIUiL1vg3sImgEoRe9MViDvgWIVG77nWmv1uoa6M4u28mS8rEc-c6lhonONPN9PuoM7bi_keSQ5qQ5rpttIU9RTqs8GGFF0z9M-u0KaQTtXWTDO8zRSp9SEVag5OJ0pTcHWgPT7Bo4