y tables and chairs to be used by small and big groups of visitors. Food prices are fair and food taste good!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-06-12T22:51:14.620782Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:3:\"K J\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:121:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIwPnBe1ki_vtBuOs8RxgI2qpOLOV-n7aRj9V43UMJ_i39hTXc=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:466:\"My friends and I went to check the latest farm café near the 55 National Road in front of the Bestcap College.\n\nInitially, they don’t have foods in their menu but afterwards it was added.\n\nServe espresso, non coffee and frappe kind of bevs. I can say it’s good but mostly it’s sweet for my palate.\n\nAmbience is nice especially late noon - great time to grab a cup of coffee with friends and love ones.\n\nPrice is at par with the serving size.\n\nVisit and enjoy!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2021-11-08T02:41:47.096118Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:23:\"Alden Gabriel Dela Cruz\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVZczH-Yg5UW5Y4W2gyhV2UFdFMF_8tqceH0tt5Rm_J3fK-mmTX=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:2;s:4:\"text\";s:90:\"The coffee\'s are too sweet as a sweet tooth it is just to much?..... great ambient tho.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-02-14T12:58:23.926559881Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:23:\"ER Po (Account Dormant)\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXKjwciSxubhHT5OdvMA65mZyMFUmnu9ItLp1-feD3Nw7BnHxq6=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:476:\"The place is not crowded and it will not be crowded as the set-up of dining areas are distant enough for people who want personal spaces. And, minimal noise from vehicles at the adjacent main street of Mayantoc. Open air dining or coffee time is excellent. Foods from ihaw-ihaw to coffee and milk teas and snacks are available from three stalls. If you want a cozy place that has a sense of outdoor and nature feels, come to this place. Just a few kilometers from town center.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2021-12-29T23:30:05.695517Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}}',1788935181),('laravel-cache-rapidapi_search_3bb456795076327035222e96f745f2b4_15.711_120.368','a:1:{i:0;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJT8QveAOkkTMRsukWY41vhig\";s:4:\"name\";s:15:\"Mines View Park\";s:3:\"lat\";d:16.4216262;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.63005670000001;s:7:\"address\";s:45:\"Mines View Park, Baguio, Benguet, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:3:\"poi\";s:6:\"rating\";N;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:0;s:7:\"reviews\";i:0;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:477:\"places/ChIJT8QveAOkkTMRsukWY41vhig/photos/AVoNoXTqGN5GADFhcR6n9ZBFmCx9apEngnuH3T_IEBjObE-mGF5uSCKALyPevffvDaB8AopeZnFPM9biVjeNR2BZQo02cdgGIx13KE9a9oW9QU-MfwzFLJYigLrUyAoKxqKLyVVDlKb2J1Er1hD3SKftvhTknTrv2ZH0MxRbB_N3Q_E0hT0zTEwOZR8-WOlNXKaJwNfoRzjvaY2tskR1v5AevPHDQnS7lWqMymvSf5IJLhUPs-Lnv9NtgvOSHvSKa7Lz7npMac5PvdHOVf3qGlJlqKq_LLTKXzoSp9H6L81ZSy7sonnCD_CZSXOCRPjpkpWHvoAuYTDkId0qL0IAy8EzBSGkaRLte3CPIz1C7xRVuCUEPJF2BmIe_q_geTGXU3V1PzJuMPDyWZn5-_XPtm6WAsgS76Tsi7IOaOsZgUn45ubKnuk\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:6:{i:0;s:477:\"places/ChIJT8QveAOkkTMRsukWY41vhig/photos/AVoNoXTqGN5GADFhcR6n9ZBFmCx9apEngnuH3T_IEBjObE-mGF5uSCKALyPevffvDaB8AopeZnFPM9biVjeNR2BZQo02cdgGIx13KE9a9oW9QU-MfwzFLJYigLrUyAoKxqKLyVVDlKb2J1Er1hD3SKftvhTknTrv2ZH0MxRbB_N3Q_E0hT0zTEwOZR8-WOlNXKaJwNfoRzjvaY2tskR1v5AevPHDQnS7lWqMymvSf5IJLhUPs-Lnv9NtgvOSHvSKa7Lz7npMac5PvdHOVf3qGlJlqKq_LLTKXzoSp9H6L81ZSy7sonnCD_CZSXOCRPjpkpWHvoAuYTDkId0qL0IAy8EzBSGkaRLte3CPIz1C7xRVuCUEPJF2BmIe_q_geTGXU3V1PzJuMPDyWZn5-_XPtm6WAsgS76Tsi7IOaOsZgUn45ubKnuk\";i:1;s:478:\"places/ChIJT8QveAOkkTMRsukWY41vhig/photos/AVoNoXTql-v96_zAuIAUE8FjIuBP42og1EzN825cfwhdmeCoRo1v3LNAaPQgBdwqdFHU6KhMHE203JY-vEaIuh1DO1g2AJmCa6j_9TW82cmdeowppY7KTQEQKKtELRxZmqH37f2qIJ8BotejPleUaduAWTMEVT9BiDf5DiCUMIDUJ1cmDe