illed hito, pork bbqs, chicken bbqs, talong ensalada option inihaw na talong w/ bagoong. Friendly priced and they accept senior discounts.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2022-08-25T21:33:54.339278Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:18:\"Oliver Gil Beltran\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWl5wC9QkdsRMb6fFiT-mWOK03NH2H9ydlDJ4K3UyDM8NRR77OF=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:214:\"They have the best sisig ever. The authentic sisig kapampangan. Not the sizzling with an egg on top style.\n\nTheir lechon manok is also better than the other more popular brands that people in the Metro are used to.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2018-09-13T16:47:29.514415Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:2;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJ-ZzTGQDPljMRS98eiFXc6UU\";s:4:\"name\";s:14:\"Kuya bob Pares\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.553750099999997;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.6723177;s:7:\"address\";s:52:\"HM3C+GW4, San Jacinto, Victoria, Tarlac, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:10:\"restaurant\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:1;s:7:\"reviews\";i:1;s:15:\"photo_reference\";N;s:16:\"photo_references\";a:0:{}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:1:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:16:\"Alpie S. Gadores\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXh2q2LBYo7W01CGSYvpgYspPXPFsCeyzn3MuBiNLruYKrjf0T3=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-08-25T12:27:34.694080901Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:3;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJRTydm9o_ljMRKkJ4QQDyFvY\";s:4:\"name\";s:25:\"Victor Paresan Beef Pares\";s:3:\"lat\";d:14.6444408;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.53745660000001;s:7:\"address\";s:67:\"JGVP+QXG, Gov. J.J. Linao National Road, Pilar, Bataan, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:10:\"res