re is also fresh fish for sale right at the resort, so seafood goals are a must.\n? If you love activities, there is the banana boat ride that is super fun! ?‍?‍\nPerfect spot to recharge, reset and enjoy life by the sea. ✨\n#BeachLife #SeafoodGoals #BananaBoatFun #ResetModeOn\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-05-09T07:00:06.693789547Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:21:\"Xenia Arianna Orduela\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:118:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXUes90uJwMhoeNC0_HxsKccoWu5c0zOT_TpS2WJUU9jSBpQ9o=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:91:\"The owners are very accommodating and kind. The place is quiet. You will really find peace.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2025-05-24T18:27:20.740409Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:16:\"Khalfan Punsalan\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:121:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXa0VigBYWVSnel9srozX3IT3Cny1IziS24PpVsxrJY_ht6XQ5LQw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2025-03-30T22:31:28.569122Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:11;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJH7My69mgkTMR9v0n4BGoPvM\";s:4:\"name\";s:21:\"Kennon Road Viewpoint\";s:3:\"lat\";d:16.3751583;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.60707849999999;s:7:\"address\";s:90:\"Purok 7, 9JG4+3MP Zigzag, Camp 7, Kennon Rd, Camp 7, 54, Baguio, 2600 Benguet, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:8:\"landmark\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.4;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:697;s:7:\"reviews\";i:697;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:476:\"places/ChIJH7My69mgkTMR9v0n4BGoPvM/photos/AVoNoXTYoIcmdrvWGE8f2bFb2uARYNNLEEtzwfE18calBScuKS1wzIU0eEkKqrIn5nrzjJpXH52L9EltaF-3-ry8HaTAN2NgTs5GKvk3sHXTxF0OgOQL9BmgvaOmPqXhs7M8ED9X3fFfJxq9QgGdnDju-71Wgu-BkT9T5hWQb3xUYRp1kh6xBbWzUl2mP14kP3jEXg2tozgKoDPBWWZz2ZO7ZgZ3AIm-IR2LE9K_rOBvNnDd5B4-SYNaCKqZSMDCAI4KRca6SvsLU4c9KZsWbsSHUN-vztncyY0tyfAMiPznMiJGVO7fmVFzuzKDb_URjSAxCs7VY7