 the vicinity has a coffee shop called positivity cafe that offers affordable food with many choices. The coffee shop is so lovely because it has a great view of the kennon road.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-03-06T09:16:26.045136Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Emir Arnaldo\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLYOHAMG-2PWf4CVmmrUp-Vsdvziq1gkhKGVTNgZMmRv3fq6Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:186:\"The location and view were spectacular. The structure however, was much less so, suffering from countless years of neglect. Here\'s to hoping that a newer view deck is built in its place.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-10-28T23:43:27.533023369Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Nico Aguilar\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWdTaCsDXJKQqvtCHAco4xVLhiHUbPmvWhGskyzuKoVRIIjCWEI9g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:177:\"Very nice viewdeck of the zigzag road of Kennon. You can view the Lion\'s Head from up here. It\'s also a memorial of the Japanese and Filipinos that build the road way back then.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-12-17T18:56:40.213658Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:10:\"iamrrabbit\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX9S9pvCpT_9IxQrT2stQHXt-6gT_sBPt3K6EeIXoRYTFTjLI0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:68:\"Ample parking , paid CR but clean , you can buy local souvenirs here\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-07-23T20:35:43.771665309Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:11:\"Sheryll Ico\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUHUlfqdc3B07CMLFpwZ-bCOhsJjM0dWaJeDMixVk2cYtkGMZ_J_w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba7\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:92:\"Still one of those view decks to see when in Kennon Road. Awesome view on the famous zigzag!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-11-05T03:10:41.270183Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:12;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJuyn1NgADkTMRkSN7U7pWroI\";s:4:\"name\";s:29:\"Malico Viewpoint Inn & Eatery\";s:3:\"lat\";d:16.1679758;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.85835649999999;s:7:\"address\";s:36:\"Santa Fe, Nueva Vizcaya, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:10:\"restaurant\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.6;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:16;s:7:\"reviews\";i:16;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:494:\"places/ChIJuyn1NgADkTMRkSN7U7pWroI/photos/AVoNoXQvo4S0zLLUcggXE4FyJH15eKp2UWuaYgaQc0uLANUtjwH_rUhTWPj9NZQoJVJOVkRcXBh9J8E6etSsLE1v7RRInD6RxTRy0wbFcafRVxG257tBtMKrNATuiYw5_NHg5HMRmP66XHasAYv3OkdkODwf9uZVLFa3MoD5gPRH-7BEs7CHcz7oZL6abByZQr8VorSXU84TwlhWktSeDrJt4Z-xRCfhGLxLWdMUSddwf0Q0Hk0eknA7ZsP94jbOUeNlyQdHTdoxiNkKmKZ63xW0J_GUaRv5qTTFZN7OJncjS2uV2GTrZHmjhQc-6ZoPmw-vMyCe8TXup8v3Gbb6JiTCSWrKBZxMzq6DiShupU_CtHAUtFoICW5dPRXdBlvOQzPtYic_bdvd5ZSHAsMqXheVsQfzmRFC_mtOMrCFwIcEldoDPXR1qhIBUy2z1b-KaU6m\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:6:{i:0;s:494:\"places/ChIJuyn1NgADkTMRkSN7U7pWroI/photos/AVoNoXQvo4S0zLLUcggXE4FyJH15eKp2UWuaYgaQc0uLANUtjwH_rUhTWPj9NZQoJVJOVkRcXBh9J8E6etSsLE1v7RRInD6RxTRy0wbFcafRVxG257tBtMKrNATuiYw5_NHg5HMRmP66XHasAYv3OkdkODwf9uZVLFa3MoD5gPRH-7BEs7CHcz7oZL6abByZQr8VorSXU84TwlhWktSeDrJt4Z-xRCfhGLxLWdMUSddwf0Q0Hk0eknA7ZsP94jbOUeNlyQdHTdoxiNkKmKZ63xW0J_GUaRv5qTTFZN7OJncjS2uV2GTrZHmjhQc-6ZoPmw-vMyCe8TXup8v3Gbb6JiTCSWrKBZxMzq6DiShupU_CtHAUtFoICW5dPRXdBlvOQzPtYic_bdvd5ZSHAsMqXheVsQfzmRFC_mtOMrCFwIcEldoDPXR1qhIBUy2z1b-KaU6m\";i:1;s:494:\"places/ChIJuyn1NgADkTMRkSN7U7pWroI/photos/AVoNoXR8ip4ubKYG3tXbjuqInZvAnGWNrxjp_Stgw0MyxS2WJ_waNwpLzDWroZlSX5xfF-BMp689OUp1gyOMB5mEJJGzJi13V4b0SOoRphnw-O3n6LW43QCaEsSs03kbnwreQFcLko5r_FdZDzjBbx71hYq-YXoo-dNKrRwOiGpwKJOEv9toH74a3rNG6JGbwZtMmNObBshI9v5Ipzg3MMbPQJbZFozkv2wQjheyWlpd46Sgt-fxKcr_OZF_uIFRtQqvUpGEnqrP9TyOqijPQhvUO0fgVoQvNeZjZbU6PORmhuuGXRTbxBo5NeDHDmDWoOAoS-HNAZDuqRDSNnsfvCY22Iw