e the rays of sunlight shedding light on the dark side of mountains. The place is not swarmed by tourists unlike the lion\'s head. If you\'re feeling hungry the vicinity has a coffee shop called positivity cafe that offers affordable food with many choices. The coffee shop is so lovely because it has a great view of the kennon road.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-03-06T09:16:26.045136Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Emir Arnaldo\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLYOHAMG-2PWf4CVmmrUp-Vsdvziq1gkhKGVTNgZMmRv3fq6Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:186:\"The location and view were spectacular. The structure however, was much less so, suffering from countless years of neglect. Here\'s to hoping that a newer view deck is built in its place.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-10-28T23:43:27.533023369Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Nico Aguilar\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWdTaCsDXJKQqvtCHAco4xVLhiHUbPmvWhGskyzuKoVRIIjCWEI9g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:177:\"Very nice viewdeck of the zigzag road of Kennon. You can view the Lion\'s Head from up here. It\'s also a memorial of the Japanese and Filipinos that build the road way back then.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-12-17T18:56:40.213658Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:10:\"iamrrabbit\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX9S9pvCpT_9IxQrT2stQHXt-6gT_sBPt3K6EeIXoRYTFTjLI0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:68:\"Ample parking , paid CR but clean , you can buy local souvenirs here\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-07-23T20:35:43.771665309Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:11:\"Sheryll Ico\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUHUlfqdc3B07CMLFpwZ-bCOhsJjM0dWaJeDMixVk2cYtkGMZ_J_w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba7\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:92:\"Still one of those view decks to see when in Kennon Road. Awesome view on the famous zigzag!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-11-05T03:10:41.270183Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:9;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJrxMbPCOjkTMRA15Ed28P54A\";s:4:\"name\";s:18:\"Sadjatan Viewpoint\";s:3:\"lat\";d:16.4764017;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.56095810000001;s:7:\"address\";s:43:\"FHG6+H98, La Trinidad, Benguet, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:3:\"poi\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.7;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:33;s:7:\"reviews\";i:33;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:476:\"places/ChIJrxMbPCOjkTMRA15Ed28P54A/photos/AVoNoXQMtTxejDJn5urk9gizi9U3Z3EtECOwKtI9Kryk0dXhNo9_fPWa2oSRlcuieLuGAz7McH5e2deiqvDFLA90CEw-4MgkQO8FBccolYLu7Wl_UQDXMX01_jiETbfVo4bwk6lxGfAO8OmrkXxGarcwGD06kOBJIMQHOJOxYYI46_35u_070f7RVZddvcN4qW56K5zqWr-9U-U5yPCAYwisRm0L95k32rbsP_l2tXp_41Eqj5CdajHjcQwk5TwD1nMdWZxZNVRU7U4VSsFgifwTaFFlAL23rvppdbLfOyiFqLj8BzpaJ2GvCZHvi5pAU_5DFCIkixrbACHmQfkxp8G53MdudN8BY67VPd8Em-BMVcGIoUTP24SWaANCcJw_HCODURQcbT5HgujpOyUsXz0C4L4QLmFd8XFeeRMSsbxUj9K9FA\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:6:{i:0;s:476:\"places/ChIJrxMbPCOjkTMRA15Ed28P54A/photos/AVoNoXQMtTxejDJn5urk9gizi9U3Z3EtECOwKtI9Kryk0dXhNo9_fPWa2oSRlcuieLuGAz7McH5e2deiqvDFLA90CEw-4MgkQO8FBccolYLu7Wl_UQDXMX01_jiETbfVo4bwk6lxGfAO8OmrkXxGarcwGD06kOBJIMQHOJOxYYI46_35u_070f7RVZddvcN4qW56K5zqWr-9U-U5yPCAYwisRm0L95k32rbsP_l2tXp_41Eqj5CdajHjcQwk5TwD1nMdWZxZNVRU7U4VSsFgifwTaFFlAL23rvppdbLfOyiFqLj8BzpaJ2GvCZHvi5pAU_5DFCIkixrbACHmQfkxp8G53MdudN8BY67VPd8Em-BMVcGIoUTP24SWaANCcJw_HCODURQcbT5HgujpOyUsXz0C4L4QLmFd8XFeeRMSsbxUj9K9FA\";i:1;s:473:\"places/ChIJrxMbPCOjkTMRA15Ed28P54A/photos/AVoNoXQknIaxN_xuiaPvLviA09YYgX9YsBTXfkX6LkJLUc1gzNE5fKHmfidkB6NPZKFJg8Garbomt0hUNoJHBmVfknBHAIbvfBx8Psgh2UIcBRm5tlKoyN1YhOa1I0BM3YYih3PnvVTkETbxdJSl_ddGxwM-HJEBtm9Q8Ijvjoyd40cPPyJJamWBWDAj5jzFAJP5mlgO0z1QftaIo_WcAKKPuHnXfblD3Whl554aNsA2cc5S