12:\"reviews_data\";a:5:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Niel Relleta\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:121:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXDzbrUsIabpfGIc0oLVfksAQFc-OW_pkYFCTZUieKsvWWDFEYQuQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:170:\"Nice place for a quick food grab with plenty of options to choose from.\n\nRoad is wide and clean. Best time to visit for the sunset view with Mt. Arayat in the background.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-07-03T17:23:45.805394178Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:6:\"Russel\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWWIwIgAvp8bAy64VetRjrtzUkk9xE7irhqxU5x9naWaihFcHZB=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:148:\"It is a public space LGU must watch the place improve it, it is a scenic view of the mountain.\nWe visit the place in the morning and bring our food.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-04-02T22:09:41.827644690Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:10:\"Ron Quinto\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXbPxtso6XSPMkBoUnLL-g96jbPJLsCjRmkO_HwYwOhZ9mVIg4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:286:\"This place is suppose to be about nature, a quite place where visitors can somehow experience Mt. Arayat views. But people bring loud music and turns the place into  party theme etc...and you see  lot of garbage around. The place is more like a \"palengke\". But mountain view is great...\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-03-14T10:08:01.408211632Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:19:\"christian tolentino\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWQWm04KVR0CAbsqVn3zr3LWV1EVEfDN70ce-N22vEmKCr41329=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:3;s:4:\"text\";s:111:\"The view is okay relaxing. Food is also okay. Good for a short family outing pampawala ng stress. Nature vibes.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-02-22T17:41:50.799693120Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:20:\"Verity Wilson-Ganela\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXpfH3mCAJDs3J1x54F56VgXmRWQ1BDvB3LHqmA-2_cJXdlyJCErQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:137:\"Great range of street food all cooked in front of you. Amazing views of the mountains. Mother Nature even put on a light show (lighting).\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-07-05T00:49:38.451845736Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:4;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJmx35gBZ_kDMRoSoptxmJUdo\";s:4:\"name\";s:19:\"Landingan Viewpoint\";s:3:\"lat\";d:16.1809553;s:3:\"lng\";d:121.5781362;s:7:\"address\";s:42:\"5HJH+97J, Nagtipunan, Quirino, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:8:\"landmark\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.5;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:335;s:7:\"reviews\";i:335;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:478:\"places/ChIJmx35gBZ_kDMRoSoptxmJUdo/photos/AVoNoXQoGXP15TTyRLjcV8u2PVwGhNh0-TGFaj5Mra2qgTy8E4-tMnZY9S7N8X4QpHNH7eI6ExcfstYksFI9nCLCE2Onr7_tDxZPgm3RyGfS6jCSdZwS50mg9qDYlKNT72w3sJte2NsbdynfTGUfFi0xRQKy5dUZuRrHPPsyLyfKvL3PYd4bCYAYdeIVKRaxRVn4TeqUKxgLkYdf84jM_JFuIpzLvY8NndZsGClKYMAWHv-fvkPmcpUsuT-yj6SuF07t_JNxZGu8NzWTRJgavmKpTklFxJ8WNeA1K74EaiWe0MopIU6YLy1TMKtf61D5lWCFi9SoFMXIko0LqruWCuqGT1jD_3zRwvoa6rnF3Nv6nTw_NW_eTnJhcCCgCGG-8PIqpKHiC7NRXfg3dbHbJ70as7f5xGuLzajzLqldHrGaJIcgdQtv\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:6:{i:0;s:478:\"places/ChIJmx35gBZ_kDMRoSoptxmJUdo/photos/AVoNoXQoGXP15TTyRLjcV8u2PVwGhNh0-TGFaj5Mra2qgTy8E4-tMnZY9S7N8X4QpHNH7eI6ExcfstYksFI9nCLCE2Onr7_tDxZPgm3RyGfS6jCSdZwS50mg9qDYlKNT72w3sJte2NsbdynfTGUfFi0xRQKy5dUZuRrHPPsyLyfKvL3PYd4bCYAYdeIVKRaxRVn4TeqUKxgLkYdf84jM_JFuIpzLvY8NndZsGClKYMAWHv-fvkPmcpUsuT-yj6SuF07t_JNxZGu8NzWTRJgavmKpTklFxJ8WNeA1K74EaiWe0MopIU6YLy1TMKtf61D5lWCFi9SoFMXIko0LqruWCuqGT1jD_3zRwvoa6rnF3Nv6nTw_NW_eTnJhcCCgCGG-8PIqpKHiC7NRXfg3dbHbJ70as7f5xGuLzajzLqldHrGaJIcgdQtv\";i:1;s:477:\"pl