ad. If you\'re feeling hungry the vicinity has a coffee shop called positivity cafe that offers affordable food with many choices. The coffee shop is so lovely because it has a great view of the kennon road.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-03-06T09:16:26.045136Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Emir Arnaldo\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLYOHAMG-2PWf4CVmmrUp-Vsdvziq1gkhKGVTNgZMmRv3fq6Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:186:\"The location and view were spectacular. The structure however, was much less so, suffering from countless years of neglect. Here\'s to hoping that a newer view deck is built in its place.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-10-28T23:43:27.533023369Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Nico Aguilar\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWdTaCsDXJKQqvtCHAco4xVLhiHUbPmvWhGskyzuKoVRIIjCWEI9g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:177:\"Very nice viewdeck of the zigzag road of Kennon. You can view the Lion\'s Head from up here. It\'s also a memorial of the Japanese and Filipinos that build the road way back then.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-12-17T18:56:40.213658Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:10:\"iamrrabbit\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX9S9pvCpT_9IxQrT2stQHXt-6gT_sBPt3K6EeIXoRYTFTjLI0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:68:\"Ample parking , paid CR but clean , you can buy local souvenirs here\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-07-23T20:35:43.771665309Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:11:\"Sheryll Ico\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUHUlfqdc3B07CMLFpwZ-bCOhsJjM0dWaJeDMixVk2cYtkGMZ_J_w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba7\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:92:\"Still one of those view decks to see when in Kennon Road. Awesome view on the famous zigzag!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-11-05T03:10:41.270183Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:11;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJL1lvVVQHlzMR9f8wfwIlXts\";s:4:\"name\";s:52:\"The Viewpoint Grape & Dragon Fruit Farm + Bambu Cafe\";s:3:\"lat\";d:14.960402799999999;s:3:\"lng\";d:121.0142624;s:7:\"address\";s:52:\"P.Basa Street, San Rafael, 3008 Bulacan, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:10:\"restaurant\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.4;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:47;s:7:\"reviews\";i:47;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:494:\"places/ChIJL1lvVVQHlzMR9f8wfwIlXts/photos/AVoNoXSzkoOepdpEW7hMDHADaGGNsPg7r1lTqa192lcL0LyvSHnj97nk3RT-yVIc95fdjYeSf6V8NoGtxM06MqU5ne54-8WtFIqdr7HIIQ4KNTNbUqeF--tfRhS09SqUGU9sMZjLo5W6LMFQ-EyqZkR_WYxPXuXYYEd2wc0qjOBZZ9TQGeRa8jv1qi7_QzJ1zwq8ZwQZH3NtrXlASQf4N8MHU4AN5xTMH2cLw3GWnS8Y1almJkOG-XR4VxM6qSGsqGgln1ADpDgBY1f6_wvokB6WoEhAMBMZdDAN8HaRCme4GtnC4AV58l8iG_ISp7V83R9OZQ7u3piLRebVeNhPJrEJl-lSEMxe5hcZKfm57LoP0HRAoKT379rNccQjcCiL9lFu4Kx7_PalPpQvr30npcihQY8oOdci1Kr3ypm58touYJXsvgAI75805shU9CotQn1v\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:6:{i:0;s:494:\"places/ChIJL1lvVVQHlzMR9f8wfwIlXts/photos/AVoNoXSzkoOepdpEW7hMDHADaGGNsPg7r1lTqa192lcL0LyvSHnj97nk3RT-yVIc95fdjYeSf6V8NoGtxM06MqU5ne54-8WtFIqdr7HIIQ4KNTNbUqeF--tfRhS09SqUGU9sMZjLo5W6LMFQ-EyqZkR_WYxPXuXYYEd2wc0qjOBZZ9TQGeRa8jv1qi7_QzJ1zwq8ZwQZH3NtrXlASQf4N8MHU4AN5xTMH2cLw3GWnS8Y1almJkOG-XR4VxM6qSGsqGgln1ADpDgBY1f6_wvokB6WoEhAMBMZdDAN8HaRCme4GtnC4AV58l8iG_ISp7V83R9OZQ7u3piLRebVeNhPJrEJl-lSEMxe5hcZKfm57LoP0HRAoKT379rNccQjcCiL9lFu4Kx7_PalPpQvr30npcihQY8oOdci1Kr3ypm58touYJXsvgAI75805shU9CotQn1v\";i:1;s:478:\"places/ChIJL1lvVVQHlzMR9f8wfwIlXts/photos/AVoNoXS_giZ94NY9yAb1zodiiVeQqgtdBfpP31gd647Cuvaw4jnxeA-3GyHAN0HxY6qihvTXaEUBJL_m9F7jnB7C0sBmDP1WbakLptTYT9bJRj4vxc-004J9MlmFfS1JzeBRsXgVFkyn6HifvV02cQ9cHpHukGs-88jKahacdimGNjIu4IH0abmVvF8WEzWUIgtimNkZZ4pTnAXad_IKS7TX8OdtBQDvRqIMo7YZijWsANzTn2VVte2Qf84M3iwGS6VGWQEqcxexabG32rMLzD