0nchH7GIgDXg3t_0U4qoqa1Nx7YnZ5BWBHYx9RaxnrK986-39HHB2wiVAlqDC5AfMZntCxtK82nJKgJ7syK88U6BWrDyLfssOGdcP3kRjxyA-qeIaKzY5gZ5me-7A7De_HNjYu7VGyfVqWBRZtr1pKvbgZY_gz5DL1JcRs8No1Vy3N-9M4B8YyrG46HsgUO9dCEpQvouchO4NZAL-SodffRJD13Tzw2IoS3IKDmtkMjv_Q\";i:5;s:476:\"places/ChIJv1rpmNO9ljMRPMaSFnnYfN4/photos/AVoNoXRprxLm3Q6mVL8HFfrJ7FU3cxCCiJyzHbysgWbCQxnykSdFJ4l7Lg9a7ThNp-o0_HptAvu9PhSnO61Z7yFWVom3CqpT9wttkJ85DNebDmbsYbZUg21ghWwTURyuqazwqCUUu1lVi-BEjr99yHIRya7hNaQl9MsBxlY5RYmLfSrkFFceQNT9PyaqNt6HXk9MTGoiZjvMdvF5w9S6rmuV_O3TxS00-QQv6YHFGtj_12I39WMGTCuJakubBRp3B_8Vi87whraxT-lFFZQOyRAfcQAmkAiAWzQO1kC2htku7IWlurAv6GeL5i1kstJszPlEIsvAjOytDI_qvU6Nl0ctAvK8sdn62qSWPeBLLA7ARPBZHkqeXFCwVtvalkwRzRuK5RXV99gqQLTcm5o0cwWjgYs15HhTJb3dca0rR8Q0yliimw\";}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:5:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:10:\"pio guinto\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVCTga4JQwTH6GmwG49dxYtudATW8Vng2f7jT1gukcmyBQCa1AYAg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:612:\"My girlfriend and I visited Sitio Baag View Deck Jump-Off, and it was one of the highlights of our trip. The scenery was absolutely breathtaking, with stunning mountain views and cool, refreshing air that made the visit even more enjoyable. The peaceful atmosphere was perfect for relaxing, taking photos, and appreciating nature. The area was clean and well-maintained, and the locals we met were friendly and welcoming. If you’re looking for a place to enjoy beautiful views and a quiet escape from the city, this is definitely worth visiting. We had a wonderful experience and would love to come back again.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-07-02T06:59:17.774807884Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:6:\"Regine\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:121:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLyACix9E3SI7nnXcIJlzOt3MbCKZ9WleM4qFbcuP4AFj0huno=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:268:\"I had a fantastic time at Sitio Baag View Deck! ? The sunset views were absolutely breathtaking, painting the sky with vibrant colors. ? It\'s a truly serene and beautiful spot to unwind and enjoy nature\'s artistry. Highly recommend for a peaceful escape! ✨?\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-02-03T02:01:19.655017234Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:22:\"Shawn Luc D. Fernandez\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUCxkgN7u5Q_9ry3wKQz8I-AR-llvumB6HUG5_ZYxXjV13jokWj=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:472:\"Sitio Baag in San Jose, Tarlac is the perfect jump-off spot for anyone who wants to breathe again. The wind is incredibly fresh, like nature’s own reset button, and the scenery gives you that peaceful, quiet moment you didn’t know you needed. It’s truly one of the best places to unwind, relax your mind, and just enjoy the simple beauty around you. Whether you’re starting an adventure or just passing through, the calm atmosphere already makes the trip worth it.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-11-26T11:49:27.553712476Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:7:\"Joaquin\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW_lDs_m3AS_twrYefzbXTnx0bDuR3TR7PcUtjGfC9f61dPDV4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:276:\"Great view matched with cool breeze. However, there\'s no bathroom, there\'s no faucet to wash your hands. No chairs or tables for tourists to relax. No parking space. This place is great but needs improvements for it to be a tourist attraction. Cafes only open during weekends.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-10-28T19:08:51.481786855Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:18:\"クレイトレス\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:118:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUaK1I0Hxb8io5P6SAHLDOuvfeCLQfexGcJrd0ci3MxStr36oc=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:629:\"We had an amazing experience at Sitio Baag in Tarlac. Although the view deck was closed for renovation at the time of our visit, the place was still beautiful, peaceful, and scenic—perfect for those who want to escape the busy city life. The natural surroundings are refreshing, with lovely views that make the trip truly worthwhile. The atmosphere is relaxing and ideal for bonding with family and friends. Everything feels calm and well-maintained, making it a great spot to unwind and reconnect with nature.\n\nHighly recommended for anyone looking for a quiet and refreshing getaway in Tarlac. We will definitely visit again!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-02-17T11:54:23.564607732Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:16;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJY0rPB8ORkTMRKLXVFMQO3aQ\";s:4:\"name\";s:31:\"View Point Grill and Restaurant\";s:3:\"lat\";d:16.6143836;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.36299129999998;s:7:\"address\";s:45:\"San Fernando City, 2500 La Union, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:10:\"restaurant\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.1;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:46;s:7:\"reviews\";i:46;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:476:\"places/ChIJY0rPB8ORkTMRKLXVFMQO3aQ/photos/AVoNoXSuwWaggcvE6cdd6z9pLUnqOUEqlyDZ3BoBjkeIXBJOfxb8MA8L8OF0G6iG5DxSuEUIZ8qRTlvFhL4XbC3wawZVTh_1TVLwiD3r1W1ttdMEP_l-EDtyWtJM_ujG0o8Faa1tvTZck4DED0olA-V0ce6d4vWMfBknZOgNhAV7Pf0YPnRGpAKY4i5hiLDys_RgoQToEM6TEIqwkhnod5yoNZEz2dKmVS3CSnTHGPQSEQjSz8GgT_4biWvFvJ5qj6QbnjJYxTbkBhcSYOh-Icd-4SN2_i7vlXo3BZagA0byBvJloGZ1Kw2PvEhWjBCEIi6DABah0Qqm_eIgJuWmv_fyhcJPvnve7X4-iOILzquGoUUuJ26hUaPu7Xmo7k1C4-swttpNHHG6_lntyKQTDLcCdQ7lvXycy3yEuXDEC2WaUo-T6Q\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:6:{i:0;s:476:\"places/ChIJY0rPB8ORkTMRKLXVFMQO3aQ/photos/AVoNoXSuwWaggcvE6cdd6z9pLUnqOUEqlyDZ3BoBjkeIXBJOfxb8MA8L8OF0G6iG5DxSuEUIZ8qRTlvFhL4XbC3wawZVTh_1TVLwiD3r1W1ttdMEP_l-EDtyWtJM_ujG0o8Faa1tvTZck4DED0olA-V0ce6d4vWMfBknZOgNhAV7Pf0YPnRGpAKY4i5hiLDys_RgoQToEM6TEIqwkhnod5yoNZEz2dKmVS3CSnTHGPQSEQjSz8GgT_4biWvFvJ5qj6QbnjJYxTbkBhcSYOh-Icd-4SN2_i7vlXo3BZagA0byBvJloGZ1Kw2PvEhWjBCEIi6DABah0Qqm_eIgJuW