ous serving! Unli brewed coffee tasted great as well!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-11-29T11:50:33.118033Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:6:\"st ooo\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUUw_L9ewldoB6JruArVR2kDQyoxTq2yMcRwg_KnGFBkrEbA94=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:47:\"crazy how you can even see itogon from here?\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-04-13T10:06:15.067802355Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Erwin Deleña\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWcsvGlRF70pz2pHUft2mguMEK1bKQk2FrB98UDCm0Qdlr7kqo=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-04-06T01:06:41.207667777Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:12;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJzTHyfACfkTMRrQ9x9jJUKGk\";s:4:\"name\";s:24:\"VIEWPOINT 360 RESTAURANT\";s:3:\"lat\";d:16.3780541;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.5081276;s:7:\"address\";s:70:\"2/F, TAFARMCO BLDG, Aspiras - Palispis Hwy, Tuba, Benguet, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:10:\"restaurant\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.4;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:9;s:7:\"reviews\";i:9;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:494:\"places/ChIJzTHyfACfkTMRrQ9x9jJUKGk/photos/AVoNoXRM4tFA8tFA6AHYAqvPI4ZqVt6vwA2N9hkiWKfa95kRwevwxShsCzckBQ0UVV7soILqahhUZof4rjLWf5lwF5hixU0PmX-eVsHh02mSgE5l1RrIG2LsU1WoUeFpwWxONjlv-OypbyOG6SkqUyhhdWqN3LJGuJ1w0FSn9tY4b_ymx2Pur0KgRVVV6XoQQ07GbY2egkS0eQNBZOh0IOzl6fFoEthdHI8mNVPh5JB5VqAvrcFy77yV6y0zF8zn-CBktSnLP9X_8B_QvMQySCQ0hrvem-LA_Idb3kGevMIcn2eybVO45RjHKHuly4siKOrij2UyoPnuSzQX6mfl9QKc6NiVXyPY4ioG_z8SfyVxFo5kfDi2KLuia7EuoxbEo0i5hnxPbcxLjRgxnJ7-8UHXIE8qn_6WeMBez8fu9cs8g_3QN0A74CebjLEkMvMxUPfI\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:6:{i:0;s:494:\"places/ChIJzTHyfACfkTMRrQ9x9jJUKGk/photos/AVoNoXRM4tFA8tFA6AHYAqvPI4ZqVt6vwA2N9hkiWKfa95kRwevwxShsCzckBQ0UVV7soILqahhUZof4rjLWf5lwF5hixU0PmX