N-RNETMC\";i:5;s:494:\"places/ChIJuyn1NgADkTMRkSN7U7pWroI/photos/AVoNoXT4I2xtwIR2G1Dk3lwS_jBU5ClxvS-Sb1iGG-Qtx0h_g6HjbCgh21GNjiXww2m7m4dekN72noLyDwZ6QPREo1GDizSSLw5-Q6CKnXZq_q8QJnJXIQGu8F7yvI6zDFOibjOfXd3A6qmXU5jI2GeArRGg1koLlnc6G1Us-mQMFG64imePBG-jX1lpYaOm0--6AX9t0LVeXwhObOSeQ0KJJU8TkJK4EqXlANrTpBkf0Q3Ll7o85zH8W2xfhOsdzShQTmbQfued5Yw9H_J7CW8htkxGHVkEBPfvs9Yy09T3DXbZJF_XG4ehhBk3K_1aIKC6nYfmRIa1t-gf8Hud2ts_jmz4MRjqn8LUPOxkTehqkvBcdKSbkS9SRbTni9Zc0gC58NvI9nCSEM4nd-zf7jVSbP4mVrpvVw3YWh66UCzB2c76XKEpD2YI_ZiWoZhjKZPS\";}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:5:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:5:\"JABON\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXui6dx31AyXLG2gP2XiEbmbLBfTCeEE0XOUDFC2zixVMZWcKuVlw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:345:\"nice stop with great mountain views and fresh air. It’s a small and simple eatery where you can enjoy tasty local food while relaxing and taking in the scenery. The place is quiet, perfect for a quick meal or coffee break during a road trip. The friendly staff and beautiful surroundings make it worth the visit. you can buy a Pasalubong here.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2025-05-04T02:14:17.911998Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"kylle flores\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUMyc1DlEq494RSTKNUJGygwsqxeb3rP8xr8K7u7TU6Yrjcav4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:172:\"Best food I\'ve had so far in my life (lol srsly) but not the most expensive. Unli sabaw and unli kape is good too! May mga pasalubong din sila. And the best part? The view.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2025-04-01T10:56:59.416528Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Jannine Vasquez\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWPgVSrjchzI2LDXZMqr0RgaQfsHVm6nNTF3qTXWWlf1w_8CExDbQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:129:\"Food was delicious, served hot (perfect for the cold weather), and had generous serving! Unli brewed coffee tasted great as well!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-11-29T11:50:33.118033Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:6:\"st ooo\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUUw_L9ewldoB6JruArVR2kDQyoxTq2yMcRwg_KnGFBkrEbA94=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:47:\"crazy how you can even see itogon from here?\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-04-13T10:06:15.067802355Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Erwin Deleña\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWcsvGlRF70pz2pHUft2mguMEK1bKQk2FrB98UDCm0Qdlr7kqo=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-04-06T01:06:41.207667777Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:9;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJH7My69mgkTMR9v0n4BGoPvM\";s:4:\"name\";s:21:\"Kennon Road Viewpoint\";s:3:\"lat\";d:16.3751583;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.60707849999999;s:7:\"address\";s:90:\"Purok 7, 9JG4+3MP Zigzag, Camp 7, Kennon Rd, Camp 7, 54, Baguio, 2600 Benguet, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:8:\"landmark\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.4;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:697;s:7:\"reviews\";i:697;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:476:\"places/ChIJH7My69mgkTMR9v0n4BGoPvM/photos/AVoNoXTPiFENElvV1dd4ILNXWkbxA8h4Wuj46fwJfX7iY1dOrNRPemsidybAUO7bHd8LX70uL1PlHh_5EfGsSO04UNbrTpUKuDQ1RLeMs4qjdZo1A6vXo8TKid10QQu2rD-SX0PMvVkCROPzjNY2lxzxhcpdYNCOwZy-JLWzGNGN89xHQT1B1RtgF6zpj9v8f0pkWhmKa_JGoCh_uriKf8gVqHKvkCmUrmlUK31Ee6rHpOrynpBREZdokmcxAjVyR6-od5MJVfH8Qt2MIWqVCyQmjzqZU3yj64EwiZ0RvjwtQCFo3uazjXHbJBbltQa8BIh_yN7KMI3FkPGkwUq-fTfSYbM43ePXKGQZ3zM21gBO23Z_Mk4KNvLCLw3pSbj-E4w4eeGoq_3C0Z-m4ZiUXtaAIygsGX2phv1AIIv5TqVZV6KB8Q\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:6:{i:0;s:476:\"places/ChIJH7My69mgkTMR9v0n4BGoPvM/photos/AVoNoXTPiFENElvV1dd4ILNXWkbxA8h4Wuj46fwJfX7iY1dOrNRPemsidybAUO7bHd8LX70