"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX9mQyMx8r4Dlb-qredrjzyX3uJnpJ9KF0VI4j9e7sOGfQHswM=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:578:\"nice place to visit for a quick getaway. The views are beautiful, and the Bambu Cafe has a very relaxing, tropical atmosphere. It is unique and interesting to see grapes and dragon fruits growing in one place. The drinks and snacks are refreshing, especially the ones made with fresh fruits from the farm, though the menu is somewhat limited. The staff are friendly and welcoming, making the overall experience very pleasant. It can get a bit crowded on weekends, but it is still a lovely spot to unwind, take photos, and enjoy nature. Highly recommended for a casual road trip!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-06-05T08:59:15.021380398Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Nathan Baena\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWJ4reAvehwv6oXRSO3MU6Cn3Ry0IDitg6LFTHzmhZdYjKoMHskUQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:1023:\"It was a quick getaway to The Viewpoint Grape & Dragonfruit Farm.\n\nWe arrived at around 1pm from Manila and since it was past lunch tine we opted to grab lunch, ordered Bangusilog and Dragonfruit juice (which is actually a smoothie) and Dragonfruit crepe.\n\nEverything is palatable and plating is nice. The ambiance of Bambu Cafe adds up to irs coziness.\n\nWe suggested that the crepe can have a scoop of dragonfruit ice cream and drizzled with dragonfruit sauce. Hopefully, we get to try this once they have incorporated this in their menu.\n\nSince it is raining we have to wait for quite sometime before we proceed with the dragonfruit picking (yes, you\'ve heard that right that they have fruit picking activity for a minimal cost and you have to pay for the fruits you\'ve personally picked from the farm). It is 250 per kilo.\n\nIt was quite an experience. Enjoying farm to table process (their menu have dragonfruit food options -- dragonfruit ade, dragonfruit juice, dragonfruit crepe, dragonfruit shanghai and a lot more).\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-09-06T11:50:31.426029393Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"Herna Rina Tan\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUFCk0OTYiXMgmKDrFm32VdY_rGVtHCG0KN7HWqH_cQY6gbV6U=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:334:\"It\'s a good and rare experience for me while picking up dragon fruit which later on i paid at the counter for Ph230 per kilo. They also have food for dine in with a reasonable prices. They offered  natural dragon  fruit juice which only cost one (1) hundred plus. It\'s located in  Bulacan which is a little bit far from the main Road.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2022-09-11T08:50:30.179571Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:21:\"nemesio jr makalintal\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK_p8-IQVr-gJH8LsdDOKAFLcXnwxWzEB8ZuqgdTuXTdDzeFw-c=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:79:\"Excellent place to stay, so relaxing, conducive and excellent food and service!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-12-07T11:11:05.926743612Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:16:\"Katherine Cortes\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXof4aqIg6PprPmOcDILO0gFopY-tR-mNoVJozhetDB5xtV0mM8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:321:\"Affordable open cafe that serves seasonal treats like dragonfruit cheesecake and fresh shake. With a nice view of a neighboring lake and farm and photo-op spots.\n\nP50 to tour the dragonfruit and grape farms. On harvest days you can pick and pay. There were no harvests when we visited so we just toured and took pictures.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2022-09-26T15:39:19.750994Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:12;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJfULc_CaTlzMRCzCxKKR2ZME\";s:4:\"name\";s:49:\"Tanay Viewpoint Garden Cafe & Restaurant by ICHAN\";s:3:\"lat\";d:14.575623300000002;s:3:\"lng\";d:121.369046;s:7:\"address\";s:72:\"Marcos highway, sitio Mayagay, brgy, H9G9+6JV, Tanay, Rizal, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:10:\"restaurant\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.3;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:308;s:7:\"reviews\";i:308;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:473:\"places/ChIJfULc_CaTlzMRCzCxKKR2ZME/photos/AVoNoXRDzU5_AgEGgnbxkbbtiStHGwVVjw2kjfYztE3idLpyLE8wXwyb6hoX_rHGKQzWdKUdQvu_Tq19IX0NdVtby1MTeVmDn7qyK1Ih_3KyA9Z9egAaBupu5LbpP_HKfQLF1l7LtJ7oAJs8qaG9VpYhBztu5tQ4V0qCVSG3UurzRqfj2miCoRqL4AMuaMPgfmt2tB8hTMDxnGZdinfLqL1pd733mL99EEt5GoTOqNfKLe9ULXJFP1xEZuAeM9g6yROfbYZ4eMP-St7bnmONoBYKGgogx78iWyw1VqJBd4xCEQB2WhTVSJLb20wIvIG6qzjMe1YwGmBvNxNfFsY7yEOMhV2ZbaOUT_nidSInGPH9N3s0PnG0ERh2AUYkcYRXbgA0I5Ku-O-CKw7Uh-t_PcHoYbbY7eXXDt80U5mKXLAfkXc\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:6:{i:0;s:473:\"places/ChIJfULc_CaTlzMRCzCxKKR2ZME/photos/AVoNoXRDzU5_AgEGgnbxkbbtiStHGwVVjw2kjfYztE3idLpyLE8wXwyb6hoX_rHGKQzWdKUdQvu_Tq19IX0NdVtby1MTeVmDn7qyK1Ih_3KyA9Z9egAaBupu5LbpP_HKfQLF1l7LtJ7oAJs8qaG9VpYhBztu5tQ4V0qCVSG3UurzRqfj2miCoRqL4AMuaMPgfmt2tB8hTMDxnGZdinfLqL1pd733mL99EEt5GoTOqNfKLe9ULXJFP1xEZuAeM9g6yROfbYZ4eMP-St7bnmONoBYKGgogx78iWyw1VqJBd4xCEQB2WhTVSJLb20wIvIG6qzjMe1YwGmBvNxNfFsY7yEOMhV2ZbaOUT_nidSInGPH9N3s0PnG0ERh2AUYkcYRXbgA0I5Ku-O-CKw7Uh-t_PcHoYbbY7eXXDt80U5mKXLAfkXc\";i:1;s:478:\"places/ChIJfULc_CaTlzMRCzCxKKR2ZME/photos/AVoNoXSgDipbOhq0gTupGpRHjMlDK2A-5nk-rmdUOCkQcfVvtZRykUOxvqc9hl26c2OoV8yIWFOPX0rBgv-t4Nc-mF7EiOx0iOejAXIatLw-H2zknAc-lfUfKyNrJTYoDrq17n10IknMW0Dk-8WaN8s48k7HoNv4AfuGerGq6SmUAxcA4vW_jJlN8Dh8QbxOsitflrzsA_SqHNVZcMbaHxiRidp0cBMfJsdXmceLTox9oI4JqUX8MS9X--bQdP2yRIzBNIgb3CiOhFYiN2_etRA4_WIB02t1QAXyWMwPf-ilkSXElhJEEKH5gU1ty5JZU-Wl5Wt7vAXNd101s_Fyuq_D6I6CpT_m4QtfkSzr6e2WIBEIStLLkzlKTPv_j4cj2RU9Au_qEnSbmrq3zVhz8Xu-RfyZNvQddCAOWlU4O4XP0PEpkOhi\";i:2;s:494:\"places/ChIJfULc_CaTlzMRCzCx