..\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-03-14T10:08:01.408211632Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:19:\"christian tolentino\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWQWm04KVR0CAbsqVn3zr3LWV1EVEfDN70ce-N22vEmKCr41329=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:3;s:4:\"text\";s:111:\"The view is okay relaxing. Food is also okay. Good for a short family outing pampawala ng stress. Nature vibes.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-02-22T17:41:50.799693120Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:20:\"Verity Wilson-Ganela\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXpfH3mCAJDs3J1x54F56VgXmRWQ1BDvB3LHqmA-2_cJXdlyJCErQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:137:\"Great range of street food all cooked in front of you. Amazing views of the mountains. Mother Nature even put on a light show (lighting).\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-07-05T00:49:38.451845736Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:6;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJC4p7SAAPkTMRyuSR7jXJ6A0\";s:4:\"name\";s:9:\"Viewpoint\";s:3:\"lat\";d:16.2267032;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.65269800000002;s:7:\"address\";s:38:\"6MG3+M3P, Itogon, Benguet, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:8:\"landmark\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:1;s:7:\"reviews\";i:1;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:476:\"places/ChIJC4p7SAAPkTMRyuSR7jXJ6A0/photos/AVoNoXRfxBTIqLDfqJqk4-t_XQ0l_UlBAvBZanZ7Rv3kzMszV0L89KjdTjprQYrCxm4oOFkqViys5g4GIHpozkFFSefzgP1GhmlMqotfCcrMOafeBeGKreTZyaUA5LO9WI39zsFKI8F70y3G7e3M5jv85pgDZmWhaL5Fkp55SYKNWxeNNpzWnkkTe8KzNWt-9JaQ2so_VDWP4fXBezSfFFj592Tj64kruq7W98X4HBocGg-jA7E_LEHBaxRYGOh4SBf8AO-ehRYejcaeeugwhQR8MlU2qNZU47KKQtrdqKWrnxjlYh40-pli4kaE50-XkZxGilhfje_wR-YbzkpAcb34qAXnuI_ztFUgg5HJdFf8dVGqaz7lPyJBYougscO9jurPUspo7arnIi1PsujtDt21Rs1YBsngAv43KC_e667owr6VcA\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:3:{i:0;s:476:\"places/ChIJC4p7SAAPk