is more like a \"palengke\". But mountain view is great...\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-03-14T10:08:01.408211632Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:19:\"christian tolentino\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWQWm04KVR0CAbsqVn3zr3LWV1EVEfDN70ce-N22vEmKCr41329=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:3;s:4:\"text\";s:111:\"The view is okay relaxing. Food is also okay. Good for a short family outing pampawala ng stress. Nature vibes.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-02-22T17:41:50.799693120Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:20:\"Verity Wilson-Ganela\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXpfH3mCAJDs3J1x54F56VgXmRWQ1BDvB3LHqmA-2_cJXdlyJCErQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:137:\"Great range of street food all cooked in front of you. Amazing views of the mountains. Mother Nature even put on a light show (lighting).\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-07-05T00:49:38.451845736Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:9;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJk2p2YgD7lzMRLk8HBYwE3JU\";s:4:\"name\";s:18:\"Caliraya Viewpoint\";s:3:\"lat\";d:14.3073129;s:3:\"lng\";d:121.48029159999999;s:7:\"address\";s:36:\"8F4J+W4, Lumban, Laguna, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:10:\"restaurant\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:15;s:7:\"reviews\";i:15;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:494:\"places/ChIJk2p2YgD7lzMRLk8HBYwE3JU/photos/AVoNoXSggd2lZ_Mz3EiNFzrUijGM8Rb4dwILqrOHIZv5vNAld7PHGgPWeN_UJFLw-jeq-HBF-RncGfj2IWYce8kQJd5Qf1HJI5fyNB2HNDeztwsRBosNBCt3-2GPWSLiYXixPHRnJu733AWd4fI8wCL8_L-a8QcytzBR19f3Fclk1wQXm_KyryOCOSBIg0E0fzuhXXVc32OBZbfhEkB6W2zg_FHEPE1o-M6oP-ceIAHzcd0_Ll4ME2Myu33EbS7cL5NJ-TEBpjEwJsZ1aWT0Xrt86_7rfOGGxlV7O5847pO8ZlgCiUMTv6PXzuRwuUlI-wSY4d2WBVEfr238ilYUPOz-C0jR0Ruf_JgTUds31SSVPC9v6l9XeFZRr79Om_7DYf_kwG1MMWK2YLR-W2gAlas_LfcUHtY5HxULgMftw8tAsl-