qNWKhWdqxVm6KYlpOIh-BruH7V-zBAUm7z8-Ot9TIgavHwYVsZeUS5fdSeNvmFm-FN-Rhlrdfw4OPlPhZUz5NCOkMCVEeIlt-OKGcoSAocgYAei8fC_4yvx4QVg4sRKUGSe3og5w0LpCtmNV3esu7r4DZzyiVXxnv0H7Nnh1A7TcvGYpipOnwgRIzoth\";}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:5:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Nuji\'s Travel\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXT2vjfsa8Q7vnMDIdhPfj2LwjKux8ytUUKso3O1wZMdGkWm6hq=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\";s:6:\"rating\";i:3;s:4:\"text\";s:821:\"The pinned location on the map is not the exact location of this place. If you are coming from the south, you need to drive about 10–15 minutes further.\n\nI stayed here during a weekend ride, and the inn is okay overall.\n\nIt was very windy when I arrived, so I decided to stay at the inn for the rest of the day because my Mio Gravis was being pushed by the wind. The weather is really cold, so don’t forget to bring an extra jacket and thick clothes to keep yourself warm, especially at night.\n\nBring your own toiletries because they are not provided. There is also no heater or shower available.\n\nIt can get a bit noisy when there are many guests since the view deck is on the rooftop above my room. Parking is in front of the inn, which can also add some noise when guests arrive.\n\nThe food is great and affordable.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-03-24T23:50:18.239992604Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Joshua Sepidoza\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW0g5n4c68exq3wlRxYx9bs6ZxrqF3AjArvndPP1oapu2Ar1aY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:152:\"A really good place for rides, relaxation, and camping! There are coffee shops and places where you can buy lomi and lugaw! The views are breath taking!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-11-10T07:18:53.465757047Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Hya Dinamling\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:116:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJfaizGSw3HHwfhjM8Hlv0qTfkabte6mvrFP6ydfJBBZX-LrA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:679:\"The cool wind and breathtaking views are incredible. I\'ve visited this place a few times, but I\'m still mesmerized by the scenery and the cold weather. And sometimes I feel like the air is flavored with mint ?— it’s so fresh and cold that it makes my nose runny even more ?.\nBring jackets and socks if you\'re lamigin like me ??. The mini falls are also instagramable and worth stopping by.\nWhat I\'m not fond of is the road — it\'s always under construction due to either landslides or poor placement of roads on the terrain.\n\nAlso, go there with caution, especially during the rainy season, because the fog can be difficult to deal with — it’s thick as hell.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-11-22T06:02:38.061577376Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:17:\"Ailer John Garcia\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXDVZmewrU16VJsYlw_9O2N4-1xyACPMBW8zCIQmKsmQKMnT7rMuw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:732:\"⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ 5/5\n\nAn unforgettable ride to Malico Viewpoint!\nI visited Malico Viewpoint riding my Kawasaki Z900 together with the Adventoureros moto group, and the whole experience was incredible. The ride up was smooth, scenic, and full of cool mountain air—perfect for motorcyclists looking for a refreshing escape.\n\nThe viewpoint offers breathtaking landscapes, peaceful surroundings, and plenty of spots to take photos with your bike. The weather was cool, the people were friendly, and the vibe was exactly what every rider wants after a long twisty ride.\n\nHighly recommended for motorcycle groups, solo riders, and anyone looking to enjoy nature at its best. Can’t wait to ride back again! ?️?✨\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-11-26T10:32:55.647185053Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:22:\"Elyas Bin Yahya Rucker\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVrOPwj2knfqZhEpE3kEbaZzbMeKkQyDuwKYlxBLOi4_mTI7kdyIw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:146:\"Good place. Don’t try to pet the monkey, he will bite your fingers and chew on your shoes. Watch out for motorcycles going too fast on the road.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-12-20T17:45:12.522966673Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:2;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJH7y3WPeJvTMRerG0S9Gqm10\";s:4:\"name\";s:20:\"ViewPoint Restaurant\";s:3:\"lat\";d:14.2665381;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.68678349999999;s:7:\"address\";s:60:\"7M8P+JP7, Ternate - Nasugbu Rd, Ternate, Cavite, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:10:\"restaurant\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.4;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:83;s:7:\"reviews\";i:83;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:478:\"places/ChIJH7y3WPeJvTMRerG0S9Gqm10/photos/AVoNoXSNrAm5bLWqVVt0-DrEiK22nAI2vSozD9vO6MfenBsJdKqzLDBq3JX0VLbPVIt_YeOla5FJa8fhQmuqK_CY54H5c1MdT7PVOW4GRmZfWGnOu-7BxLZIk5AwnIOecDTnMNdpy7Z85_SnYij0K1GWvaeAOts7L6fBv0fK_J6LNAV24_EYtQC0KNkSQY3drSUv45OvgTmUWJAYfgHxqOzkljpXEfilnr5NYE2kCmZiFVLCsB3AVdPf5Cwig55fKaxrF91sLYnhElBthdZe3qHTetDydUCGCZQibYyB9-ftW6a-cekoMA6l15NwXGLKtQ2WRTWAdnTyV_SuQqnR-9a1ewWwHO2CTDA-NImNaX6aeTYfdo735gluRpAP7w95-3fausosQnDet-cV7h_FAk5PGonpefdNnL09CJmaxGh2dcYkVR4U\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:6:{i:0;s:478:\"places/ChIJH7y3WPeJvTMRerG0S9Gqm10/photos/AVoNoXSNrAm5bLWqVVt0-DrEiK22nAI2vSozD9vO6MfenBsJdKqzLDBq3JX0VLbPVIt_YeOla5FJa8fhQmuqK_CY54H5c1MdT7PVOW4GRmZfWGnOu-7BxLZIk5AwnIOecDTnMNdpy7Z85_SnYij0K1GWvaeAOts7L6fBv0fK_J6LNAV24_EYtQC0KNkSQY3drSUv45OvgTmUWJAYfgHxqOzkljpXEfilnr5NYE2kCmZiFVLCsB3AVdPf5Cwig55fKaxrF91sLYnhElBthdZe3qHTetDydUCGCZQibYyB9-ftW6a-cekoMA6l15NwXGLKtQ2WRTWAdnTyV_SuQqnR-9a1ewWwHO2CTDA-NImNaX6aeTYfdo735gluRpAP7w95-3fausosQnDet-cV7h_FAk5PGonpefdNnL09CJmaxGh2dcYkVR4U\";i:1;s:492:\"places/ChIJH7y3WPeJvTMRerG0S9Gqm10/photos/AVoNoXRkpvAHAff97pQoXG4IU3Ao72gKK6dghxkmbYd7_kSn970vvW6FbdIbpH6JQYuzL4UxpZ8S8Qzk5O07EOGqKp