bQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:129:\"Food was delicious, served hot (perfect for the cold weather), and had generous serving! Unli brewed coffee tasted great as well!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-11-29T11:50:33.118033Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:6:\"st ooo\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUUw_L9ewldoB6JruArVR2kDQyoxTq2yMcRwg_KnGFBkrEbA94=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:47:\"crazy how you can even see itogon from here?\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-04-13T10:06:15.067802355Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Erwin Deleña\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWcsvGlRF70pz2pHUft2mguMEK1bKQk2FrB98UDCm0Qdlr7kqo=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-04-06T01:06:41.207667777Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:7;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJrxMbPCOjkTMRA15Ed28P54A\";s:4:\"name\";s:18:\"Sadjatan Viewpoint\";s:3:\"lat\";d:16.4764017;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.56095810000001;s:7:\"address\";s:43:\"FHG6+H98, La Trinidad, Benguet, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:3:\"poi\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.7;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:33;s:7:\"reviews\";i:33;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:476:\"places/ChIJrxMbPCOjkTMRA15Ed28P54A/photos/AVoNoXRtB9ofRCoeoc8NYFt-81c2rQ7Fw2XD_BgeINM0f1zb_9tHM75dYn2vhqf-Yksif8krhfCRkaztADcquSP6V7jp__4PsYkOqMCLJYpS9tOzCFtvGNRmm00-DQPN2_-vb-SOke68bS89xMRbr5s2tyzSYc9EtKgdIP9SfcFg7VfADUfwz-qynTZpVM5S4pXLjBwvykegQ_qEr2z2xBu6RkvBbOQ-1fqmDlPDCzPb9AM_TCw96xsFtwpLGvQ0GJu4sZM7AqGUL43dTrH6E0sqgUxoA3kpOFdJtP4Nob1qEyRPx2VzKE2jcENbGfa9nTkJxIKH9KJshetTsbkoj2KtON8xZd5kNAW_a422JTL2ZpRhOSZzwDVVF-MJE7PsPUeJPp88__bf4YR9135aqfjKE9ezrNweDBBCOwJmCUZUG4W5Fg\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:6:{i:0;s:476:\"places/ChIJrxMbPCOjkTMRA15Ed28P54A/photo