ud music and turns the place into  party theme etc...and you see  lot of garbage around. The place is more like a \"palengke\". But mountain view is great...\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-03-14T10:08:01.408211632Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:20:\"Verity Wilson-Ganela\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXpfH3mCAJDs3J1x54F56VgXmRWQ1BDvB3LHqmA-2_cJXdlyJCErQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:137:\"Great range of street food all cooked in front of you. Amazing views of the mountains. Mother Nature even put on a light show (lighting).\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-07-05T00:49:38.451845736Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"marc capinlac\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWDVQq6Wtr4Nud4BXakjKiiCoZVyOh4e6D-Old4PUWpcoS6bahR=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:4:\"?\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-07-10T13:20:29.685154265Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:15;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJCRgtcwADkTMR_ezsqj4X2JI\";s:4:\"name\";s:18:\"Dar-Awan Viewpoint\";s:3:\"lat\";d:16.182487;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.9187827;s:7:\"address\";s:36:\"Santa Fe, Nueva Vizcaya, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:8:\"landmark\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.8;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:5;s:7:\"reviews\";i:5;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:492:\"places/ChIJCRgtcwADkTMR_ezsqj4X2JI/photos/AVoNoXTWsZ_yBKrDq0v9oM1zc2TJFD7e2oNjN_A1yuL0yrEIiFS-1YoQSjPmx0AR1a4MqkNS5urGJSmPsqYpy2Lv22k7vNBRgdWCOAKvmdPM8TV5Q7pytXj0pEAFivxFfBkeSb-d6C7ds9xj8b9qb6b_J-0QJ84_I6Ni9jAn33TfTynWvj84duYMNCrLzK7XBS2pwQKW-rsMedtUmdvtlM4O_Zc1Yrk6F7_6zG6XvOvVYLzedL5r30L6a6mwjXc8PtlSNVM8bXdU61z-0axrDt8rpULJc15BL1om_3GBXrYzIe9d0fIaBq9-MWF_P7Al7u1Ob_qllHegygBd3-jwl3apHT94TSUqC3MGGXIB5_O-0gFtzyQjGr2jJ-gn8AbCr-0zqP5Xd-9Sg9kOTk5DJElY1k1oZycEVuLawZ_KJHL6VP6ersZJtzLw1-GgTeYw4Q\";s:16:\"