:4:\"text\";s:346:\"As for as my concern, I would give 5star to Malico Viewpoint and will dominent best turist place over baguio over following points:\n\nRoad is good and easy to acess.\nWeather is compared to baguio is awesome, reason less poluted area, not so crowded.\nAtmosphere is awesome\nMore silent and relaxing place, as compared to baguio\nLess hessel to reach!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-12-12T00:48:15.724376Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:9:\"dope!Mike\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVDRrr8PCDRHxPb1NzEjRsvF9E_ctmmbfRmZFhWhNZBhYJ-2fO_=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:539:\"Great place for a stop over or overnighter. No light pollution if you can catch a night when the clouds aren\'t rolling through.  Can\'t comment on the food I only had the coffee and it was delicious.\n\nStayed in one of the teepee cabins. Definitely ask for a heater or bring one it got down to 12c 53f in the cabin and this Floridian was freezin ?.\n\nLots of outlooks and a war memorial to keep you busy for a day.  Take photos, eat lunch, stay for dinner and take off the next day. I\'m sure the local community would appreciate the visit.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-01-28T01:13:59.304499664Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:8:\"Gigi Sam\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXAjhk9axBp3Q6glQMaU4igG99zA0UvVuNd5EAiv8_LHpqH00x6pg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:55:\"Super sarap and super Ganda Ng weather ❄️?❄️\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-02-02T17:43:33.655891471Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:11:\"Richard Tan\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWmgRDycoBIKddpK2F8LQJlTGD4jJ5q_2hl-yQ2mXhcslC1p3iO=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:168:\"Didnt have the chance to buy foods at the small canteen there. The Viewpoint is okay, there are several places that has a better view of the mountains and lower ground.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-12-11T08:45:12.634165Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:18;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJ4w6LAQB5jzMRaMkRWzMUlwc\";s:4:\"name\";s:20:\"Tabuk City Viewpoint\";s:3:\"lat\";d:17.5654635;s:3:\"lng\";d:121.4799791;s:7:\"address\";s:52:\"HF8H+5XQ Balong, City of Tabuk, Kalinga, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:8:\"landmark\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:1;s:7:\"reviews\";i:1;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:494:\"places/ChIJ4w6LAQB5jzMRaMkRWzMUlwc/photos/AVoNoXQQBBLoiHa0RtgjVqYXkDkKoebZWlZxJXKrIT1X9Ym8PPBudGBCIgs2ovryhFx1K68SVCBNbXX3DgzhstVZUIHnzpPnxFzhzXRjI-LK_qpFL619Evv_NIMEy5TTVVj-703NGDQOAWE03Xi2OMdjNv0OSDpJLZia0aSQqa-TUfki9-jB1S28MG1_DsJ6fjHE52u_7nnkF4JF3ifX9uyS90fQCgJlb7Hj8P6Z534zXtyqi7qUa3AZm8NJK2-AMBioQLwMz9j9meQOSy7-qnqReGCUe-cEQe8A1w8SzuPb9JrOGHh7Qr-0XLPjDJ7Hj75y5u_VSbXLSNWciP10nr_8wwsIrZWtF-wsMG8_ac_mGR6ES-QhBO7xDR00nbddnuK6GQH6nO_XKsBkUjkmJHBOCYLeD1lHOjxKO3SNCntBgB_mLA7ncnjnNrhSTsxiuZzX\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:1:{i:0;s:494:\"places/ChIJ4w6LAQB5jzMRaMkRWzMUlwc/photos/AVoNoXQQBBLoiHa0RtgjVqYXkDkKoebZWlZxJXKrIT1X9Ym8PPBudGBCIgs2ovryhFx1K68SVCBNbXX3DgzhstVZUIHnzpPnxFzhzXRjI-LK_qpFL619Evv_NIMEy5TTVVj-703NGDQOAWE03Xi2OMdjNv0OSDpJLZia0aSQqa-TUfki9-jB1S28MG1_DsJ6fjHE52u_7nnkF4JF3ifX9uyS90fQCgJlb7Hj8P6Z534zXtyqi7qUa3AZm8NJK2-AMBioQLwMz9j9meQOSy7-qnqReGCUe-cEQe8A1w8SzuPb9JrOGHh7Qr-0XLPjDJ7Hj75y5u_VSbXLSNWciP10nr_8wwsIrZWtF-wsMG8_ac_mGR6ES-QhBO7xDR00nbddnuK6GQH6nO_XKsBkUjkmJHBOCYLeD1lHOjxKO3SNCntBgB_mLA7ncnjnNrhSTsxiuZzX\";}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:1:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:11:\"JimsChannel\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:118:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVp5vwLRvt0MpGc7OUPozHXLemUb4p5lAIvG0Bw3EQyM3RyF6s=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-07-14T14:08:26.789894838Z