ys of sunlight shedding light on the dark side of mountains. The place is not swarmed by tourists unlike the lion\'s head. If you\'re feeling hungry the vicinity has a coffee shop called positivity cafe that offers affordable food with many choices. The coffee shop is so lovely because it has a great view of the kennon road.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-03-06T09:16:26.045136Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Emir Arnaldo\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLYOHAMG-2PWf4CVmmrUp-Vsdvziq1gkhKGVTNgZMmRv3fq6Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:186:\"The location and view were spectacular. The structure however, was much less so, suffering from countless years of neglect. Here\'s to hoping that a newer view deck is built in its place.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-10-28T23:43:27.533023369Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Nico Aguilar\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWdTaCsDXJKQqvtCHAco4xVLhiHUbPmvWhGskyzuKoVRIIjCWEI9g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:177:\"Very nice viewdeck of the zigzag road of Kennon. You can view the Lion\'s Head from up here. It\'s also a memorial of the Japanese and Filipinos that build the road way back then.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-12-17T18:56:40.213658Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:10:\"iamrrabbit\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX9S9pvCpT_9IxQrT2stQHXt-6gT_sBPt3K6EeIXoRYTFTjLI0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:68:\"Ample parking , paid CR but clean , you can buy local souvenirs here\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-07-23T20:35:43.771665309Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:11:\"Sheryll Ico\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUHUlfqdc3B07CMLFpwZ-bCOhsJjM0dWaJeDMixVk2cYtkGMZ_J_w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba7\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:92:\"Still one of those view decks to see when in Kennon Road. Awesome view on the famous zigzag!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-11-05T03:10:41.270183Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:4;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJC4p7SAAPkTMRyuSR7jXJ6A0\";s:4:\"name\";s:9:\"Viewpoint\";s:3:\"lat\";d:16.2267032;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.65269800000002;s:7:\"address\";s:38:\"6MG3+M3P, Itogon, Benguet, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:8:\"landmark\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:1;s:7:\"reviews\";i:1;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:476:\"places/ChIJC4p7SAAPkTMRyuSR7jXJ6A0/photos/AVoNoXSrAr7_QU9xaLtDTX5q-SiXS7Izn4Bwn7pLLnDEim_YiqUIQCNnqDhoZId8uT13OODKR3gKTblxtdBTQeT5Ci_jUa6W7gEs-c79nc0VVrE4xrcZNr5pCSgNDJVN8hUhzWFYKaFFUIeRw5u_wESRqm2_ZbblDg2uE9T3XZhZg03ifmAIPHexTOSDUsP-tzklyuXmf6IESL11N4eibxglcasTzbIEjjTOcEePLH7LsUxHdDAWdQ0m5Y5P3eTbjzWkP_JUoecuAo-J6ZNrcEoYu3Xsr5DmXMnC2Uh6mxnoMbismnkPyU80huKRpvcwyA-WoeEqPHMInO9PvltPPlMEpofUe8STWv1shx0EdkzuAhNXItDqpAUHXRMTPBIbbFeWZsxpRjXleDP88k0TBOeNZJ5e2RbSkB9AVV7K7B4DGy2a8A\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:3:{i:0;s:476:\"places/ChIJC4p7SAAPkTMRyuSR7jXJ6A0/photos/AVoNoXSrAr7_QU9xaLtDTX5q-SiXS7Izn4Bwn7pLLnDEim_YiqUIQCNnqDhoZId8uT13OODKR3gKTblxtdBTQeT5Ci_jUa6W7gEs-c79nc0VVrE4xrcZNr5pCSgNDJVN8hUhzWFYKaFFUIeRw5u_wESRqm2_ZbblDg2uE9T3XZhZg03ifmAIPHexTOSDUsP-tzklyuXmf6IESL11N4eibxglcasTzbIEjjTOcEePLH7LsUxHdDAWdQ0m5Y5P3eTbjzWkP_JUoecuAo-J6ZNrcEoYu3Xsr5DmXMnC2Uh6mxnoMbismnkPyU80huKRpvcwyA-WoeEqPHMInO9PvltPPlMEpofUe8STWv1shx0EdkzuAhNXItDqpAUHXRMTPBIbbFeWZsxpRjXleDP88k0TBOeNZJ5e2RbSkB9AVV7K7B4DGy2a8A\";i:1;s:476:\"places/ChIJC4p7SAAPkTMRyuSR7jXJ6A0/photos/AVoNoXSr9QUgvDstp3z63Pyu9C6_NqFFskL9DcH8Ki_3hI8ocIfvA2bgP3K59Bb10-NC185fj5gBFyuysBkKET4Mp69q6iSNYqko771mrUb1KAWvEmKE883QUoIqUMAlQKXzBTNqQrjmTn9JdeaFzsUyN_MQovJzPrL0ew0HuFiCqjf0YDwD37UXPamE7YxK_bod7sKz4u6dvfnS9-BsRHflSVP80JVRZ9DoXwTiD49pb54uDSULhAfA423HSPTNGe6M0r