\";}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:5:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:11:\"Rey Rodrigo\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWN9Mjh3vDSFr8-W9yYjzgJkQCTJ8iQF6CLZKwK1u4Xrc4wilC-=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:187:\"Malico in San Nicolas, Pangasinan — cool breeze, pine trees, and scenic mountain views! Perfect place to escape the city and enjoy fresh air, nature, and a bit of soul-refreshing quiet.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-07-31T01:20:32.324900846Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Jimwel Ramos\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUQar_1w7Fd9HJEDuUy1ZrKRe-mpt7xskBNvZFWT9kRZsooZXFU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:124:\"The store was in quite great place for some overview, the place is clean but not well organized for its picture taking place\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-09-02T14:51:19.960913Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Willie Ambrosio\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:116:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJG937gIJPGNWPAVzdulbXaWkntXyy48rnMXiatUXn405KEkA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:39:\"The malico viewpoint is very beautiful.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-03-13T21:32:00.909950Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"lezlie reyes\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXC-Ziit7PaUc_lg62ffRhYoNDca9KLB1BG-S-FgWhMv1qjggw-=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:94:\"Love the view!! Plus it was so cold when we passed by here, you can also buy vegetables ♥️\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-03-10T21:32:25.154957915Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"relly radima\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:116:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIuFKzKsSdRFD0Kb9fzHPud5urO9UcL0qSVik2xtgQOt4Bx4g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"t