rcontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXbPxtso6XSPMkBoUnLL-g96jbPJLsCjRmkO_HwYwOhZ9mVIg4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:286:\"This place is suppose to be about nature, a quite place where visitors can somehow experience Mt. Arayat views. But people bring loud music and turns the place into  party theme etc...and you see  lot of garbage around. The place is more like a \"palengke\". But mountain view is great...\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-03-14T10:08:01.408211632Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:20:\"Verity Wilson-Ganela\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXpfH3mCAJDs3J1x54F56VgXmRWQ1BDvB3LHqmA-2_cJXdlyJCErQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:137:\"Great range of street food all cooked in front of you. Amazing views of the mountains. Mother Nature even put on a light show (lighting).\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-07-05T00:49:38.451845736Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"marc capinlac\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWDVQq6Wtr4Nud4BXakjKiiCoZVyOh4e6D-Old4PUWpcoS6bahR=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:4:\"?\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-07-10T13:20:29.685154265Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:16;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJeXaDCwATkTMRC0iOdhw7NHE\";s:4:\"name\";s:19:\"Mt. Makoy viewpoint\";s:3:\"lat\";d:16.127294;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.60166900000002;s:7:\"address\";s:39:\"4JG2+WM, Sison, Pangasinan, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:3:\"poi\";s:6:\"rating\";N;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:0;s:7:\"reviews\";i:0;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:492:\"places/ChIJeXaDCwATkTMRC0iOdhw7NHE/photos/AVoNoXQ95aqZgf91S0brhGAOIVWC6D4ZhZ_p9e_bbCF3ExMDTU5yfU8sGneQBJI8oPeO_WcPPsHAN0n3roF_Yd6_Xpr1VpOtXoTLuxxBwpbJ6cfCVnAM4ZgGCSkP9WV4atAz1-B6eMyUCcIVzKZba9CTxuFVS6f85ZphvR1Ce6UvbkKEU0adgaF