overlooking Mt.Malussong this is at the back of the main summit. It has a very nice view of the remaining forest of the mountain and there are less people as compared to the main summit, although most of it is still open trail.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-06-16T08:27:31.738498029Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Skyler Pamatmat\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:121:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW-QpSbgv0_xtfYquRzfnip6B_WQLDfAfFzVLbobs0QevXvcCb3NQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:126:\"It was my first time hiking. For a beginner, it wasn’t too hard. It was a 2/9 open trail, and the view was worth the effort.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-10-20T11:45:22.692490Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:10:\"Rein Fenix\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVYtEd3NxPe47Czb0LSPzGhOZsAAH4cwXZip6ECA9IVz_errI4u=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:137:\"Breathtaking view of the town proper of Aritao upon its summit. Also easily accessible by a two wheeled vehicle and a hundred meter trek.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2022-03-26T07:49:33.484554Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:9:\"trailwild\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:121:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIebQmHQuN5jVpCMotm1ZgD-ExPON2lEJQzBWjd5kQ1iZ6oiU8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:56:\"2019 chase the sunrise?\n#philippinevacation #trailrun\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-07-17T22:10:15.439318Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Jezzer Simeon\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVtBSCtoVp6JwN3VJG0rhOqJYkrWCXgDd-wxNS21-S7f_JH5bU8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:12:\"Awesome ?\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2025-04-09T13:26:06.708331Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:16;a:15:{s