resh fish for sale right at the resort, so seafood goals are a must.\n? If you love activities, there is the banana boat ride that is super fun! ?‍?‍\nPerfect spot to recharge, reset and enjoy life by the sea. ✨\n#BeachLife #SeafoodGoals #BananaBoatFun #ResetModeOn\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-05-09T07:00:06.693789547Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:21:\"Xenia Arianna Orduela\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:118:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXUes90uJwMhoeNC0_HxsKccoWu5c0zOT_TpS2WJUU9jSBpQ9o=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:91:\"The owners are very accommodating and kind. The place is quiet. You will really find peace.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2025-05-24T18:27:20.740409Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:16:\"Khalfan Punsalan\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:121:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXa0VigBYWVSnel9srozX3IT3Cny1IziS24PpVsxrJY_ht6XQ5LQw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2025-03-30T22:31:28.569122Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:10;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJ718mudQDkTMRfxZIrShQFsM\";s:4:\"name\";s:22:\"Malico Viewpoint Store\";s:3:\"lat\";d:16.1736276;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.86334469999998;s:7:\"address\";s:36:\"Santa Fe, Nueva Vizcaya, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:10:\"restaurant\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.6;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:24;s:7:\"reviews\";i:24;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:478:\"places/ChIJ718mudQDkTMRfxZIrShQFsM/photos/AVoNoXTtNXS0rroaSmvb6EH7rdSP9zoC6U-WSF-D6Q6cD83q-ncIBuz_LKjaHuZBMUM2WJnfKJhK56YrGYozpDYFgI5cb-k48G5yIZ03TTlzC5pEya3JLt1LRms_G6dAJtADnx3MOEWYOwP4jgnSrjgPP-sQ8VyRBkkr2zcIMRuqpQPwFi_HfGMyeSQyp7SHBpsNurY7ktrUoIMw1Pf8UXVgH0RZeZIDkwFbB5G_Umfu5F2f8gdreZMwo9nqYAPsnApf0Y_pxZ7fC5SQ_rMGYAbX6u1C6crZLme1uyckIIOHKxPg-1MHTGaKXVvdf1WhTeWhBFpFlRw8YaFLy-kcdF-U-8xOfzBJ2rwjh5OqRdKwMCrkWVPc06zE1s1MEdmUrt0mB6lsSW