\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:129:\"Food was delicious, served hot (perfect for the cold weather), and had generous serving! Unli brewed coffee tasted great as well!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-11-29T11:50:33.118033Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:6:\"st ooo\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUUw_L9ewldoB6JruArVR2kDQyoxTq2yMcRwg_KnGFBkrEbA94=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:47:\"crazy how you can even see itogon from here?\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-04-13T10:06:15.067802355Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Erwin Deleña\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWcsvGlRF70pz2pHUft2mguMEK1bKQk2FrB98UDCm0Qdlr7kqo=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-04-06T01:06:41.207667777Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:3;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJH7My69mgkTMR9v0n4BGoPvM\";s:4:\"name\";s:21:\"Kennon Road Viewpoint\";s:3:\"lat\";d:16.3751583;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.60707849999999;s:7:\"address\";s:90:\"Purok 7, 9JG4+3MP Zigzag, Camp 7, Kennon Rd, Camp 7, 54, Baguio, 2600 Benguet, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:8:\"landmark\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.4;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:697;s:7:\"reviews\";i:697;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:476:\"places/ChIJH7My69mgkTMR9v0n4BGoPvM/photos/AVoNoXRMrQutI7PIrKU_FboMrafnpvuxbZJolIp6VUCPHeWqFY7-eTgQkHeqq3b1Oa4chJaS5xJm-Vy_G4eC4WwQwZaxB1BxfPm5hWGGkVtBek7p8D_ILDo9I3PAYPzkCBRhulvnOyyDRzCovikLJHQf-JsPRLQ9-n--wJLebu-ZuQcbvzO-U8gtb6VPnOdhxaq5twOMRXRO6WbAm6RcayVuzMrcGzJyqHhGSyxADrlLWfRWJFfJFeXXlQ9ExQTthx0sx78jDhHudgfsI-wqjaxsCui6P0JTP8U6czTINtzkjtaUQ_PBz0xaT_eRhczlaUg-qioEygLPzzzKTsd5DPRoemx-NpgBZPKKxsJn2Ma9QBeJvGwK9xYq748gqFrPWQOM9VLwJtdi2P-Tdqwb4Z0zE1kcg9z9YJeSsWe1UOFBQOr5kQ\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:6:{i:0;s:476:\"places/ChIJH7My