a-/ALV-UjXq7MIlxs7AU8w1iXXJLgUka8tk5MhMfl1g3d6kTNi3dbAxNPeh=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:647:\"A must-visit for nature lovers and road trippers. The view is absolutely breathtaking — you can see the vast mountains, pine trees, and winding roads below. It’s especially scenic in the late afternoon when fog starts to roll in, giving the area a calm and dreamy atmosphere.\n\nThere aren’t any benches or facilities, so it’s more of a quick stop to take in the view and snap some photos. Still, it’s a peaceful and refreshing place to pause and enjoy the fresh mountain air.\n\nJust make sure to bring water and wear comfortable shoes if you’re exploring the area. A great photo spot and a perfect break during your drive through Malico!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-08-23T13:23:41.170195835Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"Local Reviewer\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVS2Z43OHVCAMSdufou-hPZh5IQoahRIFzepXJs-GIzofQ0oMA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:76:\"Good place for view also the four trees at the top. Just find a spot to view\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-11-20T12:04:57.729888Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Abigail Cushing\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVPmFHNvGrH_qzXfTRncJ5w4olREui-pbOd6q5mRyPc5763UB1S=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:60:\"My 2nd time, this spot never gets out of style love it! ?\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-10-22T02:14:38.119860024Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Lunar (GAPH)\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVc0iA4RBU1qH4HBwtmBrnX1M_dRrDF5iUZRGEhXRYVIgPdRCL9lA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:90:\"This little strip of land marks the spot that you are almost near the main area of Malico.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2