cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:21:\"Very beautiful place.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-08-13T11:57:59.673973008Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Melchor Caasi\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKTKDTVHPTLqvWCL-mIwTKfed8UyU6lGxji2wxfYHsSlq6LaQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:113:\"The place is amazing, we had a lot of fun. The road is not that bad to drive on. It is an amazing place to visit.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2025-05-14T23:45:27.243312Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"Richard Kinnud\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXAzmt2cskwnJBd_IfN0JTq92-iJX6kBVEsW9OIyCNGCCxUWe85=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:3;s:4:\"text\";s:252:\"The queue for taking pictures on that point marked as the view point was too long yet there are other points along this road where the view is more magnificent such as the boundary proper (Malico - Sta Rosa boundary) and other parts towards San Nicolas\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-05-02T22:39:17.492698Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Ruch Cuaresma\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVTTEAIRnkn0kx8KtVnoBR6Ndg22Nar0OvtOAdBjr59emJGcPJZ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:53:\"Best weekend get away!!! Very relaxing environment…\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2025-04-25T01:15:08.835285Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}}',1789631561),('laravel-cache-rapidapi_search_59e744d6fa396b357528bc8cf03e390d_15.869_120.569','a:20:{i:0;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJF4o4IvMDkTMRdXu-qfqfPZE\";s:4:\"name\";s:20:\"Malico Viewpoint Inn\";s:3:\"lat\";d:16.1553125;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.8256875;s:7:\"address\";s:45:\"5R4G+47, Santa Fe, Nueva Vizcaya, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:8:\"land