8w1iXXJLgUka8tk5MhMfl1g3d6kTNi3dbAxNPeh=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:647:\"A must-visit for nature lovers and road trippers. The view is absolutely breathtaking — you can see the vast mountains, pine trees, and winding roads below. It’s especially scenic in the late afternoon when fog starts to roll in, giving the area a calm and dreamy atmosphere.\n\nThere aren’t any benches or facilities, so it’s more of a quick stop to take in the view and snap some photos. Still, it’s a peaceful and refreshing place to pause and enjoy the fresh mountain air.\n\nJust make sure to bring water and wear comfortable shoes if you’re exploring the area. A great photo spot and a perfect break during your drive through Malico!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-08-23T13:23:41.170195835Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"Local Reviewer\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVS2Z43OHVCAMSdufou-hPZh5IQoahRIFzepXJs-GIzofQ0oMA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:76:\"Good place for view also the four trees at the top. Just find a spot to view\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-11-20T12:04:57.729888Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Abigail Cushing\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVPmFHNvGrH_qzXfTRncJ5w4olREui-pbOd6q5mRyPc5763UB1S=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:60:\"My 2nd time, this spot never gets out of style love it! ?\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-10-22T02:14:38.119860024Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Lunar (GAPH)\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVc0iA4RBU1qH4HBwtmBrnX1M_dRrDF5iUZRGEhXRYVIgPdRCL9lA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:90:\"This little strip of land marks the spot that you are almost near the main area of Malico.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-07-06T04:14:42.729922401Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Kill _phil Dito\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWunaQDL9V9k24fNXpVW-DlmTobWeKqea_MPntB3HTk8Wrvqcjy=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:138:\"Great scenery and the perfect spot for taking pictures. Cool temperatures and the best twisties you\'ll find. O.M.C. view point is amazing.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-02-07T22:12:37.512253Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:5;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJN0X9HAC9ljMRoRgabLqnpq0\";s:4:\"name\";s:34:\"Viewpoint – Monasterio de Tarlac\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.436714199999999;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.4303286;s:7:\"address\";s:48:\"CCPJ+M4P, Lubigan, San Jose, Tarlac, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:3:\"poi\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:1;s:7:\"reviews\";i:1;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:494:\"places/ChIJN0X9HAC9ljMRoRgabLqnpq0/photos/AVoNoXSH09DFt4txNCiX5DzITTNv-L6wIar2ljiIPGcYsZB3mShtLHjedTqpQX53V9N76dBZxBY1sIcEa2th8UlskCzVB6AkAliZSaopbSUg-heHZNgPKqMwVNtuf_U4TcR9Iw3rZqhAbFxssP0QMAT8PPf_z-W-FLS-i0n8n0C0Py-bP68KejU4HJzA9zPW0NieCiVmwtfZ3rYvIfidRZjdgJYaUg1pqkI_y04INZbsjIYZJLriZ39qHwpU3FpguLR4WG7ujCmWQ16csxLgwbYtRwvm0r_7_fLwyblM__lJF1aXEXBR2whm7Nq0x5cNavhDkXRbEzn3FrFyMJ4OZlUguw7xTCJ2-ocz8xMLUMC6rDR_965XtptlZLf0LDiyXD2ejJ3ssAg91cfESpojU4OramEvy-7gLQtfu0CsrjradSW7Qb2eg-wLBvsarQhcyph_\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:6:{i:0;s:494:\"places/ChIJN0X9HAC9ljMRoRgabLqnpq0/photos/AVoNoXSH09DFt4txNCiX5DzITTNv-L6wIar2ljiIPGcYsZB3mShtLHjedTqpQX53V9N76dBZxBY1sIcEa2th8UlskCzVB6AkAliZSaopbSUg-heHZNgPKqMwVNtuf_U4TcR9Iw3rZqhAbFxssP0QMAT8PPf_z-W-FLS-i0n8n0C0Py-bP68KejU4HJzA9zPW0NieCiVmwtfZ3rYvIfidRZjdgJYaUg1pqkI_y04INZbsjIYZJLriZ39qHwpU3FpguLR4WG7ujCmWQ16csxLgwbYtRwvm0r_7_fLwyblM__lJF1aXEXBR2whm7Nq0x5cNavhDkXRbEzn3FrFyMJ4OZlUguw7xTCJ2-ocz8xMLUMC6rDR_965XtptlZLf0LDiyXD2ejJ3ssAg91cfESpojU4OramEvy-7gLQtfu0CsrjradSW7Qb