3rP8xr8K7u7TU6Yrjcav4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:172:\"Best food I\'ve had so far in my life (lol srsly) but not the most expensive. Unli sabaw and unli kape is good too! May mga pasalubong din sila. And the best part? The view.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2025-04-01T10:56:59.416528Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Jannine Vasquez\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWPgVSrjchzI2LDXZMqr0RgaQfsHVm6nNTF3qTXWWlf1w_8CExDbQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:129:\"Food was delicious, served hot (perfect for the cold weather), and had generous serving! Unli brewed coffee tasted great as well!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-11-29T11:50:33.118033Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:6:\"st ooo\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUUw_L9ewldoB6JruArVR2kDQyoxTq2yMcRwg_KnGFBkrEbA94=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:47:\"crazy how you can even see itogon from here?\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-04-13T10:06:15.067802355Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Erwin Deleña\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWcsvGlRF70pz2pHUft2mguMEK1bKQk2FrB98UDCm0Qdlr7kqo=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-04-06T01:06:41.207667777Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:5;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJC4p7SAAPkTMRyuSR7jXJ6A0\";s:4:\"name\";s:9:\"Viewpoint\";s:3:\"lat\";d:16.2267032;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.65269800000002;s:7:\"address\";s:38:\"6MG3+M3P, Itogon, Benguet, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:8:\"landmark\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:1;s:7:\"reviews\";i:1;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:476:\"places/ChIJC4p7SAAPkTMRyuSR7jXJ6A0/photos/AVoNoXS2m9K_7