0 per person for a group, I would expect a tasty and appetizing meal.\n\nI will come back only for a quick stop for a coffee with a view, but definitely not for the food.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-06-27T05:05:36.932223408Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Herbert Baron\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:121:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUnOz9Rk_QF7-PFcGCDO9_7iZobYqiewku0WEgcd94MDhs4HZoc6w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:146:\"Relaxing place with a great view of Benguet. It’s near Baguio. Delicious food, good service, and a perfect spot to unwind and enjoy the scenery.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-06-29T10:55:22.725266384Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"Rosaine Encila\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:116:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocID9EzppsupXAx-PpskI54i6PH2foYmTvZ7k4M-vc6vBUUmVQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:60:\"Great food with an amazing view?and courteous staff☺️\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-06-05T10:36:16.969886892Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:4:\"Kyle\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVWx0cW5e45flfOzKupU--sHNswtF4VrQiOrS8lvcvj6_ntZLU1=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:58:\"Perfect food + perfect spot. Will definitely come back! :)\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-12-10T10:31:04.430352187Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:11:\"Zenji Kaito\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:118:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVzjCA5eM-d_Zw4BwsdiHdquarqvUiM2OSH305gWdyD5usYsKE=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:649:\"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ 5 Stars\n\nThe ambiance is beautiful, relaxing, and very peaceful. It’s such a quiet and cozy place, perfect for enjoying a nice meal and taking a break from the busy surroundings.\n\nThe staff are very kind, friendly, and accommodating, which made the whole experience even more enjoyable. Their chef is truly talented, and honestly, the food was delicious and well-prepared.\n\nI also really appreciate that they are pet-friendly, which is a big plus for pet lovers. Overall, we had a wonderful experience and truly enjoyed our visit. Highly recommended for the great food, excellent service, relaxing atmosphere, and warm hospitality!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-09-02T15:43:54.702915548Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:13;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJeXaDCwATkTMRC0iOdhw7NHE\";s:4:\"name\";s:19:\"Mt. Makoy viewpoint\";s:3:\"lat\";d:16.127294;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.60166900000002;s:7:\"address\";s:39:\"4JG2+WM, Sison, Pangasinan, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:3:\"poi\";s:6:\"rating\";N;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:0;s:7:\"reviews\";i:0;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:492:\"places/ChIJeXaDCwATkTMRC0iOdhw7NHE/photos/AVoNoXTEAvDzrMXd8KLPC-s8mq-b_WrlciSAnVJ5A5r5yK-cZTtCyKT9ykT2AdIX-JgZqAGibaSuw9soTYrAEAbRQPAvjhtvc3vquTFd-cZH6hTnEYIZSMgSyrY-yJjBKQ3nZ8NSZVfOTSH2knpfww4GQESdvcXivTgVHj6NhwbSnDWkUKPaE624fpDyvWEx04uzJ0T5-9niSbICFtnfZtLZhYRJKl4GzfPjJGSDmH7TYLomHM1765d5vAGm196i-GgnPnNW9y5zx4YdMLYsgulraoG-1M8l47qtCEVYQu2UWg1UfWLsIYKcSqikq8r8M1tdDNEwGYzoSv4s1IpI0_6hADM-35J6tWBH3NqIfUwvF2U6l1NknsQnmifV6UDbfMnuplwaVYfKmG3w43enSj7uMHreRaxnJMGqs7I4WocmDBvWIbPmKCcfohP0cl3Row\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:3:{i:0;s:492:\"places/ChIJeXaDCwATkTMRC0iOdhw7NHE/photos/AVoNoXTEAvDzrMXd8KLPC-s8mq-b_WrlciSAnVJ5A5r5yK-cZTtCyKT9ykT2AdIX-JgZqAGibaSuw9soTYrAEAbRQPAvjhtvc3vquTFd-cZH6hTnEYIZSMgSyrY-yJjBKQ3nZ8NSZVfOTSH2knpfww4GQESdvcXivTgVHj6NhwbSnDWkUKPaE624fpDyvWEx04uzJ0T5-9niSbICFtnfZtLZhYRJKl4GzfPjJGSDmH7TYLomHM1765d5vAGm196i-GgnPnNW9y5zx4YdMLYsgulraoG-1M8l47qtCEVYQu2UWg1UfWLsIYKcSqikq8r8M1tdDNEwGYzoSv4s1IpI0_6hADM-35J6tWBH3NqIfUwvF2U6l1NknsQnmifV6UDbfMnuplwaVYfKmG3w43enSj7uMHreRaxnJMGqs7I4WocmDBvWIbPmKCcfohP0cl3Row\";i:1;s:492:\"places/ChIJeXaDCwATkTMRC0iOdhw7NHE/photos/AVoNoXR8joNfCjdv9KCojs