JY0rPB8ORkTMRKLXVFMQO3aQ/photos/AVoNoXSPVt9Baa6TxkDjYsRuSBpkqLS3CYfLGvZBwxKz-XyyZR0PS3OzvtLhXLNIXw_OD0svFNWJ4OyzXqu-7VMbBW7K5_CFfCCs7Sx-HbMzld8p2qCSrDaYJ61cuAH_cI4VofcIfhoYpVVVZhZZ5x7KJDHlJ0CRlf31yMeofr8p2lHGFi2VlcLvNtD7jpxlasg_UovOdGlBBHJMuOJlEd_9g8BUFr2dZdZpy-2TplCLBA0N8C2sr5zFJWF2-exw69h2eQZSTEEoAV7XOlBlEyUGPoYW6My-zhFYnmNHW_lotPr_zVJFT88v5Z4HtzeGQYTu8izu0m0npnXFm9XlLcYJWwqrijKeIzfLcQq9d_rV6WccXQXHdrADX4yirlm_r4v_mHJp4tNHNMgqm5ukTUUjg61eOMm9fBhfnTzIZSoVM2GfHpI\";i:5;s:476:\"places/ChIJY0rPB8ORkTMRKLXVFMQO3aQ/photos/AVoNoXTE-tI0i29FMEM7BOcK5gy-uBoyr6Qnpq2pfxKAXCZ3YJPlMKqhXdT0u5f-VfQffHjdYcfZDeA7ya1i_lpSqqira5uApwwSW8HIQb5n117KCGeWJsbbNb1OHk411Scgc3QnV_IDgcdYFLmQhG5xipgkdPAiGa7nj55tPVVKCf3IFJ3iHPDyR8HttmBOTnwk00mc9AUlFHE1WToVTIUilkVT4tHgMA2zD4Zq7HY2W1LgpRXGvcOc5IwogW6N7KYIsR-8GGYST30W5ZGc2CEpSCshhqwIyMUnOI9HcSCa_JvzJdHVWB0GDzBiAjj7iM03IOBVXyoyTXpaVRVDNN_fU4J_99L6LOwpc_f9OXN4uXajwhreDvXiKJJpCTeG1IClhm7z7rfwUFx5X-w41KfLA_JmKRNFR5VQ0-DwE3-2JKOpEg\";}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:5:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:17:\"Lyka Mikaela Damo\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:121:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVtNM5PcGeuhn8GQce37cYZeFzLfz6uo_GwIMcgZi1X_fiYOgSRCQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:2;s:4:\"text\";s:1529:\"We arrived around 9PM and placed our order at probably 9:30–9:40PM. The serving time took around 30–40 minutes, which honestly felt a bit long, especially since we were already tired and hungry by then. Though to be fair, I understand that it was late and the kitchen might’ve been handling a lot of orders too, so I’m trying to consider that side as well.\n\nThe place is an open area naman and the view upstairs was actually nice, which is why we originally wanted to stay on the second floor. But it was still REALLY hot when we got there. I think some of their fans were broken, and there were only like 1 or 2 working fans around, so the air barely reached us. We eventually transferred to the first floor, but it was still warm there too. We even had to ask the cashier if we could borrow one of their fans ? but even that one wasn’t strong enough to give proper air lmao. The heat honestly made the waiting time feel even longer.\n\nAs for the food, it was pretty mid overall. Nothing too bad, but nothing super memorable either. The Sisig Silog was actually good and flavorful, but the Seafood Lomi just wasn’t my type personally. After waiting that long, I guess I expected the food to hit a little more. Still, the prices were reasonable and pretty much what you’d expect for the serving sizes and place.\n\nOverall, I hope they can take this review positively and improve some things, especially the ventilation and serving time, because the place actually has potential and the ambiance/view is nice naman.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-05-11T05:59:59.889790729Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Jemimah Cellona\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV9KQNhnig8I25fkHg8gQayQabRpilNAmVGqBjHtaMcKziCLzi0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:272:\"It\'s our first time but we are so very disappointed.We are waiting for the food for almost 1hr then when they serve the food,it\'s not even worth it for the thousand price..The food is not even hot and it\'s cold like fresh from the refrigerator and it doesn\'t taste good...\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-12-17T15:10:42.897361161Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:23:\"Sulamita Flores-Catalan\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWoaJ_kdTpFbK_UtKGeqN4nrW6jhyhxro-dqWkogud8RfXkldAk=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:3;s:4:\"text\";s:40:\"Great place for watching the sun set. :)\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-03-18T09:53:33.723985Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:10:\"Silas Sinn\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJjXygE8NFL5_ADQQtwNF3NsEKl5qaVDzKvIztNXOPEqv68UA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:2;s:4:\"text\";s:419:\"Been here 2x now as not many choices here.  Today we had freezer burned pork sinigang. My manok was very good, but the \"unlimited\" veg was only 2 tbs and they wouldn\'t bring more.\n\nAt no time will a server follow up after taking your initial order and bringing you food. Don\'t wait for the staff to come if you need anything at all you must go all the way down to the bar, where you will find the waitress on her phone.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-05-02T06:05:35.828534Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:16:\"Amariles Bacagan\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWRuf4JZ8ngu6XP8YFnlwzmkS7agqphM-e9SpIrzNntM2iOZnuf=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:787:\"I saw the place online because we\'re looking for good restaurant to eat we don\'t expect the road was too risky and accident prone area but we didn\'t mind that at all just because we want to visit the place and we message the page just to check out what time the restaurant closes they told as 7am to 11:00 pm so we still travel there just because it\'s only the restaurant we know that is still open we arrived there 10:18 pm and ask if we still can order food but the staff look at each other and the other staff whisper says to her coworkers to tell that they don\'t want to accept customer anymore ,that\'s why they told me the kitchen staff has already left, I felt disappointed at that time because we travel so far just to visit the place despite of everything....not worth the risk!!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-12-03T15:06:17.847016Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:16;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJYVEiZomhkTMRJRm55-5gG5k\";s:4:\"name\";s:21:\"Santo Tomas Viewpoint\";s:3:\"lat\";d:16.3660386;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.568937;s:7:\"address\";s:52:\"9H89+CH7, Santo Tomas Rd, Tuba, Benguet, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_pl