int early in the morning to catch the famous Sea of Clouds — and it was truly breathtaking! ? The panoramic views of mountains blanketed in clouds are worth waking up before sunrise for. The peaceful atmosphere and cool mountain air made the experience so relaxing.\n\nThe viewpoint isn’t very crowded, which is perfect if you want photos without too many people in the background. There’s also a small eatery right at the spot where you can grab coffee or a simple breakfast while watching the clouds slowly disappear as the sun rises — such a nice touch! ☕?\n\nA couple of tips:\n\nGo right before dawn and check weather conditions since the sea of clouds doesn’t appear every day — it’s a rare but magical sight when it does.\n\nDress warmly — it can get chilly at that altitude.\n\nOverall, a lovely experience — a bit off the usual tourist trail, but absolutely worth the visit if you’re in Nueva Vizcaya! ?\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-02-24T06:11:51.242233272Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:11:\"KenVentures\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:121:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWxttdxRHBdtlRUV-HWspY6aLY97QbMNod_dnrGsBktTDWkt5iNng=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:67:\"A must visit travel destination. Highly recommended! ?☁️?\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-07-08T15:27:14.333485867Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Dhiana Reighn\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:116:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLn1kWr0lcfEbfpk7rZ9bPnGKhi_TL-c-dO3hEUQoZV-z_UMQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:93:\"I love this zongavan viewpoint in sea of clouds?\nThis is the one of my favorite place ?\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-03-26T04:39:52.124395219Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:11:\"jhon cuenco\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJkxA2fAcWq8Lo1rImPTPn0LS5FD7EDXTwxslQbmnr_JwOYDw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:114:\"Cooler than Baguio, a very relaxing place.. unfortunately we didn\'t witness the sea of clouds dew to strong wind..\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-07-04T12:56:19.774107Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Beth Martinez\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWyLpNNkmjFmdv-65OfejqQjQtM7UMcP9l-KuYKgKLLU_pbTbgF=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:41:\"The best place to view the Sea of Clouds.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-01-22T06:06:26.045134Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:18;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJ8UwcjSmjkTMR4p8VYfso-cM\";s:4:\"name\";s:16:\"Lungon ViewPoint\";s:3:\"lat\";d:16.459661;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.602967;s:7:\"address\";s:43:\"FJ53+C3R, La Trinidad, Benguet, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:8:\"landmark\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.7;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:3;s:7:\"reviews\";i:3;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:461:\"places/ChIJ8UwcjSmjkTMR4p8VYfso-cM/photos/AVoNoXR0UHNl1DwG8RYkp6ft6dSMQf07YEgWQJZ17NT5u5rrY8FG3YBI7aW4nQW9yKmMl1JPG9chOxMgnUXWl-7si0ASJ1_WUPZms7NOUv4g9KDaeDYsK5njk6lv_nDkQrckl7BkbGFRNDTCU-ZCEe68Y5YISyLwutdFe3IjNTFa-BmrujLAZqsRAOqjwr7_6lHQP_wEXDmBqoZMpwY0ik5WS7-RAHNyAcI8cWHcXm1JYaNFtc6erG7FcMCHF-nwBSokcuacMw0CJNZJNIF37jobZu3qEAtH73mQwSiKeCnzsSAx5w7ysnA9MouOUeEVffXuWqQiFNceSdoKY5bb1XSq52NPQI_jgSvkn6nm9YmCvAKQaggNkhY_Es9qimNfQNHeIXj_lFUqUWHITDF_YAnQ0GWoIJyDHrQ\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:6:{i:0;s:461:\"places/ChIJ8UwcjSmjkTMR4p8VYfso-cM/photos/AVoNoXR0UHNl1DwG8RYkp6ft6dSMQf07YEgWQJZ17NT5u5rrY8FG3YBI7aW4nQW9yKmMl1JPG9chOxMgnUXWl-7si0ASJ1_WUPZms7NOUv4g9KDaeDYsK5njk6lv_nDkQrckl7BkbGFRNDTCU-ZCEe68Y5YISyLwutdFe3IjNTFa-BmrujLAZqsRAOqjwr7_6lHQP_wEXDmBqoZMpwY0ik5WS7-RAHNyAcI8cWHcXm1JYaNFtc6erG7FcMCHF-nwBSokcuacMw0CJNZJNIF37jobZu3qEAtH73mQwSiKeCnzsSAx5w7ysnA9MouOUeEVffXuWqQiFNceSdoKY5bb1XSq52NPQI_jgSvkn6nm9YmCvAKQaggNkhY_Es9qimNfQNHeIXj_lFUqUWHITDF_YAn