\nIf you paid for an average ₱600 per person for a group, I would expect a tasty and appetizing meal.\n\nI will come back only for a quick stop for a coffee with a view, but definitely not for the food.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-06-27T05:05:36.932223408Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Herbert Baron\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:121:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUnOz9Rk_QF7-PFcGCDO9_7iZobYqiewku0WEgcd94MDhs4HZoc6w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:146:\"Relaxing place with a great view of Benguet. It’s near Baguio. Delicious food, good service, and a perfect spot to unwind and enjoy the scenery.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-06-29T10:55:22.725266384Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"Rosaine Encila\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:116:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocID9EzppsupXAx-PpskI54i6PH2foYmTvZ7k4M-vc6vBUUmVQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:60:\"Great food with an amazing view?and courteous staff☺️\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-06-05T10:36:16.969886892Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:4:\"Kyle\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVWx0cW5e45flfOzKupU--sHNswtF4VrQiOrS8lvcvj6_ntZLU1=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:58:\"Perfect food + perfect spot. Will definitely come back! :)\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-12-10T10:31:04.430352187Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"jodeth mcguire\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:118:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWISE-jk6k4lgSzooy8-ckFVRzwTU1B_m3yANOO6fdtIkdyou0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:24:\"warm staff\ncozy ambiance\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-07-18T18:05:04.541086258Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:1;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJH7My69mgkTMR9v0n4BGoPvM\";s:4:\"name\";s:21:\"Kenn