laces/ChIJn8Imbn2_kTMRQ_9rdnCs-pE/photos/AVoNoXQfbzMH8TeHWYxN3FouTH5vvXueBzgsylZjqnvjnyJG34BhvaWpVuNPMFKnnXEJx72ZXRcvXeISEyKlK7D8i-Qxr6el-RZUM30oO66at1OnRY02qqvzvL2KXjHflhNK2CI5STpg6KzMWTN8lFuDSEXwWo0Ez8f1J8DsKFeCLO_rYfDn-cObMLNGbhXVfygwdSL2v5u-WMrvszl-Qqiqn0eM9ajNAStDgjjgXH2SCg922gfahI9d6l03S7ahY09p0pY3FcFNtE2o84I7Hp6VbnmiVbGl4IgHP8hNVghVDpXR8_cPH89MPKvIokwJIeIWmMb4r_pCAJzwnQowoFsFp06o2YPmtkph4NMZuUnZuYvXrJQQffqUS6WFAQgik4lLoCS_NOF3d4ALYfvgBGQhhdr1jRkcEth6DFPCtmS1NpRF5A\";}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:3:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:5:\"KIV S\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVZbInfTG7mzN1M7BoaFHRCiW98UcMIcMzoaHDkS6-SAMqdyOU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:475:\"The trail is well kept. The stunning view of Benguet is a big feature in the trail. The guides said it usually takes at least 2-3hrs of hike to the campsite, but we were able to arrive in less than 2. There’s also a water source and a couple of comfort rooms available. I also appreciate that there’s a waterfall just a few minutes away from the campsite. Perfect for relaxing and swimming.\n\nOverall, it was a good experience! I hipe I can go back to Camp Utopia someday.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-12-16T12:40:44.087330Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Angelo Custodio\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJQmSlEFC4R7jqTDOe3yft6nzgqaIu1Xo6q0K3jb03OtH3a4A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:51:\"The trail, campsite, falls, the view is satisfying.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-07-28T04:19:41.068914Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Princess Alvero\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXlt40T2loaaUflzpTFgSp-Lu7yt2LC5MCwJGbz94xFLS6X_6Qu=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-12-16T15:45:25.231670Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\