 If you\'re feeling hungry the vicinity has a coffee shop called positivity cafe that offers affordable food with many choices. The coffee shop is so lovely because it has a great view of the kennon road.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-03-06T09:16:26.045136Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Emir Arnaldo\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLYOHAMG-2PWf4CVmmrUp-Vsdvziq1gkhKGVTNgZMmRv3fq6Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:186:\"The location and view were spectacular. The structure however, was much less so, suffering from countless years of neglect. Here\'s to hoping that a newer view deck is built in its place.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-10-28T23:43:27.533023369Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Nico Aguilar\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWdTaCsDXJKQqvtCHAco4xVLhiHUbPmvWhGskyzuKoVRIIjCWEI9g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:177:\"Very nice viewdeck of the zigzag road of Kennon. You can view the Lion\'s Head from up here. It\'s also a memorial of the Japanese and Filipinos that build the road way back then.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-12-17T18:56:40.213658Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:10:\"iamrrabbit\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX9S9pvCpT_9IxQrT2stQHXt-6gT_sBPt3K6EeIXoRYTFTjLI0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:68:\"Ample parking , paid CR but clean , you can buy local souvenirs here\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-07-23T20:35:43.771665309Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:11:\"Sheryll Ico\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUHUlfqdc3B07CMLFpwZ-bCOhsJjM0dWaJeDMixVk2cYtkGMZ_J_w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba7\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:92:\"Still one of those view decks to see when in Kennon Road. Awesome view on the famous zigzag!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-11-05T03:10:41.270183Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:2;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJrxMbPCOjkTMRA15Ed28P54A\";s:4:\"name\";s:18:\"Sadjatan Viewpoint\";s:3:\"lat\";d:16.4764017;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.56095810000001;s:7:\"address\";s:43:\"FHG6+H98, La Trinidad, Benguet, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:3:\"poi\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.7;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:33;s:7:\"reviews\";i:33;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:476:\"places/ChIJrxMbPCOjkTMRA15Ed28P54A/photos/AVoNoXQA3X3a6QNjpM3ET8BqgjCoCEVxvDxBsQaCkZggoeLQI_d7T-Q4zIzUlul1JZHspFhWy-UvpX0r4EtVJgHIjoGLzyMtE6uqPiaCFXrtK3eqOF8dxDIytPRQIEACKGmWjlz7t-avi6Amtx7f0RmHk2kbi-Ux8QiTa5i27neH28Z94rle-irM78lJHyELPw8AUlmkGRyZ3CtOr5N7kXbD8cTu_rtbk97l-py0rl12SZW5nJ8Tvzasvik1jphTOmW3MSCgqEdnjDF55Tvo046h7b0uU35_UTOC57KZ6w3UQFDLqh-17PhHqZFYZ82NupxHPfsVu90DNCZlls894NrJfqiq2UvOpLcwvZADE5r6vSZQ1T2SMtql4iKp3TO-fJFS33Akkv5qYepjK8dRS0hfNuxIanTGd45FRgRw3zNJ8n54KA\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:6:{i:0;s:476:\"places/ChIJrxMbPCOjkTMRA15Ed28P54A/photos/AVoNoXQA3X3a6QNjpM3ET8BqgjCoCEVxvDxBsQaCkZggoeLQI_d7T-Q4zIzUlul1JZHspFhWy-UvpX0r4EtVJgHIjoGLzyMtE6uqPiaCFXrtK3eqOF8dxDIytPRQIEACKGmWjlz7t-avi6Amtx7f0RmHk2kbi-Ux8QiTa5i27neH28Z94rle-irM78lJHyELPw8AUlmkGRyZ3CtOr5N7kXbD8cTu_rtbk97l-py0rl12SZW5nJ8Tvzasvik1jphTOmW3MSCgqEdnjDF55Tvo046h7b0uU35_UTOC57KZ6w3UQFDLqh-17PhHqZFYZ82NupxHPfsVu90DNCZlls894NrJfqiq2UvOpLcwvZADE5r6vSZQ1T2SMtql4iKp3TO-fJFS33Akkv5qYepjK8dRS0hfNuxIanTGd45FRgRw3zNJ8n54KA\";i:1;s:473:\"places/ChIJrxMbPCOjkTMRA15Ed28P54A/photos/AVoNoXTEy9CtTkSgjuM9KrMiV0Vxc_NxPlQH4vg7LL_AT7tbFVu9fpbWYgrLFUixHcoVb4VqhA1aRXazNie2dmGkVFe5-aNk7AjtJr5hvowl4kZKY4gFzGywrbJh-IqDBvmaWsq5OHq31iRTp_t1_ZbmuPfU2n_LU_YbLeDwPj18XtSkbpmzQUKq2I4lQVHzcsHUpibIwu1VanmBLi6Ph28ZJDAevW6qRT-QFoBPIpWuDabPFNQGaP0ZeWdwjazGOVS_dC934znvggfSGnX1kfmaUIOQFVvty0jnzl54bapwN-GmxzpCleX_0lCrbgKHVptCFbCwbtoxhLKG8gvsZobTqmtyXaMh23GNe5dMW4SfKP9bc7