p-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:475:\"The trail is well kept. The stunning view of Benguet is a big feature in the trail. The guides said it usually takes at least 2-3hrs of hike to the campsite, but we were able to arrive in less than 2. There’s also a water source and a couple of comfort rooms available. I also appreciate that there’s a waterfall just a few minutes away from the campsite. Perfect for relaxing and swimming.\n\nOverall, it was a good experience! I hipe I can go back to Camp Utopia someday.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-12-16T12:40:44.087330Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Angelo Custodio\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJQmSlEFC4R7jqTDOe3yft6nzgqaIu1Xo6q0K3jb03OtH3a4A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:51:\"The trail, campsite, falls, the view is satisfying.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-07-28T04:19:41.068914Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Princess Alvero\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXlt40T2loaaUflzpTFgSp-Lu7yt2LC5MCwJGbz94xFLS6X_6Qu=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-12-16T15:45:25.231670Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:18;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJCRgtcwADkTMR_ezsqj4X2JI\";s:4:\"name\";s:18:\"Dar-Awan Viewpoint\";s:3:\"lat\";d:16.182487;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.9187827;s:7:\"address\";s:36:\"Santa Fe, Nueva Vizcaya, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:8:\"landmark\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.8;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:5;s:7:\"reviews\";i:5;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:492:\"places/ChIJCRgtcwADkTMR_ezsqj4X2JI/photos/AVoNoXTSIQ0mwC6b1osmKdtsaGYrL3IhC_Eg7NJb11DwbeONsjska7WToXXlvFUH6V1GHGf_Oau-JgkUBOOjXviKu-ajYNDTHjDLU0GEgtU_7H2NcjkH5Jjbu4XeGrehtgaD6OcTQACHaIU92XPZn319Fk7zmzgfr9wMesc_yPMLJHwhk6dt-tK3XgaIwe78IBbLOF