will see the city lights of tarlac and pampanga. be careful walking to the 100meter+ steep climb to the top.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-07-04T12:07:48.157510976Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:6:\"Regine\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:121:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLyACix9E3SI7nnXcIJlzOt3MbCKZ9WleM4qFbcuP4AFj0huno=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:233:\"I was captivated by the stunning views at View Deck At Sitio Baag! ? The landscape is breathtaking, especially during sunset. It\'s truly a must-see spot for anyone looking for natural beauty. ? Highly recommend a visit! ✨?\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-02-08T05:19:05.049326229Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:10:\"Dave Inman\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXD4RWPsYOKkwKZNrMpQ6fcs2vKD1W0_dud-tUcp86mVnwHqsow3g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:96:\"Very unique place, awesome views.\n\nWalkable for most, but could be extreme from some to walk up.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-06-17T13:36:37.328813595Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:7:\"Jalapao\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVzewU59ixmZl9sDsHDvzWgPJ0lmEnYlSgAolFjC1L59pp3eQ4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:240:\"The path to the viewdeck was lovely; as you travel, you\'ll fall in love with the surroundings. From the viewdeck, you\'ll see the rolling hills leading down to the flatlands. I especially love the spectacular 360-degree views from this deck.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-12-02T12:30:04.663772409Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:29:\"Roselle Julian-Andres (Selle)\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUwZGvX-KjpwXkGm7boY7duv1iqy7SAMAIz6eyZ5d2Pp_Id2_Vz=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:172:\"Nice place to visit w