usly\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2019-03-27T12:26:06.774456Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:6:\"Vivs V\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLf7rm7hu066P47HQ6wibjKCAZv_WrSzxbEwFzsR7H8YjeMuA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:165:\"This is where to buy the chicharon (aka bagnet) and other pasalubong stuffs at a reasoable if not cheaper price. Chicharon and rice cakes plus pinipig is a must buy!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-04-14T02:30:14.116643Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:19:\"Aneesh Chazhiyottil\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU1GfAIIvQDHDVnnm-fP54esN53uTC0Frd_NYuCPx5IlLvNrcAIIg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:52:\"Nice Experience first time in Camiling public market\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-07-08T19:57:20.035939Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:11:\"Gil Briones\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:121:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLz974HChvBJB9ub9PeK0rqDIMksFR63iql3LzIrCtIgar23kY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:3;s:4:\"text\";s:195:\"I rate this place only 3 star because this place lack of parking area..need this a big parking area for the convenient of buyers but this place is clean and peace place no harm at all of thieves.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-12-30T19:39:39.674790219Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:3;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJe560Ab-zljMRKQDv37_nD74\";s:4:\"name\";s:17:\"Camiling Bus Stop\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.686547899999997;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.4182863;s:7:\"address\";s:47:\"MCP9+J87, Bridge, Camiling, Tarlac, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:10:\"restaurant\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:3;s:7:\"reviews\";i:3;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:494:\"places/ChIJe560Ab-zljMRKQDv37_nD74/photos/AVoNoXT69SZFByzH