uthor\";s:9:\"Chry i.m.\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU2wgob6yzkZXnBD_Ec7foCm6lu8b1dSpqoKLIHGWs52-z34aaQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:214:\"The best Goto and Tapsilogan. Every once in a while I drive from Manila to Camiling just to eat here. Haven\'t had any other goto and silog place (at the same price range) that\'s better than what Mendoza is serving.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-09-25T03:51:41.344822Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Irish Bonrostro\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWeSu8e58xC_fRIolBOsy_BQ4CU9FdGEB0oEE0ih8keGXnldewlfA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:375:\"They are the go to place if you\'re craving porridge or \"lugaw\" on a budget. Heck they even have other specialties like Mami, Goto, arrozcaldo, and some \'silog\' selections. Place is clean enough but could do better on the condiments like toyo calamansi and especially the chili garlic. But, anyways, overall this is where I go to when craving pangs and I don\'t like to go far.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2022-08-17T22:27:11.393842Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Jaime Nicolas\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLnV4VziptwbJj3fzL1dqgt9mIVgIedtGF7B6fL00ZvH5ADeg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:139:\"I love the daing na bangus but it\'s not my luck today, we\'re too early to have tne bangus but instead, tapsilog is also good in this place.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2022-01-08T08:41:14.155683Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Paulo Family\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJMmPH3GnijnHUWTFBf6-TbWR6-JKYhEJfSUmnaMLdZ4hOPYg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:144:\"We go here whenever we’re in Camiling.  Food is delicious and affordable.  