oi2bfBxowCN3ZTNRj_ALtY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:69:\"Gas is relatively cheaper here compared to other gas stations, though\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2021-02-21T11:15:50.398760Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Abigail Magpayo\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:116:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLHpSjhQCVEjS1OWic5ppiDg7n19oAGKUKHEJI9LBEIKo749g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:9:\"Beautiful\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:24:\"2017-12-26T12:08:55.217Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Riael Tolentino\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVpxXzPXMoFM7kS6jU8UKlkonBpcma49ZfVRqjvUZ1psdNUXGCv=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:606:\"happened today around 3:45am kkk san rafael, the male pump attendant was lazy to go to the pumping station, he wanted you, the customer, to come to him to adjust where he was standing nearby, even those who had previously loaded complained that the attendant was lazy to come, a truck driver approached me and said that he was lazy to come. I will never load at that branch,.\nhe even loaded the close van that had just arrived first, and he even told me that the pump station I stopped at was not working or did not exist, I am not stupid enough to believe that. I just left and only loaded at orange fuel.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2022-03-16T03:30:49.230624Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:10:\"Dark Hack4\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:116:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLCntN6DUw1FDv5NWPhHxXkjByLgJjNz8JMppLGKRHKOoHVog=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:351:\"Poor customer service, always no change and it\'s your fault if you have all your money when you go to gas, then a guilt trip because they ran out of change. 7 employees there, no one even gave them change. It\'s just disappointing, too bad I didn\'t bring my phone so