";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:666:\"I hope you can talk to the manager. Your guard is so rude. The gas station is noisy 24 hours a day, right? We just got home at 3am today. Besides, he\'s always noisy like that. Mom and I have been waking him up for a long time. I got angry and threw him out. I understand that it\'s already 3am, but that\'s what he came to do, if he doesn\'t want his sleep to be disturbed, why hasn\'t he quit yet? We need a super stove for what we sell. Mom cooks all night but that guard doesn\'t complain, he\'s still a man. The 215 gas for the super stove, he even increased it to 230. I\'m buying from him, and suddenly the super stove really goes up. I hope they take action on that.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2021-02-28T19:12:02.003784Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:2;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJb-DQyzzLljMRqjxXBmkILRs\";s:4:\"name\";s:13:\"Dexstar Mktg.\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.6521788;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.58579869999998;s:7:\"address\";s:28:\"Paniqui, Tarlac, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:11:\"gas-station\";s:6:\"rating\";N;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:0;s:7:\"reviews\";i:0;s:15:\"photo_reference\";N;s:16:\"photo_references\";a:0:{}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:0:{}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:3;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJCQqYAwA1kTMRF_KgDq326i0\";s:4:\"name\";s:45:\"Centrum Fuel Station- Estacion Paniqui Tarlac\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.6771394;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.58475709999999;s:7:\"address\";s:38:\"MHGM+VW2, Paniqui, Tarlac, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:11:\"gas-station\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.7;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:7;s:7:\"reviews\";i:7;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:478:\"places/ChIJCQqYAwA1kTMRF_KgDq326i0/photos/AVoNoXTwYd00ZyilXZzXhL5F6PUfFy5UFW1Y7aE60KAQ_c9cimXVFhMJpuqyl0KCuKhYzttluyRbJ4LbN0XefojoBmInZBfFo03wn6QLWtraRIEaVgceFr8kcpHQ_zBfbJ0JcrGL4QF0L0L64FkreXK-6zCZ28cqkVnFSm2aDzglDEZdPVBXrZ7kw