Camille Tamayo\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:118:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUVYphF9ShCe5f2QTNvwAIdZznpcELUsJb55DgxnphHHbQ4N9c=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:167:\"I presented my PVC but the points didn\'t enter. They only give me back the card and the receipt. I am disappointed cause I find Petron gasoline station just to gas up.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2025-06-02T16:30:13.329335Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:3:\"K J\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:121:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIwPnBe1ki_vtBuOs8RxgI2qpOLOV-n7aRj9V43UMJ_i39hTXc=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:310:\"This Petron Gas Station Branch is located along 55 Road beside INC.\n\nThis branch caters other services like change oil, engine fix and other. It has a convenience store which also serves a waiting area if you are waiting for car to be fixed.\n\nVery accomodating staff as always.\n\nAccepts card payments and cash.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2021-11-12T02:57:45.136729Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:30:\"George Balanay Ferrer (Badjao)\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:121:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI3rCOSjwu3wIRLtKubjIc5JYEaZhGr2PlhoHK5tiVSPSQsbbM=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:110:\"The new Petron in my area. The original besides UCPB changed to Alta Gas. A few meters from INC Santa Ignacia.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-05-04T03:10:52.259836Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:8:\"Renz Qui\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK7BvM42yakLH68xTGmCbJx-nYF1ZhfrYYnvmRqoQXib3NIkrCl=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:81:\"Polite gas attendant..  just need a little cleaning or attention to the restroom.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-11-04T03:53:03.315127Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:17:\"Darrell Gatbunton\";s:6:\"avatar\";