d!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-06-01T07:57:00.336012645Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:23:\"Ma. Luisa Joyce Domingo\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:121:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX8ISk87g1I4EivXLajYLa3MP7OV4nH_Yl0qIV3j69Mx3eZVBTa6g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:149:\"Food is good, the service is fast, and they respond to all message inquiries. The staff are reliable, the ambiance is nice—I love it. ,♥️♥️\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-03-19T11:03:54.880272533Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:16:\"patrhina peralta\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:121:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXLSfOJ0ZQCRASVsxg0-veVYnRu48Ti0Ub3eZ2Pe9426ueogAzOyg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:211:\"If you know Jeya, you know the standards for a good Pesto are high ? and this place just took the crown! ?? Good food, good service, and a new favorite spot for me. I’m already planning my next visit!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-03-26T04:09:38.084956108Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Lei Angela Sy\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:117:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ0JDNmYIBodDrsOo3DWwoS5NzFXWa93bRFAroNX__rJlwO5bo=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:56:\"Great food but service is a bit slow. Overall very good.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-05-10T03:16:56.866010223Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:17;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJA97V74RMkTMRGPDMREDbxio\";s:4:\"name\";s:21:\"RRJ2 GASOLINE STATION\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.726979299999998;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.428;s:7:\"address\";s:29:\"Camiling, Tarlac, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:11:\"gas-station\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:1;s:7:\"reviews\";i:1;s:15:\"photo_reference\";N;s:16:\"photo_references\";a:0:{}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:1:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"author