n another note, most of the Centrum gas stations from Camiling going to Western Pangasinan are open 24/7, whereas Petron and Shell close after a certain hour.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:24:\"2018-05-13T05:31:36.517Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:18:\"Ford 95 (Fordy 95)\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV4amA0DBEOZmaYYHgCH1H4wk2YAkEoZqXafGX_8b3O6GsdlF5L=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:79:\"24 hour Gas station and Very Clean Fuel and nearby to San Clemente marketplace.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-08-21T05:24:15.172633Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Cesar Cambay\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLMMIddqbbEWVPAb28zenA2dXiEu4WWvHuQASeod-HQjdoUbw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:92:\"Cheapest petroleum products along Romulo Highway.My pitstop for filling quality diesel fuel.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2018-12-31T04:57:42.007053343Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Kjell Lautrup\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWL9MmTQcVSOrHlHZYHHvdWH2rz9lP8jO7J_xTKI0vxK8KjHLN4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:38:\"Open 24/7 fast service and nice staff.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2019-08-21T03:48:27.489030Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:9:\"Jayzen 23\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUtveGFEyA5mRiY1IOnCcfIEU1_ZwxG6c4zKr8t-s9vXcxSU6l6=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:19:\"Very clean restroom\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-12-09T22:31:25.109589Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:10;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJ53xKzKqzljMR5vrjnkAGNp0\";s:4:\"name\";s:18:\"FUEL 8 GAS STATION\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.6837394;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.40719879999999;s:7:\"address\