and understand that most users of their toilet facilities went be buying gas from their station.\n\nIt may be a stoic policy, or just Pinoy hospitality that they allow non-costumers to just park and ask to use their toilet. Either way, it is a welcome break to get out of the vehicle, stretch your legs and use the toilet.\n\nOn another note, most of the Centrum gas stations from Camiling going to Western Pangasinan are open 24/7, whereas Petron and Shell close after a certain hour.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:24:\"2018-05-13T05:31:36.517Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:18:\"Ford 95 (Fordy 95)\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV4amA0DBEOZmaYYHgCH1H4wk2YAkEoZqXafGX_8b3O6GsdlF5L=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:79:\"24 hour Gas station and Very Clean Fuel and nearby to San Clemente marketplace.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-08-21T05:24:15.172633Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Cesar Cambay\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLMMIddqbbEWVPAb28zenA2dXiEu4WWvHuQASeod-HQjdoUbw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:92:\"Cheapest petroleum products along Romulo Highway.My pitstop for filling quality diesel fuel.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2018-12-31T04:57:42.007053343Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Kjell Lautrup\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWL9MmTQcVSOrHlHZYHHvdWH2rz9lP8jO7J_xTKI0vxK8KjHLN4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:38:\"Open 24/7 fast service and nice staff.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2019-08-21T03:48:27.489030Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:9:\"Jayzen 23\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUtveGFEyA5mRiY1IOnCcfIEU1_ZwxG6c4zKr8t-s9vXcxSU6l6=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:19:\"Very clean res