ady of manaoag on 11/19/25, gas station staff are rude and they don\'t answer questions directly. eg: i was asking for the toilet passcode but they are just answering \"Walang tubig\".\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-11-26T19:56:32.261841642Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Jeremy Siador\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVCSz0lqzAzXII8hEvithqaN0yMqQC8HC6XQV316y4-zg4m8H8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:75:\"Accommodating staff, you can get your Cleanfuel VIP Card here instantly. :)\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2020-11-27T05:15:19.269429Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:6:\"Jovert\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:121:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJETn53eDE4K1a7yikO1LaAjJZv-Qp4MVrTLn4NeeZotBVzwi8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:52:\"Not so friendly, need membership card to use the CR.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-01-13T09:02:12.211199539Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Johan Nitura\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWIPfRISxtytGr3XbsRCFTCy6K1h1oJzDiFYCSPNkwDq4nQXyXk=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:260:\"Prior to entering Binalonan Toll Gate, better get your gas here because if your heading to Manila the next gas station will be in Tarlac (Petron Km.134 TPLEX) which is during these days are sometimes congested. Parking is also spacious and staff are courteous.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2022-01-04T05:05:44.926811Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:9;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJpbrw2IrgkzMRTSx0BRlFXzg\";s:4:\"name\";s:30:\"Petron Tobuan Gasoline Station\";s:3:\"lat\";d:16.0582331;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.1100683;s:7:\"address\";s:70:\"Olongapo - Bugallon Rd, Tobuan, Labrador, 2402 Pangasinan, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s: