 place to stop and refresh before continuing the journey home. Highly recommended!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-12-24T02:04:02.927034946Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"Odilon Relucio\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUJyl-GzKJsiYsClcyLy_kN_1sjkWY3itXJ0fpI6AfPHgPoPSTuhQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:82:\"Service is okay. There is restroom in the vicinity but is paid for minimal amount.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-05-08T07:13:09.411179Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"Eric Gutierrez\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU0cZ4Tkyf0zptRSbxnwkMkkcP-gfroC7bIcnPQtolsJsbc08Z7=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:28:\"with CR and cold water store\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-04-02T02:34:04.945603Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Suiram Travel\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWvAz_KwzeJlRHZmpEoXElJu7_2O44Ga8JMzMt4YYxVFJ-46S8PvA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba8\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:13:\"Great service\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:24:\"2016-12-11T14:01:06.867Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Gerardo Labay\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVDtjGDudnMLA4LE8iaMUDI6n5p2vsUYSOkfIdpKteRYs8F5LjZ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:3;s:4:\"text\";s:4:\"Okay\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2022-08-07T15:18:09.124436Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:17;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJX6c3dQI4kTMRwPbCQF5fFLw\";s:4:\"name\";s:26:\"San Pedro Ili Pump Station\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.8448596;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.53512570000001;s:7:\"address\";s:71:\"RGVP+W3R, San Felipe - Mangandingay Rd, Alcala, Pangasinan, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:11:\"gas-station\";s:6: