SwX7F24XZcosetF1AR0JQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:291:\"Relatively low-priced for the surrounding areas. Good place to get gas and stretch your legs on a long trip.\n\nBathrooms are kept tidy, and are stocked with toilet paper and hand soap. There is a P5/P10 fee to use the bathroom, using an honesty system.  Don\'t be a cheapskate and pay the fee.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-03-06T04:13:14.722710Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:17:\"Hector Villanueva\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:118:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI7BVruIR7MExdagftXVvrNIFiX1qu9E_ngxXhrLUkU1CiK=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:179:\"The facilities are well kept and relatively tidy.  Gas price was relatively cheap as well. Friendly staff, and not that crowded giving the place a pleasant air when we were there.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2022-09-11T16:45:02.237086Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:11:\"Per Castell\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXd-HihNKnzvo_md9ATAgBRmsN-6KslwuF3ok7680cviFVHfKGd5g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:118:\"We stopped to visit the toilet. These were clean and nice and everything works cost 5 php. Thanks for the cleanliness.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-02-03T10:55:56.224297Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Tata Naloisap\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX9C3pXbnSQpygDTuYf0oluiYjYlXdoQJXGMnb8jay3cEL5rmQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:80:\"The staff was quite accommodating. Petron\'s parking lot is located near the sea.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2025-02-24T18:08:53.507529Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Reymus Pambid\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWIj8-Z3Aio8sjHwwVt5aspzwUV7Xm9wk1y_5fTZ8JX2o4_z4U=s128-c0x00