 by Petron Tubuan in Labrador, Pangasinan on our way home from a holiday trip and decided to stop for fuel and to use the washroom. It was a very pleasant experience. The staff were accommodating and polite, and the station was clean and well-organized. The washroom was especially clean and well maintained, which we truly appreciated after a long drive. Fuel service was fast and efficient, making our stop quick and convenient. A great place to stop and refresh before continuing the journey home. Highly recommended!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-12-24T02:04:02.927034946Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"Odilon Relucio\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUJyl-GzKJsiYsClcyLy_kN_1sjkWY3itXJ0fpI6AfPHgPoPSTuhQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:82:\"Service is okay. There is restroom in the vicinity but is paid for minimal amount.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-05-08T07:13:09.411179Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"Eric Gutierrez\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU0cZ4Tkyf0zptRSbxnwkMkkcP-gfroC7bIcnPQtolsJsbc08Z7=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:28:\"with CR and cold water store\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-04-02T02:34:04.945603Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Suiram Travel\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWvAz_KwzeJlRHZmpEoXElJu7_2O44Ga8JMzMt4YYxVFJ-46S8PvA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba8\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:13:\"Great service\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:24:\"2016-12-11T14:01:06.867Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Gerardo Labay\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVDtjGDudnMLA4LE8iaMUDI6n5p2vsUYSOkfIdpKteRYs8F5LjZ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:3;s:4:\"text\";s:4:\"Okay\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2022-08-07T15:18:09.1244