2:\"reviews_data\";a:5:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:6:\"Lia_ph\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUM1DEUsCHLj9UW4LQdmBQBjQya_B_X1VHoiOdnl6jyNOUf5Po=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba7\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:495:\"This complex is very convenient. It has a gas station, air for tires, conveniences stores (711 and Korean mart), restaurant, cafe, restroom, and Ibay\'s silver shop.\n\nWe stopped at this station to eat dinner, grab some coffee, and get air for the tires before we ente4r TPLEX. The air is free even if you don\'t get diesel here. The restaurant and cafe were good. You can buy local La Union Products in Kayu. It\'s always a good choice to check Ibay\'s store for a good deal on their silver jewelry.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-07-16T00:23:47.270315331Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:5:\"Jolly\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUZkmdnZwoA5U-7eu94lCJyQvZKRRJtVGjXJ8T5hhuNyt6GaRu6kw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:14:\"Cheaper diesel\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-01-02T10:59:13.072438Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Chris Francis\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWJbtbNnbzvZ6UptmGKawMT82_QHHLgDg0AsHrfkiyHj4I4u7E=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:14:\"Clean restroom\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-08-20T18:09:56.051351800Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:19:\"Simon Pavel Miranda\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXfAYiwCvzkOrk0Zw7IzhDfuGmVlYf2lmwNTbQLdXCHPD_04SJy1Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba8\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:45:\"The staff is friendly..attentive..love the cr\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-11-25T13:16:48.987703Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:11:\"Adam Bardon\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV