9T12:32:23.161271Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Benedict Acuña\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWqN4lJCjphxMqWERY-3WjbGnKCtBZx1hWrfyXKt2E1R7qBjV8J=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:3;s:4:\"text\";s:196:\"They do not accept credit card here. But at least they prices are lower than others.\nFacilities needs improvement. Using the C.R. is not free. I guess it isn\'t part of their social responsibility.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-03-11T16:04:57.319789Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:18:\"Apolinario Pascual\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWIJC1LSn6_QCeg_PKAv6Ar37rOeowljUKA2Xm7xc5xkZ-dOTAC=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:129:\"With well maintained restroom , convenient 24/7 petron station Infront of police outpost going up to sto Tomas and Balacbac areas\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-10-01T07:54:23.475757Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:2;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJtW7PdyR1kTMR_Zxj_Dn6U5A\";s:4:\"name\";s:43:\"Star Fuel Gasoline Station (Ambalite, Pugo)\";s:3:\"lat\";d:16.2968372;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.4767827;s:7:\"address\";s:42:\"7FWG+PPM, Pugo, 2508 La Union, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:11:\"gas-station\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.2;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:26;s:7:\"reviews\";i:26;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:494:\"places/ChIJtW7PdyR1kTMR_Zxj_Dn6U5A/photos/AVoNoXRqS5PbCKxXMguwVqFspTuP9o-QKg2AR9JWuj7a4EtGupNXqXrUMcWhD2eINNMjMbM3po6iv8Hmqjax_wjN2WpknfVf55ciZ0vsPNufggsTgEdRxCaGOk-OQGnhyLupEMaF1AKFGy72AR0Q4iyCeHUpfZ607DDUIcvS6rZHSl51xaGkXqKPdcLTbO2I_bqXcRtyPmmJzrsh3aKxk4Poc83LPSXyxy8YsvVEmpUTuZY4a4xTIcMCZAirJV3_GNYABCxBTrs-ajPzj_W0_fKJtGVlwxvi8tSDncZsnqb7Nb1N8i14bSM1TqAM5b9AcglqANOOFADW0fTXY2U5BFGfHhk3pfcSGfQGDLQja82XWax8-XYXj84vW-JNnmQNx7Djka2Lx2qoKzyEaxmLYXPKqej5_rnn-mLcMJlxJ3hSbWlpDYsD-X