views_data\";a:5:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:8:\"Randy Yu\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLsMA5iQiWDa7e2KVZZYyWPqVrRdKkINakQ2ee0GJ4YmLUVA4mV=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:297:\"Modern design and one of the stations you can drop by going to and from baguio.  Baguio fuel prices are much more expensive.  Make sure to stop over fill your tanks here.\n\nAdequate restroom facilities.\n\nThere are also some local folks selling onions, garlic, ginger. Let\'s patronize and buy local.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-05-27T07:32:02.430400375Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Jaja Lorenzo\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIDK-T9FfLmZEuW_l049UdwygdppD4IXBm5QI051Dm3EMsHPw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:183:\"Van drivers get their fuel here because its price is lower than the others. The male restroom is clean but has only one functioning urinal. The female restroom\'s toilet doesn\'t flush.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2022-11-13T10:20:41.498163Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Bella Ballon\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVmd6zcc5J5URCZY2FHaOVG1RQpzJ5QenExK3QEbFGKUwGMx6c2=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\";s:6:\"rating\";i:3;s:4:\"text\";s:163:\"Faucet at the women\'s toilet sink is not working. The cubicle door won\'t lock.\nOn the positive side, Ben\'s Halo Halo Ice Cream opened a branch here in early March.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-04-02T11:24:36.699346637Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Raphael Navarro\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV2-Sxs5_ru77ivpzuFPybbCZ2XparFlj2BO9hDGi8TuOab0Bc=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba8\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:90:\"The newly opened Uno Fuel in Rosario, La Union.\nGreat for restroom stops and cheap fuels..\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2022-01-04T08:56:03.937851Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"nica literato\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUyGnJCWidSwtmYmcGnGt81ym4VSkrjDT3gmgWwKWN-g2S4co3W=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:352:\"This is a good restroom stop, especially since this is the last gas station that you can stop by when going south to TPLEX. But they only have one functioning restroom, so everyone would use the female restroom. The price of their fuel is lower compared to other gas stations around the province, so make sure you have your gas here before going north.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-05-16T14:54:13.006760Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:13;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJg2ZbVgFzkTMR3Lwkl0vgzW4\";s:4:\"name\";s:17:\"Nedu Fuel Station\";s:3:\"lat\";d:16.2349695;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.48746170000001;s:7:\"address\";s:59:\"6FMP+XXP, Pugo - Rosario Rd, Rosario, La Union, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:11:\"gas-station\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:6;s:7:\"reviews\";i:6;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:476:\"places/ChIJg2ZbVgFzkTMR3Lwkl0vgzW4/photos/AVoNoXRDooT0s-Hi9DWooNqoo1lmaXPGHjr2ESlUuobbwrXGqspt1Y7By_F4EUaZUKgAcCy4_gVJAZ2m6OkmfrjuYNtDsAaZZQVxG3fXGMJuJxIec3edNeHZCC0BZQxzanoAxufWTn4rsKYU5sGHTlo5_H-PCp-SVT2QDjNsxY9Hd6tOa4RIcrjjJZLsLwl1BGhr0rUi2ChjlaSV7U-PCgmA_OOygEsIwhCqG72vjWxEVkg-GsGjqj34xKmIRhGiD3DqWZHyf1FbPBKm2UkrzIj4G6uAuXAPIo2A80AzOyi2yEnsWPluqSdQswLrmwp6jnYWqq-uE-XYPpeLt-mVW7f8HAbxwRVghslnK_ntrK1mJATKAKVzl-owAIh4Ct2o54TX1idRtKPPNOu1cxxaZg8tQOlBNCeQjE2oDMaNriqzwaIi9w\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:3:{i:0;s:476:\"places/ChIJg2ZbVgFzkTMR3Lwkl0vgzW4/photos/AVoNoXRDooT0s-Hi9DWooNqoo1lmaXPGHjr2ESlUuobbwrXGqspt1Y7By_F4EUaZUKgAcCy4_gVJAZ2m6OkmfrjuYNtDsAaZZQVxG3fXGMJuJxIec3edNeHZCC0BZQxzanoAxufWTn4rsKYU5sGHTlo5_H-PCp-SVT2QDjNsxY9Hd6tOa4RIcrjjJZLsLwl1BGhr0rUi2ChjlaSV7U-PCgmA_OOygE