and the variety of local eateries and food stalls surrounding the area. It’s a great spot to take a break, stretch your legs, and grab a quick meal before getting back on the road — definitely a plus for long drives.\n\nThe only downside is that restroom access is limited to Clean Fuel card members, which can be a bit inconvenient for non-members. For a major highway stop, it would be more traveler-friendly if basic facilities were open to everyone.\n\nOverall: A clean, spacious, and reliable station with excellent service and convenient nearby dining options. If not for the restroom restriction, it would easily be a top-rated stop along TPLEX.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-10-29T11:44:27.433038660Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Marc Jimenez\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV6hmLGEhPgJ_LScXBzsk1vagUWhEP0MqelZ40M5NpfeVDJCMHg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba7\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:224:\"The washroom is clean, but you need a receipt to access it. There\'s Shakeys, Tapa King, and other food options (we went here at 6:30am, but they are closed).  The only open establishment here at that time is the korean mart.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-02-23T22:30:03.091978Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Jeffrey Ramirez\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWgrzqiDurXZjgWfosNQJPBmL_qEyaF6AszO28VGq3aeMl-MtlJEQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:132:\"Almost complete amenities after Tplex exit.\nBest Stop Over place to meet up after a long drive .\nMany options for restaurant at site\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-01-11T10:54:59.287860Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:6:\"T. Ang\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVK8ALQcLHHv7YedZ-7kjbEhyEfjSEQYHWthNAIMG_X8Jrewe7JAg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:140:\"Restrooms were in a really bad state during our visit, plus only Clean Fuel card members can use it. Men\'s room faucets weren\'t even working\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2022-05-16T03:33:51.155908Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"Carlos Cestona\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVwlghucQlYn8QJP7hvq-AY39J6GqC7sS6jMYrM6RPpyGcEwflZ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:80:\"Amenities such as clean toilets and affordable fuel rates with spacious parking.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-07-18T09:50:13.380466743Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:16;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJp_cx-HVzkTMR_ycEUAhhcBY\";s:4:\"name\";s:14:\"Unioil Rosario\";s:3:\"lat\";d:16.2274682;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.49568989999999;s:7:\"address\";s:63:\"Pugo - Rosario Rd, Subusub, Rosario, 2506 La Union, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:11:\"gas-station\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.4;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:11;s:7:\"reviews\";i:11;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:476:\"places/ChIJp_cx-HVzkTMR_ycEUAhhcBY/photos/AVoNoXT_KUsi05znr70KhZHfomn5uETDXMDY0IehB2MGMYbrmRGsCQF5UXJ4_Yb4F1r56LnBjwrMwurD72xiXGiriM27lyMT6oZTVBer8cGkOYRodh7cyECllTji_wu8lL8kdBt5RN-Y_b6XCs38ZXoACO-fsov_81sCTOBMwYoyGr-H6SkiM_tYdX5rqp1_-h7oRLqsGhangM1_A-U8n26brs1fdqoAA23uDkJ6kTHEUN3L7tt_MjCzojzfnMDllw6-1LJdVInFbhMv3KGDCgH56Te1bnfuSRxDEgKkUjb2Gjv0IfLxPj05K-ncs8kNS2fDDD0K0YwasNeUH0c52Fz94BbPgxrnNjYKhIe8k-xnEcveRxau9RtWmoR0q_CT41dIYXhyPJgsMktCpuoe7B71rX_6Ei3zF-ZjMos7IdtBJrXNxw\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:2:{i:0;s:476:\"places/ChIJp_cx-HVzkTMR_ycEUAhhcBY/photos/AVoNoXT_KUsi05znr70KhZHfomn5uETDXMDY0IehB2MGMYbrmRGsCQF5UXJ4_Yb4F1r56LnBjwrMwurD72xiXGiriM27lyMT6oZTVBer8cGkOYRodh7cyECllTji_wu8lL8kdBt5RN-Y_b6XCs38ZXoACO-fsov_81sCTOBMwYoyGr-H6SkiM_tYdX5rqp1_-h7oRLqsGhangM1_A-U8n26brs1fdqoAA23uDkJ6kTHEUN3L7tt_MjCzojzfnMDllw6-1LJdVInFbhMv3KGDCgH56Te1bnfuSRxDEgKkUjb2Gjv0IfLxPj05K-ncs8kNS2fDDD0K0Y