DzjhcQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba8\";s:6:\"rating\";i:3;s:4:\"text\";s:298:\"This branch of the Philippines fuel chain petron offers several variants of gasoline as well as diesel fuel. They don\'t have blaze though and they accept credit cards. This branch also has a convenience store as well as a public pay toilet. Don\'t expect fast service as they are usually undermanned\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2025-01-12T11:06:41.536413Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"Jericho Saddul\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUQVzP6T7yaHTyo5GCIJBrEGWgoU2iYI0hq95hduXjkJFdSw7E0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:76:\"Prepare cash payment since they don’t have credit card as mode of payment.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-09-28T10:56:47.582770619Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:5:\"Hausi\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXdChJ3yMUqgvEd-nMW7zpWRjgR3JrajHX8LkAN3AYE72xbncSyfA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:270:\"Fuel prices are seemingly cheapers than other Petron branches. Credit card however is not readily available for used during the time of visit. Place and location is also well maintaine as well as the restrooms. Crew was also polite and ready to to assist each customers.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-03-29T12:32:23.161271Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Benedict Acuña\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWqN4lJCjphxMqWERY-3WjbGnKCtBZx1hWrfyXKt2E1R7qBjV8J=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:3;s:4:\"text\";s:196:\"They do not accept credit card here. But at least they prices are lower than others.\nFacilities needs improvement. Using the C.R. is not free. I guess it isn\'t part of their social responsibility.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-03-11T16:04:57.319789Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"aut