09T07:45:27.656551834Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:4:\"HABD\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVAUEazpJuYbaum16GXxvxlSkk-xp-Ot4Lmc6tG4HNmWJZsxfzUTg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:3;s:4:\"text\";s:306:\"It’s quite nice here especially they have different shops like flowers and plants, restaurants and atm machines. Also they have a clinic where you can get your swab testing. But this is somewhat private because you’ll need a community car sticker to enter esp if you’re coming from the circle.(south)\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2021-09-14T00:13:41.469541Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Chieza Casupang\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUZFesNPszqczmKTNt9xPOFLRhWgPZjetnnE4bIh-mrEFnI8Bf9yQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:62:\"Good place to rest and unwind after a good run around the area\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-04-12T05:15:40.191519877Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"chito sunday\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWh7JpUYpzj86KHtcN2WuIWVmc3j3Qf5kFgwQDStxmcdYKqWy4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:59:\"The area is cool even during hot weather. Perfect to relax.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-05-10T00:18:09.911623998Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"Ayen Pitallano\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:116:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK8bk2zVKhvZ5imC_As3LSHVUOibweZZ2ff1fzGu8Sj_QufTw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:64:\"Relaxing hide-out place:)\nNot crowded and affordable yummy foods\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-01-01T12:56:39.451678Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:2;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJMWuA1we3lzMRCHDXFMUtK1U\";s:4:\"name\";s:13:\"Auto Junction\";s:3:\"lat\";