leusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWNk8Z36jlmI5YeEvQF2iI8iRNHzURhnjra6AvBSjkEnl6Uzmw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:2;s:4:\"text\";s:280:\"I\'m not sure why but i wanted to try a coffee for the first time, so i ordered a coffee and after i drink the coffee.. it was very strong and i didn\'t feel well after hours later.. The food was okay, at least..\n\nI\'m still awake somehow, i couldn\'t sleep because i don\'t know why..\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-11-14T17:32:48.597227296Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:8:\"Artsy TK\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:116:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL-xoaUzGS8_gEUy29yfWcPABaI9Wy_7joLYZ9CcduIy-L4Jg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:2;s:4:\"text\";s:542:\"We went to Mang Chaa for brunch, but I was disappointed with the service. I ordered the choco malt milk tea and didn\'t like the taste; it was too bland compared to what I had before. At first, they forgot to add pearls, so I had to ask for them separately. Even after adding them, the drink was still too bland and tasted horrible. It felt like water with tasteless powder. They need to improve on that. Besides that, there were no available seats. It seems like they prioritize students loitering without orders over actual paying customers.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-05-03T04:20:07.917310Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Jay Lander Luna\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:118:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWpe02EmA85he0BbY_b-VUB_LggtsL_1eofPN1r2D6uuxGczwU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:3;s:4:\"text\";s:95:\"Best time to unwind and eenjoy the shop is around 6pm until closing time, peaceful and relaxing\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2022-11-29T17:20:04.246913Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:17:\"Gethsemani Pascua\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWddcffkQEu7lHTtrUZoKFoKwdy1rTFDfJdzfJ-veazUBx1HkXBKQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:72:\"Pros: Aesthetic design.\n\nCons: Probably not a place to hang out at noon.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-11-27T12:01:38.448664Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}}',1788849224),('laravel-cache-rapidapi_search_f583a375cf46feea5a0d338fc011c3a4_15.713_120.359','a:0:{}',1789708063),('laravel-cache-rapidapi_search_f92687e65b96fab0af47b93e4f16e479_15.712_120.368','a:10:{i:0;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJv1rpmNO9ljMRPMaSFnnYfN4\";s:4:\"name\";s:29:\"Sitio Baag View Deck Jump Off\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.394879399999999;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.3981443;s:7:\"address\";s:60:\"Baag Spot, Barangay, 99VW+WR4, San Jose, Tarlac, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:8:\"landmark\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.7;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:243;s:7:\"reviews\";i:243;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:478:\"places/ChIJv1rpmNO9ljMRPMaSFnnYfN4/photos/AVoNoXR40bYcM29bgHR4R6tZ7h34CpC8MfXwmiBcM6l3YRH0DI7DcK0dB5LosISxWl3BJBWnBE5eSMroNcGF7tCDNW0_vgDLA5MeAPs1EJYZGObvaJR658xBIaKHPJ3bQdjEBal_Drp9Swkjq9AEji6NE0G-mkg4w19jzSxd-A2bI7EnuZeXMA6MDXgiS9cl3h5qK5bz_U-c-oBuWaHua4V5QF7JdZvRSAXlS-uXFcG25C6KBHbGokFAHGC3QRTRnZ0dh1TuwLb8byqw3OMdk52-1SvcPUmpoQSiN-HApBatgiKwBe5mFMCPfKuuGCOgFz000mdEuOhNGdd-Qf8OSLutXU0eSDh2Wl1ois-oM4zVxhgp1nsAF98xWJpW3Srlsq4KuWkI9Bb3BbegcrxdnbOZJKpyXJ48l2rwzZdl35aBkH5AdkTI\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:6:{i:0;s:478:\"places/ChIJv1rpmNO9ljMRPMaSFnnYfN4/photos/AVoNoXR40bYcM29bgHR4R6tZ7h34CpC8MfXwmiBcM6l3YRH0DI7DcK0dB5LosISxWl3BJBWnBE5eSMroNcGF7tCDNW0_vgDLA5MeAPs1EJYZGObvaJR658xBIaKHPJ3bQdjEBal_Drp9Swkjq9AEji6NE0G-mkg4w19jzSxd-A2bI7EnuZeXMA6MDXgiS9cl3h5qK5bz_U-c-oBuWaHua4V5QF7JdZvRSAXlS-uXFcG25C6KBHbGokFAHGC3QRTRnZ0dh1TuwLb8byqw3OMdk52-1SvcPUmpoQSiN-HApBatgiKwBe5mFMCPfKuuGCOgFz000mdEuOhNGdd-Qf8OSLutXU0eSDh2Wl1ois-oM4zVxhgp1nsAF98xWJpW3Srlsq4KuWkI9Bb3BbegcrxdnbOZJKpyXJ48l2rwzZdl35aBkH5AdkTI\";i:1;s:478:\"places/ChIJv1rpmNO9ljMRPMaSFnnYfN4/photos/AVoNoXTdRHkIR45AJVexkhdCcLH9lThtbSZr7Be08R