wajYXtGo9kum6esfIxj1OxDmX71NCvi8EgityjiJjw1POjQPp9ifPzoEvUrLHiTN4nkeLLGF6gK0rN4T09Rg022kDUf3qJp3Qg\";}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:5:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:9:\"DenLyn TV\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWttZCpOO0ICYjDTItlfqMaKm9cj17ZSwqzwHUn7Ft4hweFQF29=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:288:\"as of july 3 2026 this viewdeck is very good now and the area is more cleaner and more atrractive after the renovation.  this place is so relaxing watching sunset and at night you will see the city lights of tarlac and pampanga. be careful walking to the 100meter+ steep climb to the top.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-07-04T12:07:48.157510976Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:6:\"Regine\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:121:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLyACix9E3SI7nnXcIJlzOt3MbCKZ9WleM4qFbcuP4AFj0huno=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:233:\"I was captivated by the stunning views at View Deck At Sitio Baag! ? The landscape is breathtaking, especially during sunset. It\'s truly a must-see spot for anyone looking for natural beauty. ? Highly recommend a visit! ✨?\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-02-08T05:19:05.049326229Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:10:\"Dave Inman\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXD4RWPsYOKkwKZNrMpQ6fcs2vKD1W0_dud-tUcp86mVnwHqsow3g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:96:\"Very unique place, awesome views.\n\nWalkable for most, but could be extreme from some to walk up.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-06-17T13:36:37.328813595Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:7:\"Jalapao\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVzewU59ixmZl9sDsHDvzWgPJ0lmEnYlSgAolFjC1L59pp3eQ4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:240:\"The path to the viewdeck was lovely; as you travel, you\'ll fall in love with the surroundings. From the viewdeck, you\'ll see the rolling hills leading down to the flatlands. I especially love the spectacular 360-degree views from this deck.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-12-02T12:30:04.663772409Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:29:\"Roselle Julian-Andres (Selle)\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUwZGvX-KjpwXkGm7boY7duv1iqy7SAMAIz6eyZ5d2Pp_Id2_Vz=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:172:\"Nice place to visit with panoramic views. Great for photography and nature with a relaxing vibe. Best time to visit early morning or late afternoon for golden-hour lighting\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-01-06T14:39:58.455483545Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:2;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJs5ueDY69ljMRmG1iPcT2WT0\";s:4:\"name\";s:9:\"Baag Spot\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.3946615;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.3960203;s:7:\"address\";s:49:\"Barangay, 99VW+VC6, San Jose, Tarlac, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:5:\"hotel\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.7;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:20;s:7:\"reviews\";i:20;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:477:\"places/ChIJs5ueDY69ljMRmG1iPcT2WT0/photos/AVoNoXSwC-ru4tCeOZrtu2HFA_5Armd6Y7URId60WRLGBCZD_lCeuqBfoZTffwKkZq3zPXE4O2HTrpe9u-m0y7xgjKYkmztmJTPf08O0MvHYqFqvncLYUwGDy_CROPtihprhXJ3YRXtLQ8e5f0573ZRiiZdKU2v_iU_Eyc0KcKwTcKGdu9StmRRakUWXMAdSupgk0AGR1PO3o9vDTAnTQWc3ZscR7EEUavBgNa3XA6NRS34Fl-U8qE719xAusyeOiVJGKcAJVhSaxCzDGxN3iwUhqII8LMbZjfLwu90274yrhhxr43S_cQt7Nc2wM_hJw6ZRxNqeQcAxglHrp2Q4CRLcbARy_W473fH4W-LGoQQbBJZ9ugRubouo8nQ1gzrmYVK9ILHSYmHrU-yi1YTnI7ZoMt0SjgAcPGdS-qmdFQ--QFgBTaU\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:6:{i:0;s:477:\"places/ChIJs5ueDY69ljMRmG1iPcT2WT0/photos/AVoNoXSwC-ru4tCeOZrtu2HFA_5Armd6Y7URId60WRLGBCZD_lCeuqBfoZTffwKkZq3zPXE4O2HTrpe9u-m0y7xgjKYkmztmJTPf08O0MvHYqFqvncLYUwGDy_CROPtihprhXJ3YRXtLQ8e5f0573ZRiiZdKU2v_iU_Eyc0KcKwTcKGdu9StmRRakUWXMAdSupgk0AGR1P