l and please DO NOT LEAVE your GARBAGE rather bring it with you!\n\nPlease TAKE NOTE that there’s an Environmental Fee of 20php prior entering the vicinity of Sitio Baag. (Might change without prior notice)\n\n#tourism\n#supportlocal\n#tarlactourism\n#sanjosetarlac\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2022-01-21T00:37:09.181481Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:21:\"john roger cabacungan\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKyJq6JnPitKfHAlOyiM40wSEj5XviqMXs4rfVewvXiHpvH5JC3=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:30:\"Good Food\nMust try silog meals\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2025-04-14T14:06:59.028131Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:1:\"G\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXaWpeQxaog0rm-s3AD3NnemiYyinws62n6NytAXB6q8HqxHLCP=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:11:\"Camping?\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-11-19T07:50:42.778930778Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:6;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJCzCVkB29ljMRfhRDTT8VK0o\";s:4:\"name\";s:12:\"Cafétana PH\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.3936417;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.39588349999998;s:7:\"address\";s:45:\"Sitio Baag N/A, San Jose, Tarlac, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:10:\"restaurant\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.5;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:95;s:7:\"reviews\";i:95;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:473:\"places/ChIJCzCVkB29ljMRfhRDTT8VK0o/photos/AVoNoXR-tLcGYZSZkoj6Vh_2shmvqQkWRid_sYMZ3wYkGeTXgV4Uxt6BIa6j_gAQ9biy4kx7tdwsQoc9NBuQszscNgEQBLdN6hmxKTCzM5R64gcZJFFluK7ozGOP9DtvMsU4qRmt1F6eItKofv9uQKjk0KZlCusEoE7ZadLH2vbSN-PSHxrSvk0VxaAlMwdIANsHzJT3ueoEYTnrtuqiYU0taCbLoectzEDRb4DbSntvzskKJn8B7viBLxNNhKaTWgfldi5L8B4o5S_aeWi_4qzGHULi3hvJgpPiTAJ4p9CQP04uXNDvNXaiDoqiMbFWzQmTDLetCxnqU45Vhr8rLk0YBoMjWu65W5-tiGAb3PrH-e9FervRmg00BpvbxocJLNhcVKhYesazjHNB2qxJL2b3JqmmLm2jothWWmJwtbE750U\";s:16:\"photo_references\