/a/ACg8ocJUzmKbqPFjkWCw1Rcg12c8OL8Qz91OWdAtS6Tgp22cZf_iz1w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:198:\"The people are very kind, and the place is so calm.\n\nFor the food, It\'s okay, not bad for it price.\n\nBut they also has an entrance fee 50₱ per person. But no parking lot, it\'s only in the outside.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-07-14T18:46:55.921352391Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:3:\"K J\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:121:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIwPnBe1ki_vtBuOs8RxgI2qpOLOV-n7aRj9V43UMJ_i39hTXc=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:352:\"A naturesque café in Sitio Baag , San Jose, Tarlac. It’s overlooking view plus good cup of hot batirol (product of Sitio baag).\n\nPeople flock here to see the sunrise or sunset view.\n\nThe calming view + love ones = awesome memories.\n\nPrior entering the place - the people of this Sitio may ask for entrance fee.\n\nThe view deck is also near this cafe.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2025-03-23T05:29:14.497781Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:5:\"KIV S\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVZbInfTG7mzN1M7BoaFHRCiW98UcMIcMzoaHDkS6-SAMqdyOU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:172:\"Awesome road and view of the Tarlac hills! Foods’ tastes nice, though I thought the portion is a little less than expected. The taokolate de batirol is phenomenally good!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-07-02T01:17:55.240533531Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:7:\"Joaquin\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW_lDs_m3AS_twrYefzbXTnx0bDuR3TR7PcUtjGfC9f61dPDV4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:149:\"Food’s taste is decent. Serving is just right for the price. View is astonishing. Calm and peaceful vibes. Definitely will go back for city escape.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-02-03T13:16:48.893354995Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:7;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJT-HDBAC9ljMRkV4gwJF6ngU\";s:4:\"name\";s:10:\"Baag Route\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.399357600000002;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.3972656;s:7:\"address\";s:46:\"Sitio San Pedro, San Jose, Tarlac, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:3:\"poi\";s:6:\"rating\";N;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:0;s:7:\"reviews\";i:0;s:15:\"photo_reference\";N;s:16:\"photo_references\";a:0:{}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:0:{}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:8;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJ7VAX5GSvljMRNKaGfIechEI\";s:4:\"name\";s:20:\"Dueg-Kapya Ken Talna\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.626730700000001;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.28879189999998;s:7:\"address\";s:69:\"Sitio Dueg Barangay, J7GQ+MGV, San Clemente, 2304 Tarlac, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:8:\"landmark\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.8;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:222;s:7:\"reviews\";i:222;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:478:\"places/ChIJ7VAX5GSvljMRNKaGfIechEI/photos/AVoNoXTVQB0zA4j-WkYZ0rokiu6d3T3b_rk4gnZ6xiZXtvtPSM5Een9RHTF0Wmfq-1aPUQTGz7N6JVe119dXzmBvcvmM-tUYM7hnqE95yKXSLLTNCvUQGgniGHZQ1oaRp3qGU1YXiRoIVkhx7jWjtrgUTnA2A7z_eVk9BHlnkTJyt5tnEgDdcoWVgbyB1hUotxBRZ-_pyjz4nLMu7rs7F7pYLYOkdk219DlkEZyiG52RA0UVFV_rt4YwZ6rkit-rGklfZdSUuXFFaby0zLG7AQW9fJjV3E7EEQbSzFsTyZGKrIKB3qtNpPPNYiOy026vhob3QVzT9gF1Io6HBeHSlfjrPO7OvHfwjbpsoDtlbmudpVib4LRLDYRLtpLzqpfJkGPa6a2I5flOic5Eo5qGu3PlSIFJ8r4Fh8K6eWkOMC3hRV4m7-ci\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:6:{i:0;s:478:\"places/ChIJ7VAX5GSvljMRNKaGfIechEI/photos/AVoNoXTVQB0zA4j-WkYZ0rokiu6d3T3b_rk4gnZ6xiZXtvtPSM5Een9RHTF0Wmfq-1aPUQTGz7N6JVe119dXzmBvcvmM-tUYM7hnqE95yKXSLLTNCvUQGgniGHZQ1oaRp3qGU1YXiRoIVkhx7jWjtrgUTnA2A7z_eVk9BHlnkTJyt5tnEgDdcoWVgbyB1hUotxBRZ-_pyjz4nLMu7rs7F7pYLYOkdk219DlkEZyiG52RA0UVFV_rt4YwZ6rkit-rGklfZdSUuXFFaby0zLG7AQW9fJjV3E7EEQbSzFsTyZGKrIKB3qtNpPPNYiOy026vhob3QVzT9gF1Io6HBeHSlfjrPO7OvHfwjbpsoDtlbmudpVib4LRLDYRLtpLzqpfJk