zOCT5qyEcUEvurI\";i:5;s:476:\"places/ChIJ7VAX5GSvljMRNKaGfIechEI/photos/AVoNoXR9-K6_f_8hBy_jsATL4ItZ-RQyWPQvUv-MTh4zbDfbAvpYI65dgzANWetw5jBtSgoT1W6I97vjnf7qCuir1lfNghyls4QP5wurigLvozXIuj7vlASUBgEtd_sPW_uON0pknwfn_qEMJ3QrwMt4_EmxEpbZLSk1u9UoS2OpyXOgcAXrtDxUj7KleTR8kSYQHcH--qrzNjs4CnU1Gv2cmN3UjeaZjgu-psaLgtb0dSdm_9EZC_rB7_BzPhGqbdOwSwbdS4oLIGOyEbUnNs9fFYMxqZDIWU-3SIQJSln6yRWd_m6UBVNWPhjsh2YHrF7JF1XJ2NRydnIeGFD5n1-zjhVKnjThR5K1XBgtmv8ADkS0QacpiwwTVcP19W0vZV30BLSlQs0nMuMicfEPO82Kqbvl3QHm7Fv9TjQw_xPfmigOpA\";}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:5:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:24:\"christian aquino (Kyosu)\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWcbvyoIa4SUkIRoP-y9AnMN3t5lkrQCiAYj-jN-SnWgcrNISGY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:456:\"Found peace in the hills of Tarlac ?\nDueg Kapya Ken Talna — where kapya means peace and talna means calm.\nExactly what my soul needed ?\n\n? Dueg Kapya Ken Talna in San Clemente, Tarlac is a hidden gem surrounded by mountains, cool breeze, and total serenity. Perfect for a quick day trip or chill weekend escape. ?\n\n✅ Panoramic mountain views\n✅ Quiet and peaceful atmosphere\n✅ Great for sunrise/sunset photos\n\nTip: The road can get rough\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-11-04T13:34:35.738488778Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Samson Pascua\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVZtrU1e7X5xBFf_gAqJ_LM4CZJrDJzHx2VXPAUrUjOMlSsNSTaKQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:181:\"The view is stunningly beautiful but remote. The road is only good if it\'s dry season and rain or wetness. Some section of road is not wide enough for tw cars of opposite direction.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-03-31T02:57:00.931201364Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Aries Pascua\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV5cH2uU8Z59zEgpgeBzO4mVmHuqrqYLRwa4L_iGGOfJ7Aa9rFOLQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:55:\"Great place! I hope they add more dishes on their menu.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-05-11T06:34:42.260867918Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"JOSEL VINLUAN\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXJUKXP2XdLSrMmFJw_XPNnlCkyj2YkuSH0YOUvIwzl8OsMVrhH=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:309:\"A place where you can find peace.\nWe went there in the afternoon, they don\'t accept guests after 5 pm.\n\nBut they say the best time to go is dawn or morning, where you can watch sunrise.\nFood is not always available.\n\nCaution:  Check your vehicle\'s break first, because you\'ll encounter rough, and curve roads.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-01-06T11:49:55.932938Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:9:\"Juanderer\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWaGJjBa-04Su8Qqfik95DxAauAxoiSJcXeKPXUaM_aNrocijg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:192:\"Absolutely breathtaking view—worth every step to get here. The panoramic scenery makes the whole trip unforgettable. If you’re looking for a peaceful spot with stunning vistas, this is it.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2025-04-22T05:43:38.823926Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:9;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJxSzroFy9ljMR3eHOYh5nMUk\";s:4:\"name\";s:23:\"MCGI Sitio Baag, Tarlac\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.394893;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.3968478;s:7:\"address\";s:50:\"99VW+XP5 Sitio Baag, San Jose, Tarlac, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:3:\"poi\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:3;s:7:\"reviews\";i:3;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:476:\"places/ChIJxSzroFy9ljMR3eHOYh5nMUk/photos/AVoNoXRzVS8xnWpN5AiH0upRekBRS3qlzmVkJMBGMs6F-pH3pzuIwtdCYwZaPmecb4mq_vghs-FlxM3Q4qsNqI50idZAwVDBJ_mUZootSdc2AzRH2takYvZTeNF-9XsjYxE6