 just love it!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-09-27T23:23:39.200235798Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Jupiter Solar\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWmhkAXjkUxvkex0gWBdle9mw1IA1KkLK1Hq34i4bcTBJZI4Vo=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:790:\"A very big and beautiful place, perfect for family gatherings, weddings, and various events. There is a swimming pool, playground, court, and plenty of parking space. There is also an event venue that is perfect for weddings and special occasions.\n\nOne of my favorite things is the rooftop and 360° view deck. Since the location is uphill, the view is beautiful and the air is fresh. There are also farm animals like sheep and cows which are an added attraction especially for children.\n\nMy only suggestion would be to put up bigger signages and more direction signs because there are roads leading to the place that are still under development and a bit confusing for first-time visitors.\n\nOverall, a great destination to relax, enjoy with the family, and hold events. Highly recommended!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-06-20T11:21:53.261397053Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:5;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJZbVANeOzljMRFloUpr3x2Lc\";s:4:\"name\";s:22:\"Camiling Boundary Arch\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.632558900000001;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.4187467;s:7:\"address\";s:51:\"JCM9+2FH, Romulo Hwy, Camiling, Tarlac, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:8:\"landmark\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.4;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:23;s:7:\"reviews\";i:23;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:473:\"places/ChIJZbVANeOzljMRFloUpr3x2Lc/photos/AVoNoXQqyGEoG8VL_y3mbaSUNahHaKbeecJNMKfT9i3kBxv0B43V-yC7_pcbpI_shIZfC80wjqbGeG2OXAMMGtbQ2DP03zdBNOmBUkNgdySyW6_WurcfjT5xZy9mPlqJ1MzaZ9jcXeYW94gFWdjQw_0UT9-DMeeJObNg9IOI0HndIwjtO2h859VVXMSyj3I594ri8utt_XX5MpLNYFw1DfXwZ_1OXMeP3BmxnFbASaFfL_LRrQ2TsF9z_W28z