ent.com/a-/ALV-UjVKwqbati6nZzNZpRW0JXccaL8Xl3vytnNdy06Dk6iNvjPoIyt_=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:288:\"Very surprised to learn that Leonor Rivera was born in Camiling. I passed by this house and was amazed by the structure. It’s located in the center of the town proper close to the church. plaza, and municipio. The location suggests that the owner comes from a well off or landed family.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-04-17T14:14:44.049145358Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:9:\"MJ Buayan\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL7i2s1EPwpHH6y7mNzgAS9kFhgCjZB_GW_ej4dQ3b8CZb6RQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:504:\"This house once belonged to Leonor Rivera, the woman who could have been Mrs. José Rizal. Leonor and Rizal shared a love story that lasted for 11 years. However, Leonor’s mother disapproved of the young and outspoken Rizal, intercepting their letters and keeping them apart. Believing that José no longer loved her, Leonor was persuaded to marry an Englishman named Henry Kipping. It is said that Leonor became the inspiration for María Clara, the beloved heroine in Rizal’s novel Noli Me Tangere.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-10-31T18:15:02.667333827Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"A Google User\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:84:\"As of Mar 2022, the house is not open for public butbthe have retained the structure\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2022-03-09T11:57:01.667773Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"Riou Tolentino\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ0dJA5OzUJJX99aMtInULcUz8-a8SOg0BYtxZJr5BYk5UOSw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:25:\"Old yet it looks elegant.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2019-01-07T05:14:16.056857782Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:17:\"J