;i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:184:\"Manleluag Hot Spring offers a relaxing experience with natural hot pools, peaceful surroundings, and scenic views.\n\nWith a protected landscape, the natural resources are well preserved\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-11-05T02:31:38.666002Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:18:\"Michael Ray XzQtOr\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWsqS_UbQdtUqcRbDu9X2GOF2_4sh12rU8nd3gveC4Il6dGwj4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:171:\"No more lukewarm water from the spring. It is locked and not accesible to the public. Okay service and fair pricing for entrance fee. Maybe 20mins drive from main highway.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-03-31T10:33:39.150964063Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:17:\"Jefferson Padilla\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX8AQH8UwdvqHjX2nwVDg-9IxF_dZXLVF8JBpoGQpY-c2_en1KQ8g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:82:\"Super ganda.  You will feel the nature kasi no Internet no signal just pure nature\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-12-13T14:18:25.194986493Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:10:\"Jonats #67\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXDkWj7SbwVPNJNC7xYBj2uYS7KKNHuHYlXCDhNG1e7PqJUrsrM=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:195:\"Water is clean and warm, perfect if you are looking for a refreshing bath in a chilly weather and also during summer!\n\nPeople are disciplined with regards to their wastes, and kept the park tidy.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-04-06T07:58:21.307218Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:2;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJjXxqR7-tljMRaVkGMKxzDRs\";s:4:\"name\";s:48:\"Canding Eco-Tourism Park - Mangatarem Pangasinan\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.648990000000001;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.3157033;s:7:\"address\";s